,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T15:02:44Z","email":"develop.tkach@gmail.com","name":"Serhii Tkach"},"message":"Build SDK before shell-app to fix CI module resolution\n\nshell-app''s next build resolves @s-tkach/shell-sdk to its dist/, which is\ngitignored and absent on fresh CI checkout. The workflow went straight to\nnext build without building the workspace SDK first. Build it first, as\nthe sdk/cli workflows already do for themselves.","tree":{"sha":"5ec2ce5a16466d2a588f93d1f080d88922e4c9b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/s-tkach/corp-shell/git/trees/5ec2ce5a16466d2a588f93d1f080d88922e4c9b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/s-tkach/corp-shell/git/commits/568d95f0dd84f8a2e6d3d4831d259e4a0fa05f9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27079348?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s-tkach/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s-tkach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s-tkach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s-tkach/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/s-tkach","id":27079348,"login":"s-tkach","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDc5MzQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s-tkach/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s-tkach/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s-tkach/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s-tkach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s-tkach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/s-tkach","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/s-tkach/corp-shell/commit/568d95f0dd84f8a2e6d3d4831d259e4a0fa05f9b","node_id":"C_kwDOSfHLhNoAKDU2OGQ5NWYwZGQ4NGY4YTJlNmQzZDQ4MzFkMjU5ZTRhMGZhMDVmOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/s-tkach/corp-shell