url":"https://github.com/tmessaoudi-official","id":24722775,"login":"tmessaoudi-official","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NzIyNzc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmessaoudi-official/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmessaoudi-official/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmessaoudi-official/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmessaoudi-official/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmessaoudi-official/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmessaoudi-official","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmessaoudi-official/angular-signals-starter/commits/a7abf1d4364e159351d90ce615001932c7a0851d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:57:24Z","email":"takieddine.messaoudi.official@gmail.com","name":"Takieddine Messaoudi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T12:10:58Z","email":"takieddine.messaoudi.official@gmail.com","name":"Takieddine Messaoudi"},"message":"fix(tests): stabilise restore-on-delete-error test with MSW response delay\n\nThe optimistic removal and the rollback were completing within a single\nevent-loop tick when MSW returned 500 instantly, so waitFor() never\nobserved the intermediate absent-Alice state.  Adding a 50ms delay to\nthe DELETE error handler gives the optimistic state window that the test\nis designed to observe.","tree":{"sha":"5d5dca160dee468a7e02d8e8c5e42aa9b97eb7d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmessaoudi-official/angular-signals-starter/git/trees/5d5dca160dee468a7e02d8e8c5e42aa9b97eb7d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmessaoudi-official/angular-signals-starter/git/commits/a7abf1d4364e159351d90ce615001932c7a0851d","verification":{"payload":"tree 5d5dca160dee468a7e02d8e8c5e42aa9b97eb7d7\nparent db6c3c87584221e162800003730c88995eaa8007\nauthor Takieddine Messaoudi <takieddine.messaoudi.official@gmail.com> 1778576244 +0200\ncommitter Takieddine Messaoudi <takieddine.messaoudi.official@gmail.com> 1778933458 +0200\n\nfix(tests): stabilise restore-on-delete-error test with MSW response delay\n\nThe optimistic removal and the rollback were completing within a single\nevent-loop tick when MSW returned 500 instantly, so waitFor() never\nobserved the intermediate absent-Alice state.  Adding a 50ms delay to\nthe DELETE error handler gives the optimistic state window that the test\nis designed to observe.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQCAUaGmWAJx0GpKt8MU3aQcG639QUCaghe0gAKCRAMU3aQcG63\n9UJAAQDvq6ZbnydLkwyjQgHdkzBjJCi9xRbxYEbWJ2Wsd/B/dgEAygzrBJCMHZlC\nYA2IVUwPE63yU9ZgHOXyBN7Ifl22Tww=\n=rYcw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-16T12:35:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24722775?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmessaoudi-official/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmessaoudi-official/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmessaoudi-official/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmessaoudi-official/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tmessaoudi-official","id":24722775,"login":"tmessaoudi-official","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NzIyNzc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmessaoudi-official/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmessaoudi-official/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmessaoudi-official/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmessaoudi-official/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmessaoudi-official/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmessaoudi-official","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tmessaoudi-official/angular-signals-starter/commit/a7abf1d4364e159351d90ce61500193