:58Z","email":"takieddine.messaoudi.official@gmail.com","name":"Takieddine Messaoudi"},"message":"feat(angular-signals-starter): initial project with fully zoneless Angular 21 + Vitest\n\n- Angular 21 zoneless change detection with @ngrx/signals signal store\n- MSW v2 for HTTP mocking in unit and integration tests\n- auth store: withState factory function for lazy localStorage rehydration\n- empty-state component: @Input() decorator for DeferBlockFixture compatibility\n- users store: clearListError() method; listError propagated to template\n- users-list: listError alert block alongside mutationError\n- 110/110 tests passing across unit and integration suites","tree":{"sha":"e3d6b3df7422a943c459fcd349bd85a6d7e02c78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmessaoudi-official/angular-signals-starter/git/trees/e3d6b3df7422a943c459fcd349bd85a6d7e02c78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmessaoudi-official/angular-signals-starter/git/commits/db6c3c87584221e162800003730c88995eaa8007","verification":{"payload":"tree e3d6b3df7422a943c459fcd349bd85a6d7e02c78\nauthor Takieddine Messaoudi <takieddine.messaoudi.official@gmail.com> 1778575169 +0200\ncommitter Takieddine Messaoudi <takieddine.messaoudi.official@gmail.com> 1778933458 +0200\n\nfeat(angular-signals-starter): initial project with fully zoneless Angular 21 + Vitest\n\n- Angular 21 zoneless change detection with @ngrx/signals signal store\n- MSW v2 for HTTP mocking in unit and integration tests\n- auth store: withState factory function for lazy localStorage rehydration\n- empty-state component: @Input() decorator for DeferBlockFixture compatibility\n- users store: clearListError() method; listError propagated to template\n- users-list: listError alert block alongside mutationError\n- 110/110 tests passing across unit and integration suites\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQCAUaGmWAJx0GpKt8MU3aQcG639QUCaghe0gAKCRAMU3aQcG63\n9Q/1APwMS4gJHEqDWJPZ5phRnI+r6mnVupLiHiYX05q/6GoQoQ