est.emi.edu.bo","name":"Danilo0125"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T14:32:44Z","email":"achavezc1@est.emi.edu.bo","name":"Danilo0125"},"message":"stack docker (nginx+backend+flask+mysql), seed 2018+, exportar Excel\n\n- docker-compose con frontend nginx en :8080 que proxea /api/1.0 al backend\n  Node y /api/statistics al Flask\n- Dockerfiles para backend (node:20), flask (python:3.11+gunicorn+pymysql) y\n  frontend (multi-stage build con nginx); .dockerignore en cada uno\n- backend: config production apunta a mysql:3306; CORS acepta localhost +\n  ngrok + cloudflared; fix de columnas operation.name/grassland.name en\n  controladores de charts; sync({alter:true}) para desarrollo\n- flask_api: config URI con pymysql en lugar de mysqlclient\n- frontend: statistics service usa URL relativa /api/statistics; botones\n  Exportar Excel agregados a las tablas del Análisis Descriptivo;\n  Angular budgets relajados para que pase el build de produccion\n- scripts/: etl_xlsx.py (xlsx -> CSVs Flask + tablas MySQL), seed_2018.py\n  (genera datos 2018 con Faker es_ES + animales eliminados), seed_all.py\n  (orquesta seed completo)\n- CSVs en flask_api/static actualizados a rango 2019-2025\n- xlsx fuente ganaderia_2020_2025.xlsx incluido para reproducibilidad","tree":{"sha":"975736018b2ca226c89dd613e5ef5f47b4dbfb00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danilo0125/ganaderia/git/trees/975736018b2ca226c89dd613e5ef5f47b4dbfb00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danilo0125/ganaderia/git/commits/6f842a82b97ee3070f73dbb32ba7acd72acef4c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/187287371?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danilo0125/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danilo0125/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danilo0125/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github