sers/yogaprastyoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yogaprastyoo/talenthub-landingpage/commits/f780d1acbaf994957ca0290f09b639a554580166/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T11:57:13Z","email":"yogaprastyobayu@gmail.com","name":"Yoga Prastyo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T11:57:13Z","email":"yogaprastyobayu@gmail.com","name":"Yoga Prastyo"},"message":"fix: drop --single agar prerender routes ter-serve dengan benar\n\n@vercel/serve-handler apply rewrites secara recursive. --single menambah\ncatch-all { source: ''**'', destination: ''/index.html'' }. Saat /about\ndi-rewrite ke /about/index.html oleh rule kita, hasil rewrite di-cek ulang,\nmatch catch-all, dan akhirnya di-rewrite lagi ke /index.html (Home).\n\nTanpa --single, serve-handler default behavior cukup:\n- /about → directory → serve /about/index.html (prerender benar)\n- /privacy → directory → serve /privacy/index.html (prerender benar)\n- /assets/foo.js → file → serve direct\n- /unknown → 404 (acceptable; route tidak ada)\n\nKalau menambah route baru, harus didaftarkan di scripts/prerender.mjs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d37ef485414397c8613587a1d6cbf75793d3b3d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yogaprastyoo/talenthub-landingpage/git/trees/d37ef485414397c8613587a1d6cbf75793d3b3d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yogaprastyoo/talenthub-landingpage/git/commits/f780d1acbaf994957ca0290f09b639a554580166","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152966866?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogaprastyoo","id":152966866,"login":"yogaprastyoo","node_id":"U_kgDOCR4W0g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yogaprastyoo/talenthub-landingpage/commit/f780d1acbaf994957ca0290f09b639a554580166","node_id":"C_kwDOSfk8UNoAKGY3ODBkMWFjYmFmOTk0OTU3Y2EwMjkwZjA5YjYzOWE1NTQ1ODAxNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yogaprastyoo/talenthub-landingpage/commit/2b69fd9625802de2ff6f94a79400b455e9fd6a74","sha":"2b69fd9625802de2ff6f94a79400b455e9fd6a74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yogaprastyoo/talenthub-landingpage/commits/2b69fd9625802de2ff6f94a79400b455e9fd6a74"}],"sha":"f780d1acbaf994957ca0290f09b639a554580166","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yogaprastyoo/talenthub-landingpage/commits/f780d1acbaf994957ca0290f09b639a554580166"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152966866?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogaprastyoo","id":152966866,"login":"yogaprastyoo","node_id":"U_kgDOCR4W0g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yogaprastyoo/talenthub-landingpage/commits/2b69fd9625802de2ff6f94a79400b455e9fd6a74/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T11:50:53Z","email":"yogaprastyobayu@gmail.com","name":"Yoga Prastyo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T11:50:53Z","email":"yogaprastyobayu@gmail.com","name":"Yoga Prastyo"},"message":"fix: explicit rewrites di serve.json untuk /about dan /privacy\n\nFlag --single di @vercel/serve menambah catch-all rewrite ke /index.html.\nKarena /about adalah directory, serve-handler menganggapnya \"tidak match file\"\nsehingga catch-all kena dan serve root index.html, bukan dist/about/index.html.\n\nTambah explicit rewrites yang prioritasnya lebih tinggi dari catch-all.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f1556546cf78b60a17b53e9d88f1229a83d42ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yogaprastyoo/talenthub-landingpage/git/trees/9f1556546cf78b60a17b53e9d88f1229a83d42ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yogaprastyoo/talenthub-landingpage/git/commits/2b69fd9625802de2ff6f94a79400b455e9fd6a74","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152966866?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yo