/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yogaprastyoo/talenthub-landingpage/commits/156ed249ff6a5ce1aaca2cb074a1b46016079cd7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T11:28:22Z","email":"yogaprastyobayu@gmail.com","name":"Yoga Prastyo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T11:28:22Z","email":"yogaprastyobayu@gmail.com","name":"Yoga Prastyo"},"message":"feat: redesign landing page, tambah halaman About, dan optimasi SEO menyeluruh\n\nAset & branding:\n- Ganti logo PNG ke logo SVG baru + favicon set lengkap dari /logobaru\n- Tambah screenshot Sprint 1 real (beranda, login, form-job-posting) +\n  konversi PNG ke WebP (save ~1MB, 85% reduction)\n- Hapus section \"Dipercaya oleh\" (dummy data, misleading untuk Sprint 1)\n\nHalaman /about baru:\n- Visi, misi, latar belakang PBL x Sindika, keunggulan, profil tim, CTA\n- Helmet SEO + breadcrumb JSON-LD schema\n\nHero & Features redesign (Stripe/Linear style):\n- Hero pakai 2 phone screenshot real dengan rotasi & brand glow\n- FeaturesSection: tab Sprint 1 pakai real screenshot dengan badge\n  \"Tersedia sekarang\", lainnya mockup clean dengan badge \"Roadmap\"\n- Background atmospheric (radial gradient + dot grid)\n- CTA primary diganti ke \"Unduh di Google Play\"\n\nNavigation overhaul:\n- Ultra-minimal nav (Beranda, Tentang Kami + CTA Hubungi Kami)\n- Active indicator underline brand-light (Linear-style)\n- Mobile menu auto-close on route change\n- react-router Link untuk semua nav (no full reload)\n- ScrollManager: smooth scroll ke hash, instant scroll-to-top on route change\n\nFooter:\n- Fix semua link broken (Product ke section anchor, Sindika ke URL verified)\n- Smart rendering: Link untuk internal, anchor untuk external/mailto\n- Hapus link \"Karir\" dan \"Syarat & Ketentuan\" (page tidak ada)\n- Logo pakai Link react-router\n\nSEO menyeluruh:\n- OG/Twitter meta per route via Helmet\n- Image sitemap (sitemap-images.xml) dengan caption deskriptif\n- Skip-to-main link untuk a11y keyboard user\n- Footer heading hierarchy + logo alt dedup + mockup heading ke <p>\n- Width/height eksplisit pada semua <img> (fix CLS)\n- fetchPriority=\"high\" untuk hero LCP image\n- Privacy: section IDs untuk deep linking\n\nPrerender per-route (scripts/prerender.mjs):\n- Post-build script generate dist/about/index.html dan dist/privacy/index.html\n  dengan meta sesuai route\n- Social scrapers (WhatsApp, Twitter, LinkedIn) baca OG meta yang benar\n  tanpa render JS\n\nPM2 + serve.json production-ready:\n- ecosystem.config.cjs: max_memory_restart, restart limits, log paths, timestamps\n- public/serve.json: cache headers per asset type (immutable untuk hashed assets,\n  no-cache untuk HTML, 30 hari untuk image), security headers global\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9afdfae4ac9aa6ef7a70ac2f5cbc17f63b008e4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yogaprastyoo/talenthub-landingpage/git/trees/9afdfae4ac9aa6ef7a70ac2f5cbc17f63b008e4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yogaprastyoo/talenthub-landingpage/git/commits/156ed249ff6a5ce1aaca2cb074a1b46016079cd7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152966866?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogaprastyoo","id":152966866,"login":"yogaprastyoo","node_id":"U_kgDOCR4W0g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogaprastyoo/orgs","received_events_url":"http