rittLiban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brittLiban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brittLiban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brittLiban/islamicSite/commits/487d1521ba571d64c5f7a0b1551eb77a2af96fb5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T04:29:13Z","email":"britt.liban@student.greenriver.edu","name":"brittLiban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T04:29:13Z","email":"britt.liban@student.greenriver.edu","name":"brittLiban"},"message":"feat: self-hosted video pipeline — MinIO + BullMQ + FFmpeg + hls.js\n\n- docker-compose: add Redis, MinIO, and FFmpeg worker containers\n- worker/: Node 22 + FFmpeg Alpine container; BullMQ consumer transcodes\n  raw MP4 → 720p HLS (.m3u8 + .ts segments) and stores in MinIO\n- web/lib/minio.ts: dual S3 clients (internal proxy + public presigned URLs)\n- web/lib/queue.ts: singleton BullMQ queue for transcode jobs\n- /api/admin/upload-url: presigned PUT URL for direct browser→MinIO upload\n- /api/admin/upload-complete: enqueues transcoding job after upload\n- /api/hls/[lessonId]/[...segments]: enrollment-gated HLS proxy from MinIO\n- VideoPlayer.tsx: hls.js player with native HLS fallback (Safari)\n- Admin lesson editor: per-lesson upload button with XHR progress bar\n- Lesson player: migrated from static data.ts to DB with static fallback\n- Course detail: curriculum fetched from DB with data.ts fallback\n- Prisma schema: added hlsKey + hlsReady to Lesson model\n- scripts/seed.ts: seed all 8 courses + full curricula to Postgres\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"05a8fa0fc53ea99f250d0effbe40d271d107dbc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brittLiban/islamicSite/git/trees/05a8fa0fc53ea99f250d0effbe40d271d107dbc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brittLiban/islamicSite/git/commits/487d1521ba571d64c5f7a0b1551eb77a2af96fb5","verification":{"payload":null,"r