m/rcs-morales","id":181067701,"login":"rcs-morales","node_id":"U_kgDOCsrftQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commits/faaa16f44794a3a484f40521a02b041b63a41ced/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T03:43:20Z","email":"181067701+rcs-morales@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raymund Morales"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T03:43:20Z","email":"181067701+rcs-morales@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raymund Morales"},"message":"feat: opt-in stuck-answer hint, question romaji, and voice-pack prompt\n\nPractice screen enhancements:\n- \"Taking a while? Tap to reveal answer\" opt-in hint (never automatic)\n  watches the live transcript for a quiet window before offering it —\n  4s for browser STT (real pause detection: resets on speech, re-shows\n  on a later pause) and 15s for AI/Whisper recording, which has no\n  partial transcript until it stops so it can only use a flat\n  \"reasonable time to finish speaking\" delay. Reveals the full expected\n  answer plus romaji and translation, not a token partial reveal.\n- Question romaji: a \"Romaji\" link beside \"Translate\" (question row),\n  click-to-reveal and cached per question, independently toggleable\n  from English hints.\n- Renamed \"Target Answer\" to \"Expected Answer\" for consistency with the\n  post-check reveal''s existing wording.\n- Voice-pack readiness prompt: starting practice in Voicevox mode with\n  an incomplete cache now confirms first (\"start anyway\" / \"wait\") so a\n  mid-session loading delay isn''t a surprise.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf5b4d28fdfddfac5ed22d6c45adebb03baf78a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/trees/bf5b4d28fdfddfac5ed22d6c45adebb03baf78a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/commits/faaa16f44794a3a484f40521a02b041b63a41ced","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181067701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales","id":181067701,"login":"rcs-morales","node_id":"U_kgDOCsrftQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commit/faaa16f44794a3a484f40521a02b041b63a41ced","node_id":"C_kwDOSf0K4doAKGZhYWExNmY0NDc5NGEzYTQ4NGY0MDUyMWEwMmIwNDFiNjNhNDFjZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commit/5a2dea1c4ea4904d77fecc2938fe8674ca8f36b1","sha":"5a2dea1c4ea4904d77fecc2938fe8674ca8f36b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commits/5a2dea1c4ea4904d77fecc2938fe8674ca8f36b1"}],"sha":"faaa16f44794a3a484f40521a02b041b63a41ced","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commits/faaa16f44794a3a484f40521a02b041b63a41ced"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181067701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales","id":181067701,"login":"rcs-morales","node_id":"U_kgDOCsrftQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commits/5a2dea1c4ea4904d77fecc2938fe8674ca8f36b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T03:43:02Z","email":"181067701+rcs-morales@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raymund Morales"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T03:43:02Z","email":"181067701+rcs-morales@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raymund Morales"},"message":"fix: surface real AI failure reasons instead of generic/misleading ones\n\ntranslateWithAI and transcribeWithWhisper both collapsed every failure\n(rate limit, invalid key, network error, empty result) into a bare\nnull, so the UI always showed one generic message — often blaming the\nAPI key for something that was actually a shared-quota rate limit.\nBoth now track a specific reason (mirrors grading.js''s existing\nlastGradingErrorReason pattern) so callers can show what actually\nhappened.\n\nAlso add a grading-prompt rule anchoring breakdown corrections to the\ngiven Expected Answer — the model was occasionally substituting a\ndifferent, unrelated-but-valid correction instead of the one that\nactually matches the deck''s expected answer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dad4f868f102eda9eb55cb13ad0794749225e993","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/trees/dad4f868f102eda9eb55cb13ad0794749225e993"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/commits/5a2dea1c4ea4904d77fecc2938fe8674ca8f36b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181067701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales","id":181067701,"login":"rcs-morales","node_id":"U_kgDOCsrftQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commit/5a2dea1c4ea4904d77fecc2938fe8674ca8f36b1","node_id":"C_kwDOSf0K4doAKDVhMmRlYTFjNGVhNDkwNGQ3N2ZlY2MyOTM4ZmU4Njc0Y2E4ZjM2YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commit/5e162ab35793798369c6fa19c6f10d931d7a1684","sha":"5e162ab35793798369c6fa19c6f10d931d7a1684","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commits/5e162ab35793798369c6fa19c6f10d931d7a1684"}],"sha":"5a2dea1c4ea4904d77fecc2938fe8674ca8f36b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commits/5a2dea1c4ea4904d77fecc2938fe8674ca8f36b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181067701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales","id":181067701,"login":"rcs-morales","node_id":"U_kgDOCsrftQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commits/5e162ab35793798369c6fa19c6f10d931d7a1684/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T03:42:54Z","email":"181067701+rcs-morales@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raymund Morales"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T03:42:54Z","email":"181067701+rcs-morales@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raymund Morales"},"message":"fix: mobile Voicevox avatar bounce could get stuck on forever\n\ntoggleSpeaking(false) only ever fired from the <audio> element''s\nended/error events, which mobile browsers are known to silently drop\n(backgrounded tab, OS media-session interruptions) — leaving the\navatar bouncing indefinitely after the question stopped speaking.\nAdd a watchdog timeout sized to the clip''s own duration (+buffer,\nfalling back to 20s if duration is unknown) that force-resolves\nplayback if the real events never fire.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f6b61a1ccab8faabf044088a10b8863b6267ed5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/trees/6f6b61a1ccab8faabf044088a10b8863b6267ed5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/commits/5e162ab35793798369c6fa19c6f10d931d7a1684","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181067701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales","id":181067701,"login":"rcs-morales","node_id":"U_kgDOCsrftQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commit/5e162ab35793798369c6fa19c6f10d931d7a1684","node_id":"C_kwDOSf0K4doAKDVlMTYyYWIzNTc5Mzc5ODM2OWM2ZmExOWM2ZjEwZDkzMWQ3YTE2ODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commit/55454bd92330831ef83d3f12d2a23e61d30b311d","sha":"55454bd92330831ef83d3f12d2a23e61d30b311d","u