-morales/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commits/dc6a238100068ca81b47fef30d6a016e1cb1710b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T07:02:36Z","email":"ra.csmorales@gmail.com","name":"unknown"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T07:02:36Z","email":"ra.csmorales@gmail.com","name":"unknown"},"message":"refactor: extract shared runAvatarOp helper from AvatarModal''s upload/preset-select flows\n\nonFilePicked and pickPreset shared identical try/catch/finally shape with only\ndifferences in the async operation, pending status text, and fallback error message.\nExtract a runAvatarOp(op, pendingText, fallbackErrorText) helper to eliminate\nduplication and improve maintainability. Both functions now delegate to this helper\nwith their operation-specific parameters.\n\nObservable behavior is unchanged — same status texts, same fallback messages,\nsame busy-guard, same onchange/preview/hasAvatar updates. The console.error label\nis now generic (''avatar operation failed:'') instead of operation-specific, which is\nan intentional simplification.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f7ee8e231248da8f762eb2b23ba2b543f9f3041","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/trees/9f7ee8e231248da8f762eb2b23ba2b543f9f3041"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/commits/dc6a238100068ca81b47fef30d6a016e1cb1710b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar