ales/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales","id":181067701,"login":"rcs-morales","node_id":"U_kgDOCsrftQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commits/ac53fb110f423b4e844fae21155e3ee9e7bef9e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T02:48:19Z","email":"ra.csmorales@gmail.com","name":"unknown"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T02:48:19Z","email":"ra.csmorales@gmail.com","name":"unknown"},"message":"fix: don''t claim a clean delete when cloud sync fails\n\nremove() in DeckFormModal ignored deleteDeck''s return value and always\nshowed \"Deck deleted\" even when the cloud delete failed while signed\nin. Since sync.js re-adds decks that still exist remotely but are\nmissing locally, this could resurrect a \"deleted\" deck on next login\nwhile the user was told it was gone. Now mirrors save()''s pattern:\nshow a distinct warning when the cloud push failed, keep the original\nmessage when it succeeded or the user was logged out.","tree":{"sha":"b53aa59c7b83193ae6e4d6c6d6de97c2f8dc9d90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/trees/b53aa59c7b83193ae6e4d6c6d6de97c2f8dc9d90"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/commits/ac53fb110f423b4e844