re collapses with CSS only — all imperatively wired ids stay\nin the DOM for app.js/quota.js/tts.js/avatar.js/groqClient.js.\n\n- prefs.svelte.js: reactive aids + daily-goal prefs over new settings.js\n  keys (show_furigana / show_romaji / show_en_hints / daily_goal_target);\n  aid toggles stamp body.aids-hide-* classes and style.css rules hide the\n  imperatively rendered furigana rt, romaji line, and translate hints —\n  no session/grading logic touched. Re-reads on settings-synced.\n- computeDailyGoal target now flows from prefs into Dashboard + Results.\n- Onboarding becomes the 3-step Kaiwa Quest sheet: step dots, hero\n  avatar, JLPT level picker (persists jlpt_level and mirrors the\n  Advanced grading-strictness select), then the existing deck and\n  sign-in steps. Press-down CTA, canvas palette, dark-theme ready.\n- Dropped a duplicate #shuffle-questions-checkbox (the real one lives on\n  the Decks tab; the duplicate id broke getElementById wiring).\n\nVerified end-to-end in headless Edge (32 checks: onboarding walk with\nlevel persistence, toggle → body class → computed style, stepper,\nslider wiring, collapsed-id contract, dashboard goal target, dark\ntheme); 169 unit tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf48c416e6a189ef0f9062c9aa399c91a2215204","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/trees/bf48c416e6a189ef0f9062c9aa399c91a2215204"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/commits/38e4b84d5d5933cb17d0e0b0ed403e4fd487b764","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181067701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.