level, total XP) —\n  same presentational-over-history philosophy as XP, no new persisted store.\n- newlyEarnedBadges() diffs the catalog with/without the newest entry;\n  Results renders a green \"New badge unlocked!\" banner per flipped badge.\n- New --chart-bar / --dashed-ring tokens in both themes.\n\nVerified end-to-end in Edge (empty state, seeded state, dark theme, banner);\nunit tests cover the week/badge/delta logic and the screen''s render states.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"97bdc8194f0e3ea751b43304db2eb45d9c2e1987","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/trees/97bdc8194f0e3ea751b43304db2eb45d9c2e1987"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/commits/0ecea85aa9639c37f9c18dcf805585041ff47c21","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181067701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales","id":181067701,"login":"rcs-morales","node_id":"U_kgDOCsrftQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commit/0ecea85aa9639c37f9c18dcf805585041ff47c21","no