"login":"rcs-morales","node_id":"U_kgDOCsrftQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commits/de3a77aa956ce3af691e95f6d0d7a51dea296e65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T07:59:48Z","email":"ra.csmorales@gmail.com","name":"unknown"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T07:59:48Z","email":"ra.csmorales@gmail.com","name":"unknown"},"message":"feat: Kaiwa Quest practice + results screens (Phase 5d step 4)\n\nRestyle the in-session and results screens to the Kaiwa Quest direction and add\nthe safe, derived gamification. All wired ids preserved (#screen-practice,\n#question-text, #transcript-content, #result-badge/#result-icon/#result-msg/\n#ai-feedback, #progress-bar/#progress-label, #btn-check/#btn-submit/#btn-rerecord/\n#btn-next/#btn-end-session, #avatar-container, #screen-results, #btn-restart-app).\n\nPractice:\n- session header row: round ✕ end button + slim gradient progress + mono count\n  (#btn-end-session moved up from the action row; still bound by id in app.js)\n- rounded masked avatar frame; question styled as a white speech bubble\n- green success result badge with a +20 XP reward pill (shown only on correct)\n- \"Try again\" / green \"Next →\" (new .btn-success) action buttons\n\nResults:\n- header with round ✕ (reuses the restart handler) + \"セッション完了 · Complete!\"\n- score card: huge mono %, \"N / M correct\", green bar, amber when < 75%\n- reward pair: +XP earned (score × 20) and daily-goal stars\n- bilingual \"もう一度 · Again\" primary\n\nAlso: press-down .btn-success; recolored the pulsing record button''s glow from\nthe old teal to vermillion.\n\nDeferred (need data/NLP not present, not fabricated): furigana over kanji\n(default deck is all-kana; needs readings), a romaji line under the recognized\ntranscript (needs Japanese→romaji on Whisper output), and the live in-session\ncombo counter (needs wiring into the imperative grading path).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a80fce98f3fca76cf4250c9c96e970d2fda2523f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/trees/a80fce98f3fca76cf4250c9c96e970d2fda2523f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/commits/de3a77aa956ce3af691e95f6d0d7a51dea296e65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181067701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales","id":181067701,"login":"rcs-morales","node_id":"U_kgDOCsrftQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commit/de3a77aa956ce3af691e95f6d0d7a51dea296e65","node_id":"C_kwDOSf0K4doAKGRlM2E3N2FhOTU2Y2UzYW