erves the wired ids (#screen-start,\n#btn-start-practice, #ai-status-chip/#ai-status-text).\n\n- style.css: global press-down buttons — .btn-primary/.btn-secondary/.btn-danger\n  now use solid offset shadows (--primary-shadow/--btn-shadow/--err-hover) that\n  collapse on :active as the button drops; rounded 700 button font. Replaces the\n  old teal-tinted blur shadows.\n- LevelCard.svelte (new, reused by Progress later): Lv · title, mono XP readout,\n  14px amber→vermillion XP bar, \"N XP to Level n+1\" hint — derived from history.\n- StatCard.svelte: amber tone variant for the daily-goal card.\n- Dashboard.svelte: level card on top; bigger rounded greeting; stat row is now\n  avg / sessions / ⭐ daily-goal (streak moved to the topbar pill in step 2);\n  bilingual \"はじめる — Start Practice\" CTA; amber recent-score for sub-75.\n\nNote: the vitest suite fails suite-wide on this machine independent of these\nchanges (e.g. settings.test.js fails on the base commit); build is clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2239e0f09caa4d03da8c83aa6c2270fd5f6cba0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/trees/2239e0f09caa4d03da8c83aa6c2270fd5f6cba0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/commits/2b3994858bcc4b10705f8bce812887bdda3421c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181067701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales","id":181067701,"login":"rcs-morales","node_id":"U_kgDOCsrftQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-m