r","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commits/16f312a7d713c8f6b218293c711763335b445da7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T04:42:12Z","email":"ra.csmorales@gmail.com","name":"unknown"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T04:42:12Z","email":"ra.csmorales@gmail.com","name":"unknown"},"message":"feat: streak + XP status pills in app shell (Phase 5d step 2)\n\nAdd the Kaiwa Quest topbar status pills — an amber day-streak pill and a\nvermillion XP pill — wired to a new derived gamification module. No new\npersisted state: XP is the lifetime sum of correct answers over the reactive\nsession history (+20 each), levels are fixed 400-XP bands.\n\n- gamification.svelte.js: computeXP / levelTitle / computeDailyGoal derived\n  from history.entries (used here and by the upcoming level-card screens)\n- Shell.svelte: streak (🔥) + XP (◆) pills; rounded 800 wordmark; on phones\n  the pills+actions ride right and the subtitle drops for room\n\nBottom-nav + desktop-nav active states already read as the peach/vermillion\npill treatment via the token remap in step 1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"59e6773cfa431eceb66b2e60415013d6327224e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/trees/59e6773cfa431eceb66b2e60415013d6327224e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/commits/16f312a7d713c8f6b218293c711763335b445da7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181067701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/us