://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commits/ad29431b8028670c22342953a5ab4fbceafa2d8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T07:39:23Z","email":"181067701+rcs-morales@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raymund Morales"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T07:39:23Z","email":"181067701+rcs-morales@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raymund Morales"},"message":"feat: design tokens + dark mode with theme toggle (Phase 5a)\n\n- All ~60 hardcoded colors in style.css converted to semantic CSS\n  custom properties (surfaces, borders, status colors, feedback tags).\n  Light theme keeps the exact same values — visually unchanged.\n- New dark \"night ink\" theme: every token overridden under\n  :root[data-theme=\"dark\"], including native form controls via\n  color-scheme.\n- Round theme toggle button (top-right). The choice persists in\n  settings, syncs across devices when signed in, and defaults to the\n  system preference until explicitly set.\n- Inline boot script in app.html applies the theme before first paint\n  (no flash of the wrong theme on load).\n- New src/lib/theme.js: resolveTheme / applyTheme / toggleTheme /\n  initTheme; re-applied after a settings sync from another device.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"642dd0c276088c96b93a977fd27a70262df19282","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/trees/642dd0c276088c96b93a977fd27a70262df19282"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/commits/ad29431b8028670c22342953a5ab4fbceafa2d8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181067701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/followers","f