 Deck sync is now last-write-wins using a local timestamp, and failed\n  uploads are retried and shown in the import status.\n\n- Repeating yourself while speaking produced duplicate feedback cards.\n  The AI is now told to grade only the final attempt, and duplicate\n  corrections are filtered out client-side.\n\n- The quota chip showed as an empty pill and never updated. It now\n  stays hidden until data loads, refreshes after every AI request, and\n  logs a clear console message whenever it can''t be shown.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7879f961cf223500a36e1213d0438b4ac651765a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/trees/7879f961cf223500a36e1213d0438b4ac651765a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/commits/40baeacbb61680141a86501e895978e02371385f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181067701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales","id":181067701,"login":"rcs-morales","node_id":"U_kgDOCsrftQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-w