ps://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commits/d11109e0f7f8443e64cd0ea8638673f22e8dccb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T04:48:51Z","email":"181067701+rcs-morales@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raymund Morales"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T04:48:51Z","email":"181067701+rcs-morales@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raymund Morales"},"message":"feat: API proxy hides Groq key, enforces quotas (Phase 3)\n\nImplement server-side request proxy on Cloudflare Pages Functions to hide the\nGroq API key, enable per-user quota enforcement, and support signed-in users\nwithout a bring-your-own key. Hybrid access strategy: BYO key goes direct to\nGroq (unlimited), signed-in without key routes through proxy with daily quotas\n(200 chat, 600 Whisper-seconds), local grading remains as fallback.\n\nClient changes:\n- auth.js: expose getAccessToken() for JWT auth with proxy\n- groqClient.js: new hasAIAccess() (logged-in OR BYO key) and resolveAIRoute()\n  (BYO → Groq direct; signed-in → /api/* proxy; neither → null)\n- All 6 AI fetch sites (grading, whisper×2, translate×3): use resolver,\n  request bodies unchanged\n- All 9 behavior gates (session×6, stt, translate-ui): swap hasGroqApiKey()\n  → hasAIAccess(); sign-in unlocks AI access\n- quota.js: new module for fetching and displaying daily usage; RPC read-only\n- Wizard copy: honest about quotas and what \"add a key\" means (bypass shared\n  limit, not unlimited)\n- Quota indicator: display on start screen, warns at >80% usage\n\nServer changes:\n- functions/api/chat.js + transcribe.js: verify JWT, enforce model allowlist,\n  cap body/audio size, reserve quota, forward to Groq with server key\n- functions/_lib/auth.js: verify Supabase session via auth API\n- functions/_lib/quota.js: atomic check-and-increment via RPC, fail open\n- supabase/migrations/0002: increment_api_usage() RPC (service-role only),\n  get_api_usage() RPC (authenticated read-only)\n\nManual setup (one-time per deployment):\n- Apply migration 0002 to Supabase\n- Add Cloudflare Pages env vars: GROQ_API_KEY, SUPABASE_URL,\n  SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY\n\nTesting: 108 passing (added quota + resolver tests), same 5 pre-existing\nfailures, build succeeds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be1a2fc750da28bc1bcaf666d0fbb2b85d420c88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/trees/be1a2fc750da28bc1bcaf666d0fbb2b85d420c88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/commits/d11109e0f7f8443e64cd0ea8638673f22e8dccb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181067701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales","id":181067701,"login":"rcs-morales","node_id":"U_kgDOCsrftQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commit/d11109e0f7f84