s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commits/fc0ae4d0581fd87efa60fd68504b8ded04c1fce0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T02:02:02Z","email":"181067701+rcs-morales@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raymund Morales"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T02:02:02Z","email":"181067701+rcs-morales@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raymund Morales"},"message":"feat: accounts & cross-device sync (Supabase, Phase 2)\n\nAdd optional sign-in with Supabase (email magic link + Google OAuth) and\nclient-side sync of settings, decks, and practice results via RLS-locked\ntables. Logged-out behaviour is unchanged — all sync code no-ops until a\nuser signs in.\n\n- supabase/migrations: profiles, user_settings, decks, session_results\n  (RLS auth.uid()=user_id) + api_usage (service-role only, for Phase 3)\n- src/auth.js: session restore, magic link / Google, onAuthChange\n- src/sync.js: debounced settings upsert w/ allowlist, pull-merge on login,\n  deck push/pull, fire-and-forget session_results; decoupled via window events\n- settings.js: set()/remove() change hook + device-local DECK_ID key\n- import.js: dual-write imported decks when signed in\n- session.js: persist finished runs to session_results\n- index.html/app.js: Account panel + status bar, sync-on-login orchestration,\n  applySettingsToUI() refactor\n- .github/workflows/keepalive.yml: twice-weekly ping so the free tier stays awake\n- README: accounts/sync section + manual Supabase setup steps\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4383b5ec034024ee282424fc5fbfe7e1445f5bdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/trees/4383b5ec034024ee282424fc5fbfe7e1445f5bdf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/commits/fc0ae4d0581fd87efa60fd68504b8ded04c1fce0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181067701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales","id":181067701,"login":"rcs-morales","node_id":"U_kgDOCsrftQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commit/fc0ae4d0581fd87efa60fd68504b8ded04c1fce0","node_id":"C_kwDOSf0K4doAKGZjMGFlNGQwNTgxZmQ4N2VmYTYwZmQ2ODUwNGI4ZGVkMDRjMWZjZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commit/16b60a2ea60a331f093a7a3ecd99def6431840aa","sha":"16b60a2ea60a331f093a7a3ecd99def6431840aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commits/16b60a2ea60a331f093a7a3ecd99def6431840aa"}],"sha":"fc0ae4d0581fd87efa60fd68504b8ded04c1fce0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commits/fc0ae4d0581fd87efa60fd68504b8ded04c1fce0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181067701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rcs-morales","id":181067701,"login":"rcs-morales","node_id":"U_kgDOCsrftQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commits/16b60a2ea60a331f093a7a3ecd99def6431840aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T12:23:32Z","email":"181067701+rcs-morales@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raymund Morales"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T12:23:32Z","email":"181067701+rcs-morales@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raymund Morales"},"message":"build: move Live2D authoring files out of public/ to unblock Cloudflare deploy\n\nCloudflare Pages rejects files over 25 MiB, and chitose_t01.cmo3 (26.5 MiB)\ntripped the limit. The .cmo3 (Cubism project), .can3 (animation source), and\n.psd files are authoring assets never loaded at runtime — the app only fetches\nruntime/*.model3.json. Moving them to model-sources/ keeps them tracked but out\nof the deployed bundle, trimming ~90 MB from what Pages uploads.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c30b60cb57636e03065bf7b99164cc31eba061d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tara