rgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcs-morales","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/commits/135a4a905e205059b7d20ab21ed0c257dba29011/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T11:00:43Z","email":"181067701+rcs-morales@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raymund Morales"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T11:00:43Z","email":"181067701+rcs-morales@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raymund Morales"},"message":"fix: label the built-in sample deck and gate tutorial mode to it\n\nWhen no imported deck exists in localStorage the app silently fell back\nto the built-in starter deck, which is indistinguishable from an import\nonce practice starts (question text hidden by default). Tutorial mode\nalso triggered off the data shape (any item with a romaji `r` field),\nnot off actually using the starter deck.\n\n- session.js: setQA() takes { isDefault }; exported isDefaultDeck flag\n- tutorial box requires isDefaultDeck, not just item.r\n- start-screen chip now shows \"Sample Deck — N Questions (import your\n  own!)\" when running the fallback deck\n\nNote: localStorage is origin-scoped, so the Vite port change reset any\npreviously imported deck/settings — re-import once on the new origin.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"67c5b598c55c1bc2e5571c00388d7ec79e4e6eff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/trees/67c5b598c55c1bc2e5571c00388d7ec79e4e6eff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rcs-morales/tarakaiwa-web/git/commits/135a4a905e205059b7d20ab21ed0c257dba29011","verification":{"payload":null,"reas