"},"message":"docs: update CHANGELOG for v0.6.0 enterprise hardening\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c7997cab4927ea857aceeef5386423e54431bb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EthanShen10086/voxera-kit/git/trees/6c7997cab4927ea857aceeef5386423e54431bb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EthanShen10086/voxera-kit/git/commits/02880112f0689dea1af0c9be64ff981276bccf60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/EthanShen10086/voxera-kit/commit/02880112f0689dea1af0c9be64ff981276bccf60","node_id":"C_kwDOSf010toAKDAyODgwMTEyZjA2ODlkZWExYWYwYzliZTY0ZmY5ODEyNzZiY2NmNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/EthanShen10086/voxera-kit/commit/52e13329f5bdc94bff41a173c21bc1be3969d919","sha":"52e13329f5bdc94bff41a173c21bc1be3969d919","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EthanShen10086/voxera-kit/commits/52e13329f5bdc94bff41a173c21bc1be3969d919"}],"sha":"02880112f0689dea1af0c9be64ff981276bccf60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EthanShen10086/voxera-kit/commits/02880112f0689dea1af0c9be64ff981276bccf60"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EthanShen10086/voxera-kit/commits/52e13329f5bdc94bff41a173c21bc1be3969d919/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T06:52:29Z","email":"yuhaoyan@tencent.com","name":"yuhaoyan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T06:52:29Z","email":"yuhaoyan@tencent.com","name":"yuhaoyan"},"message":"feat: enterprise infrastructure hardening - real observability + performance + security modules\n\nPhase 1 - Observability (real implementations):\n- logger/zap.go: ZapLogger with functional options, slog adapter\n- tracing/otel.go: OTelTracer with OTLP HTTP exporter, BatchSpanProcessor\n- metrics/prometheus.go: PrometheusRecorder with lazy metric vector creation\n- metrics/handler.go: Prometheus HTTP handler\n- profiling/pprof.go: conditional pprof endpoint registration\n\nPhase 2 - Performance modules (new):\n- singleflight: request deduplication via x/sync/singleflight\n- retry: exponential backoff with jitter + context cancellation\n- bulkhead: semaphore-based isolation with max wait\n- loadshed: adaptive AIMD load shedding\n\nPhase 3 - Security/Compliance modules (new):\n- audit: Entry/Writer/Reader interfaces + memory/noop adapters\n- secret: Manager interface + env-var adapter\n- pii: Redactor with regex rules for email/phone/CC/SSN/IP\n- featureflag: Store with SHA-256 deterministic percentage rollout\n- security/headers: HSTS/CSP/X-Frame config with strict/permissive presets\n- crypto/tls: mTLS server + client config helpers\n\nPhase 4 - Reusable HTTP middleware module (new):\n- 12 middleware: RequestID, Logging, Tracing, Metrics, Audit, Recovery,\n  HealthCheck, Timeout, LoadShed, SecurityHeaders, PIIRedact + Chain\n\nPhase 5 - Frontend observability enhancements:\n- Complete Web Vitals (LCP/CLS/INP/FID) via PerformanceObserver\n- Long Task + Resource Timing detection\n- TracingClient: real OTLP JSON batch export\n- ErrorTracker: remote reporting with sampling + beforeSend\n- New AuditClient for user action tracking\n\nPhase 7 - Deploy configs:\n- OTel Collector, Prometheus, Alertmanager, Grafana dashboard\n- docker-compose.observability.yml for local dev stack\n- 5 alert rules (error rate, latency, downtime, memory, circuit breaker)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"3d9de4244a8107473f2907c2bad873ec564e8378","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EthanShen10086/voxera-kit/git/trees/3d9de4244a8107473f2907c2bad873ec564e8378"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EthanShen10086/voxera-kit/git/commits/52e13329f5bdc94bff41a173c21bc1be3969d919","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/EthanShen10086/voxera-kit/commit/52e13329f5bdc94bff41a173c21bc1be3969d919","node_id":"C_kwDOSf010toA