oyan@tencent.com","name":"yuhaoyan"},"message":"feat: add spreadsheet/chart/clipboard/dataprovider/dataparser modules\n\nPhase 0 for Finera integration - 5 new pluggable modules:\n\nFrontend (3 TS packages):\n- @voxera-kit/spreadsheet: ISpreadsheetAdapter + Univer/AG Grid adapters\n- @voxera-kit/chart: IChartAdapter (7 chart types) + ECharts/visx adapters\n- @voxera-kit/clipboard: IClipboardParser with multi-source detection\n  (Excel, Google Sheets, Feishu, Tencent Docs, DingTalk)\n\nBackend (2 Go modules):\n- dataprovider: DataProvider/FinancialProvider interfaces + stub adapter\n  with mock data for US/HK/SH/SZ markets\n- dataparser: DocumentParser interface + CSV adapter (real impl) + stub\n\nTotal kit modules: 25 Go + 15 TS (up from 23 Go + 12 TS)\nAll existing modules unaffected - pure additive changes.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"736eee53c78e2cfd950c4a64bddf7050df10ec83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EthanShen10086/voxera-kit/git/trees/736eee53c78e2cfd950c4a64bddf7050df10ec83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EthanShen10086/voxera-kit/git/commits/2b9e95ac586246378347cadfc999584480114b62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/EthanShen10086/voxera-kit/commit/2b9e95ac586246378347cadfc999584480114b62","node_id":"C_kwDOSf010toAKDJiOWU5NWFjNTg2MjQ2Mzc4MzQ3Y2FkZmM5OTk1ODQ0ODAxMTRiNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/EthanShen10086/voxera-kit/commit/215cfb9422edb5f615df235b1ebeb87aa8bee97e","sha":"215cfb9422edb5f615df235b1ebeb87aa8bee97e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EthanShen10086/voxera-kit/commits/215cfb9422edb5f615df235b1ebeb87aa8bee97e"}],"sha":"2b9e95ac586246378347cadfc999584480114b62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EthanShen10086/voxera-kit/commits/2b9e95ac586246378347cadfc999584480114b62"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EthanShen10086/voxera-kit