:"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olucianochagas","id":217548091,"login":"olucianochagas","node_id":"U_kgDODPeFOw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/commits/d8b0591982cef09b4a8b1a3ea23f926a7aa15fb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T18:11:47Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano D. M. Chagas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T18:11:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(workspace): upgrade OpenTelemetry sdk-node 0.55→0.218 (e auto/exporter) (#16)\n\nBump cirúrgico dos 3 packages OpenTelemetry pré-1.0:\n\n- @opentelemetry/sdk-node          0.55.0 → 0.218.0\n- @opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node 0.53.0 → 0.76.0\n- @opentelemetry/exporter-trace-otlp-grpc   0.55.0 → 0.218.0\n\nSubstitui o PR #3 (group) que ficou stale após merges paralelos —\nabrir só esse subconjunto garante: sem regressões em outras deps,\nfoco em uma única decisão arquitetural (upgrade OTel).\n\nOTel pré-1.0 tem 163 minor versions entre 0.55 e 0.218 — esperado\nbreaking, mas o design minimalista do nosso packages/observability/src/otel.ts\n(só usa NodeSDK + getNodeAutoInstrumentations + env vars OTEL_*) absorve\nsem precisar adaptar código. As 3 mudanças cobertas:\n\n- Resource API (resourceFromAttributes em vez de new Resource) — não usamos.\n- TraceContextPropagator API — não usamos.\n- Express auto-instrumentation moves — coberto pelo wildcard auto-instrumentations.\n\nValidação local:\n- @mais-inclusao/observability: 7 testes verdes\n- typecheck ✅, build ESM+CJS+DTS ✅, lint ✅, format ✅\n\nLockfile atualizado (1448 linhas de churn refletindo a profundidade do upgrade\nno dependency tree do OTel).\n\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"61f10de52235c19b51dbf6d581348652e903772e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/trees/61f10de52235c19b51dbf6d581348652e903772e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/commits/d8b0591982cef09b4a8b1a3ea23f926a7aa15fb3","verification":{"payload":"tree 61f10de52235c19b51dbf6d581348652e903772e\nparent 300f9031a8cc9439962561a161b813974b441b91\nauthor Luciano D. M. Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com> 1779127907 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779127907 -0300\n\nchore(workspace): upgrade OpenTelemetry sdk-node 0.55→0.218 (e auto/exporter) (#16)\n\nBump cirúrgico dos 3 packages OpenTelemetry pré-1.0:\n\n- @opentelemetry/sdk-node          0.55.0 → 0.218.0\n- @opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node 0.53.0 → 0.76.0\n- @opentelemetry/exporter-trace-otlp-grpc   0.55.0 → 0.218.0\n\nSubstitui o PR #3 (group) que ficou stale após merges paralelos —\nabrir só esse subconjunto garante: sem regressões em outras deps,\nfoco em uma única decisão arquitetural (upgrade OTel).\n\nOTel pré-1.0 tem 163 minor versions entre 0.55 e 0.218 — esperado\nbreaking, mas o design minimalista do nosso packages/observability/src/otel.ts\n(só usa NodeSDK + getNodeAutoInstrumentations + env vars OTEL_*) absorve\nsem precisar adaptar código. As 3 mudanças cobertas:\n\n- Resource API (resourceFromAttributes em vez de new Resource) — não usamos.\n- TraceContextPropagator API — não usamos.\n- Express auto-instrumentation moves — coberto pelo wildcard auto-instrumentations.\n\nValidação local:\n- @mais-inclusao/