ttps://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/commits/ebb4611faba57086c596dd398029b0249bc89f50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T17:58:25Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano D. M. Chagas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T17:58:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(fundacao-onda-1-core): persistence + messaging + observability + tooling (#14)\n\nOnda 1 core: 3 packages fundacionais + upgrade transversal de tooling.\n\n@mais-inclusao/persistence — Tenant context via AsyncLocalStorage + tenant-scope helpers. Camadas 1 e 2 de defesa contra cross-tenant leak (ADR-0005).\n\n@mais-inclusao/messaging — NATS JetStream wrapper + Outbox dispatcher (ADR-0004). At-least-once delivery; idempotência via event_id.\n\n@mais-inclusao/observability — Pino com redaction de PII (LGPD), correlation_id via ALS, preset OpenTelemetry.\n\nTooling — vitest 2→4 (com vite 8 peer), syncpack 13→15, infra docker para dev local.\n\nMétricas: 9 commits, 32 testes novos (160 total), 100% coverage, build dual ESM+CJS+DTS, lint+typecheck+format verdes.\n\n3 changesets minor pendentes (.changeset/fundacao-{2,3,4}-*.md) — release bot abre PR automático ao merge.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b551576417a7ecb1d12d5c2a9246c041c86303ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/trees/b551576417a7ecb1d12d5c2a9246c041c86303ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/commits/ebb4611faba57086c596dd398029b0249bc89f50","verification":{"payload":"tree b551576417a7ecb1d12d5c2a9246c041c86303ff\nparent 4d5159da295571ff6cc9415091e63e5e5e484f90\nauthor Luciano D. M. Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com> 1779127105 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779127105 -0300\n\nfeat(fundacao-onda-1-core): persistence + messaging + observability + tooling (#14)\n\nOnda 1 core: 3 packages fundacionais + upgrade transversal de tooling.\n\n@mais-inclusao/persistence — Tenant context via AsyncLocalStorage + tenant-scope helpers. Camadas 1 e 2 de defesa contra cross-tenant leak (ADR-0005).\n\n@mais-inclusao/messaging — NATS JetStream wrapper + Outbox dispatcher (ADR-0004). At-least-once delivery; idempotência via event_id.\n\n@mais-inclusao/observability — Pino com redaction de PII (LGPD), correlation_id via ALS, preset OpenTelemetry.\n\nTooling — vitest 2→4 (com vite 8 peer), syncpack 13→15, infra docker para dev local.\n\nMétricas: 9 commits, 32 testes novos (160 total), 100% coverage, build dual ESM+CJS+DTS, lint+typecheck+format verdes.\n\n3 changesets minor pendentes (.changeset/fundacao-{2,3,4}-*.md) — release bot abre PR automático ao merge.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqC1NBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcNEQAGV1phlpjtzlVmn10j1FbUpy\nPx8NpTQ8gA04iilGseO/InaJh9CiZodn6dNajQpa5QE5/rTEklBGOGFKPu7pgX8t\nlWTCNXrIBitAN3NSJ7YWvN1Egjkfc+jUlFrGs6VQT9sNZyp1udbXPLZUkA2xDcbr\nPDjVSvyuSUJyDMBRrxj34SNg86lWr4y96U4suDm1Qx/y5MidHmO3Xr8/4FY4Jfn6\nmT0uIJpwi6/okhFRjKEPA9GFzeomF7tYlIlB1QERfOR74gblm9jq5vaitavhja4Z\nCoLAChcZv3ZJruJuX3SSfSYOIwCX8znix7MJwviuquWFePDnO8jgtiQNoxKyNWjq\nfBzjSEGr4Fx1ESraD++g5fWhD2ILHRIWnohGncM+W+dsg6CsfAcq9gtP1ta8Kh6Y\nYG/IHeLyFej0F3XWR0tPtl5BC/SLzOzineFJExuNY0fRJ9cpsdpcS9j+fLSlx0P3\nw50JX4Kb0o4R78ewfq3XFC7LtV1okXhfF9Id2XtD8+KdAHl27zqD/Pvibrwk2VMR\nsxKj27ULeNYAsqnUKV/7D979RlczwOGz3oHZadtjAYu5OwqPC2yPgJbBJHVqSYke\nbznMItbe23KEBGx/HRyh6WIm7BVxy6qerTqoHJHg38waHZBti73Qhf7k7NHrYzKn\ny7TJYKdwtXy4EHc5Ng1g\n=lx8P\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-18T17:58:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","followin