7e64103d43615ce4f91e9075f2b85455497816f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217548091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olucianochagas","id":217548091,"login":"olucianochagas","node_id":"U_kgDODPeFOw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/commits/51a0140bb5e823eb7e0d127fbb1b119750084367/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T17:25:16Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T17:25:16Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas"},"message":"ci(github): excecionar identidades de bot em DCO e Dependabot em commitlint\n\nDestrava o ciclo de CI para PRs gerados automaticamente:\n\n1. .github/workflows/dco.yml — pula DCO sign-off para autores cujo nome\n   termina em \"[bot]\" (sufixo protegido pelo GitHub, não pode ser usado\n   por contas humanas). DCO existe para certificar origem de contribuição\n   externa; commits de bots gerenciados pelo repo (github-actions,\n   dependabot) já têm consentimento implícito do owner.\n\n2. commitlint.config.cjs — adiciona `ignores` predicates para mensagens\n   geradas pelo Dependabot (`chore(deps): Bump|Update`, `chore(deps-dev):\n   Bump|Update`, `ci(deps): Bump`). O Dependabot usa sentence-case nessas\n   mensagens sem opção de customização. A regra `subject-case: never\n   sentence-case` continua estrita para commits humanos.\n\nResolve simultaneamente:\n- PR #13 (Changesets release) bloqueado por DCO sign-off do github-actions[bot].\n- PRs #1, #3-#12 (Dependabot) bloqueados por commitlint.\n\nPróximas releases automáticas funcionarão de ponta a ponta sem intervenção manual.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"e415896d5bc228e510dce2cd89baa68a91064181","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/trees/e415896d5bc228e510dce2cd89baa68a91064181"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/commits/51a0140bb5e823eb7e0d127fbb1b119750084367","verification":{"payload":"tree e415896d5bc228e510dce2cd89baa68a91064181\nparent a266ba0dd1b0f21ca42e2015c2887cf2228c9df2\nauthor Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com> 1779125116 -0300\ncommitter Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com> 1779125116 -0300\n\nci(github): excecionar identidades de bot em DCO e Dependabot em commitlint\n\nDestrava o ciclo de CI para PRs gerados automaticamente:\n\n1. .github/workflows/dco.yml — pula DCO sign-off para autores cujo nome\n   termina em \"[bot]\" (sufixo protegido pelo GitHub, não pode ser usado\n   por contas humanas). DCO existe para certificar origem de contribuição\n   externa; commits de bots gerenciados pelo repo (github-actions,\n   dependabot) já têm consentimento implícito do owner.\n\n2. commitlint.config.cjs — adiciona `ignores` predicates para mensagens\n   geradas pelo Dependabot (`chore(deps): Bump|Update`, `chore(deps-dev):\n   Bump|Update`, `ci(deps): Bump`). O Dependabot usa sentence-case nessas\n   mensagens sem opção de customização. A regra `subject-case: never\n   sentence-case` continua estrita para commits humanos.\n\nResolve simultaneamente:\n- PR #13 (Changesets release) bloqueado por DCO sign-off do github-actions[bot].\n- PRs #1, #3-#12 (Dependabot) bloqueados por commitlint.\n\nPróximas releases automáticas funcionarão de ponta a ponta sem intervenção manual.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEE+n17n1yRgmWK7N5YJH5udzcvV18FAmoLS3wACgkQJH5udzcv\nV1/dFg/7BpBET+xh4oz7ta1e8+xD9EWxZk3JYuvx34D3VGJqNNjv3qXHDZ18A6gt\npjU3Tyjgeke2fFjXTyeL4NGZ4xwWlDuyQnhBkjsUh+wsfYbhrbanz45Q8ku0XCxW\n1AEoPtNprI9xt0uQ50FN5mUaplvsjX721TeWWrHXUWrC2hp9fcbMfWS+Yu79cdRA\nAFGONlxUvOb6bfKMfiMg+kiP4YAsV1M64+QiG6Z5O9R50y6QDrMH+Xiz5EB6rMgJ\nKXPShCTuJoNB4F1JjRKnna7NaMFjgjbyW0DE0xJZLmY9j4cNCIV5QUp5N96sx8L3\nK/w9cEtyWUJ+0aJdSzEG6Zad3HRISLH4AIuYfx7y1bUN9TyH89ADesp/tjdevvAd\n8A4KL2oad25d53pgz0dLYCME5GX6MfN07hb2W5IymD3agi/KvuWgqEg6nguSl+Do\nzzx6NpbcRcRkXu3eTVl5ZiaUKmGDjJP6SIU2n+gqdqi1rmBivrPQ5iIvhNCAVWW2\nfXesdMySiZ3g9nLdZwqDi670SDSM2AuO3GzJZks/UYgG4qzbQHooo0UcgYHGc2i0\nwmcWCXEE8YvgN2QKSKlBbAO1FDccm63P4BWGm9nS94PPg7v8XimForWlr7prk40Q\nNXrofaRXsAmIaasEnpOYOG7BdQLzjBAK92r+JVnXiNPDalr44p0=\n=Q9ls\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-18T17:25:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217548091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olucianochagas","id":217548091,"login":"olucianochagas","node_id":"U_kgDODPeFOw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/u