.com/users/olucianochagas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/commits/2d6601e5d552420b30a0b2f1652b0c19d92f7f3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T18:51:08Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T18:51:08Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas"},"message":"docs(plans): adicionar plano de implementação da Fundação 1\n\nPlano detalhado (3.911 linhas, ~115 KB) para o subprojeto Fundação 1\n(packages/tsconfig + packages/eslint-config + packages/contracts).\n\n23 tasks granulares com steps de 2-5 min cada, todos com:\n- Comandos exatos com expected output.\n- Código completo (sem placeholders) em cada step.\n- TDD nas Tasks 9-16 (schemas Zod): escrever teste → falhar →\n  implementar → passar → commit.\n- Abordagem config-first nas Tasks 2-7 (tsconfig + eslint-config):\n  criar config → validar via comando → commit.\n\nEstrutura:\n- Tasks 1-4: setup + packages/tsconfig (5 variantes + migração + README).\n- Tasks 5-7: packages/eslint-config (preset base + 3 presets + README).\n- Tasks 8-17: packages/contracts (scaffold + 5 schemas shared + 2 auth).\n- Tasks 18-20: tsup build + snapshots JSON Schema + README.\n- Tasks 21-23: cobertura ≥ 90% + Changeset + cross-check DoD.\n\nApêndice de troubleshooting para 5 cenários comuns. Self-Review\ndocumentado: spec coverage 100%, sem placeholders, consistência de\nnomes verificada.\n\nExecution Handoff oferece 2 opções: subagent-driven (recomendado)\nou inline execution via superpowers:executing-plans.\n\nRefs: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-17-fundacao-1-configs-e-contracts-design.md\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"e97a8993f1bdb95f24ce8944df620ccf7c76396a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oluc