":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/commit/f358ccc145e4003854f687e6778033de3148d020","sha":"f358ccc145e4003854f687e6778033de3148d020","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/commits/f358ccc145e4003854f687e6778033de3148d020"}],"sha":"2d6601e5d552420b30a0b2f1652b0c19d92f7f3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/commits/2d6601e5d552420b30a0b2f1652b0c19d92f7f3d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217548091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olucianochagas","id":217548091,"login":"olucianochagas","node_id":"U_kgDODPeFOw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/commits/f358ccc145e4003854f687e6778033de3148d020/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T14:31:31Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T14:31:31Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas"},"message":"docs: adicionar spec da Fundação 1 — configs compartilhadas + contracts core\n\nSpec do primeiro subprojeto da Onda 1: 3 packages internos formando\na fundação técnica antes de qualquer serviço ou app.\n\nEscopo (decisões fechadas em brainstorming Q1-Q4):\n- @mais-inclusao/tsconfig — 5 variantes (base, nest, react, lib, test)\n- @mais-inclusao/eslint-config — ESLint 9 flat config + 3 presets\n  (nest, react, lib) com plugins de segurança e a11y strict\n- @mais-inclusao/contracts — EventEnvelope + shared types\n  (TenantId/Pagination/ProblemDetails/IDs branded) + 4 eventos auth\n  + 5 DTOs HTTP mínimos; build via tsup ESM+CJS+.d.ts\n\nEstratégias:\n- Testes Vitest unit + snapshots JSON Schema (zod-to-json-schema)\n  como golden master contra breaking changes acidentais\n- Privado com publishConfig pronto (preserva opcionalidade futura)\n- Migração do tsconfig.base.json raiz em 2 commits separados\n\nDefinition of Done com 15 critérios verificáveis. 6 riscos\nidentificados com mitigações. Apêndices: tabela de versionamento,\ndecisões pendentes, stack alvo, próximos 5 subprojetos.\n\nRefs: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-16-programa-mais-inclusao-decomposicao.md (Apêndice D)\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"91a7d9cb14f28318c4881389f962a095c7498cff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/trees/91a7d9cb14f28318c4881389f962a095c7498cff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/commits/f358ccc145e4003854f687e6778033de3148d020","verification":{"payload":"tree 91a7d9cb14f28318c4881389f962a095c7498cff\nparent 71497738aa2e739004f7b539629740c71dc2b4af\nauthor Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com> 1779028291 -0300\ncommitter Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com> 1779028291 -0300\n\ndocs: adicionar spec da Fundação 1 — configs compartilhadas + contracts core\n\nSpec do primeiro subprojeto da Onda 1: 3 packages internos formando\na fundação técnica antes de qualquer serviço ou app.\n\nEscopo (decisões fechadas em brainstorming Q1-Q4):\n- @mais-inclusao/tsconfig — 5 variantes (base, nest, react, lib, test)\n- @mais-inclusao/eslint-config — ESLint 9 flat config + 3 presets\n  (nest, react, lib) com plugins de segurança e a11y strict\n- @mais-inclusao/contracts — EventEnvelope + shared types\n  (TenantId/Pagination/ProblemDetails/IDs branded) + 4 eventos auth\n  + 5 DTOs HTTP mínimos; build via tsup ESM+CJS+.d.ts\n\nEstratégias:\n- Testes Vitest unit + snapshots JSON Schema (zod-to-json-schema)\n  como golden master contra breaking changes acidentais\n- Privado com publishConfig pronto (preserva opcionalidade futura)\n- Migração do tsconfig.base.json raiz em 2 commits separados\n\nDefinition of Done com 15 critérios verificáveis. 6 riscos\nidentificados com mitigações. Apêndices: tabela de versionamento,\ndecisões pendentes, stack alvo, próximos 5 subprojetos.\n\nRefs: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-16-programa-mais-inclusao-decomposicao.md (Apêndice D)\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEE+n17n1yRgmWK7N5YJH5udzcvV18FAmoJ0UMACgkQJH5udzcv\nV1+4UQ//fi1SkvIOArfkaJort/FKgONdpdXXmW+Y17519O+D8DFT+76744VQ8fWd\ntxfouadj/8kOFTsx3cCSWHvPLkxjEN9qTfWN1sjDTpmgu9UG96VZHesgVgWXfr89\nQ1LRZU50wLqjtg5PGPPb3gaH8xbr6k9sJnCgW2GFxwpynzNFadvPAm2niW7mgloU\nOqSJkZJ6RR2x9UN2lXxw9E/r1rlUBTTZTUw+PVYAAogbhU3AcBknqN+cIVRmWapj\nA5QXRLprzKo0B/fyk2q4Z8tc87PVESGc2Q6tHW9PIjLCT3eEYb/SUpZ8V/byKAjB\nChwhhXaoDl3sFE+w3zbifLnG3ArrsRCjkh+QDneiIQeYCs0DrTel50CIyNqIhF+S\nmzjVoY8QLK2I5Hd5u/px9QxZHRJK8QjCOnZS5aYdcJioX++EjXGEx/hbWbX6MmqW\nAFbEBSt4nt+txquj8NSoGun5uupUkMEJ68HS7Vjhi5wcu4rmfJeQoXpr1Y6+aCuJ\n8mraOcRbv0R/FhV3qwy6pava1F8d7pmJ4eGGEvYeN4x7ntTZAs58i8SEiNGBxhwX\nBk4si61qhVdpP9UGyyB6eSSJcWRilBQFN8NurAhdHYxoXk6UEaT3RLQSAyX8r1mN\nXzwJo5WKOCnxGFykhTOQziQjDMqMgMrx4TeHI0YsUNe3sy8Yxag=\n=9X5U\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-18T12:30:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217548091?v=4","ev