.com/olucianochagas","id":217548091,"login":"olucianochagas","node_id":"U_kgDODPeFOw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/commits/71497738aa2e739004f7b539629740c71dc2b4af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:58:48Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:58:48Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas"},"message":"chore: preservar diretórios scaffold do monorepo (apps, packages, tools)\n\nInclui apenas .gitkeep para garantir que git rastreie os diretórios\ndeclarados em pnpm-workspace.yaml mesmo antes de existirem\nworkspaces reais.\n\n- apps/ — receberá os 5 microsserviços + 2 BFFs + 3 apps MF da Onda 1.\n- packages/ — receberá os 11 packages compartilhados.\n- tools/ — receberá CLI interna e codegen.\n\nEstrutura detalhada na spec § 3:\ndocs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-16-programa-mais-inclusao-decomposicao.md\n\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"6a6562cec6e2f5c8cbdedb5e84794574f964f8a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/trees/6a6562cec6e2f5c8cbdedb5e84794574f964f8a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/commits/71497738aa2e739004f7b539629740c71dc2b4af","verification":{"payload":"tree 6a6562cec6e2f5c8cbdedb5e84794574f964f8a9\nparent 1e6a203c8503b44202db5df19ce18a2e8d8c3f96\nauthor Lucian