ianochagas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/commits/5c8bc5f79992b09068fcc24366412f2f844db48b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:58:21Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:58:21Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas"},"message":"ci: adicionar auto-labeling e gestão de staleness\n\npr-labeler.yml:\n- Usa actions/labeler@v5 (sintaxe v5 com any-glob-to-any-file).\n- Atribui labels conforme paths tocados (config em\n  .github/labeler.yml).\n- pull_request_target — necessário para escrever labels em PRs de\n  forks; safe porque não checkout do código do fork.\n- sync-labels: true — remove labels obsoletas quando paths mudam.\n\nstale.yml:\n- Diariamente às 08:00 UTC (05:00 BRT).\n- Issues: stale após 60 dias, fecha em 14 dias adicionais.\n- PRs: stale após 30 dias, fecha em 14 dias adicionais.\n- exempt-issue-labels: a11y, security, lgpd, bug-critical, wave-*,\n  pinned, help wanted, governance, rfc — issues importantes NUNCA\n  fecham por inatividade.\n- exempt-pr-labels: pinned, wip, blocked, security, lgpd, wave-1,\n  changeset.\n- exempt-draft-pr: true (draft PRs não são marcados).\n- Mensagens em português, com SLAs de a11y/security explicados.\n\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"d4efabad677c3621c996552bcdc77658e18e1783","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/trees/d4efabad677c3621c996552bcdc77658e18e1783"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/commits/5c8bc5f79992b09068fcc24366412f2f844db48b","verification":{"payload":"tree d4efabad677c3621c996552bcdc77658e18e1783\nparent