tarred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/commits/35c282b41336cff2e4c9d3223ecffda6eb2460a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:58:20Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:58:20Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas"},"message":"ci: validar DCO sign-off e Conventional Commits em PRs\n\nDois workflows complementares que enforce as convenções de\nCONTRIBUTING.md:\n\ndco.yml:\n- Itera por cada commit do PR (BASE_SHA..HEAD_SHA).\n- Verifica linha ''Signed-off-by: <author_name> <author_email>''.\n- Mensagem de erro acionável: comando exato para corrigir\n  (git rebase -i --signoff ou git commit --amend --signoff).\n- Detecção segura de commits maliciosos: grep -F (fixed string)\n  com here-string evita interpretação shell.\n\ncommitlint.yml:\n- validate-pr-title: o título do PR vira mensagem do squash merge,\n  então é validado contra commitlint.config.cjs.\n- validate-commits: cada commit individual também é validado.\n\nTipos permitidos (de commitlint.config.cjs): feat, fix, docs,\nstyle, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert + extensões\na11y, security do +Inclusão.\n\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e87ad7a816c89422d5c23c9cac1644e9d6a4249","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/trees/9e87ad7a816c89422d5c23c9cac1644e9d6a4249"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/commits/35c282b41336cff2e4c9d3223ecffda6eb2460a7","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e87ad7a816c89422d5c23c9cac1644e9d6a4249\nparent cf97234aee44a54521f322a48beda54aed598491\nauthor Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com> 1779026300 -0300\ncommitter Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com> 1779026300 -0300\n\nci: validar DCO sign-off e Conventional Commits em PRs\n\nDois workflows complementares que enforce as convenções de\nCONTRIBUTING.md:\n\ndco.yml:\n- Itera por cada commit do PR (BASE_SHA..HEAD_SHA).\n- Verifica linha ''Signed-off-by: <author_name> <author_email>''.\n- Mensagem de erro acionável: comando exato para corrigir\n  (git rebase -i --signoff ou git commit --amend --signoff).\n- Detecção segura de commits maliciosos: grep -F (fixed string)\n  com here-string evita interpretação shell.\n\ncommitlint.yml:\n- validate-pr-title: o título do PR vira mensagem do squash merge,\n  então é validado contra commitlint.config.cjs.\n- validate-commits: cada commit individual também é validado.\n\nTipos permitidos (de commitlint.config.cjs): feat, fix, docs,\nstyle, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert + extensões\na11y, security do +Inclusão.\n\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEE+n17n1yRgmWK7N5YJH5udzcvV18FAmoJyXwACgkQJH5udzcv\nV1/KUA/8CUAgGhMggTV60kroc2tMjGc37lPHjWyMTu6fo7DIuLTYsie/M+AXtwCf\nsDO+Kwww6lYC6DueC6t1a8iY3havpjdeG6bMHkfG5I3P/tQp0rGULoj0l6aDMQJa\nh+hvn0sMHsB2Iv2/6DjzisU0y+bOOPIpqgh7YBh7B8ybGrFJr3AIh+y7LfiSVzh9\nOR4wnc8lGc7Zuvt7B3w6Uqvp8547SQXQstvCSdQfT4AUNfzX81YE1XlPTDKxFzxP\nUdf3oT3kSiDH5yMQSMTmPjxGorebyUCtXOJmXryCuU6MXIYmY3hp5uBdtcIm8l8p\n23wLGM2tWoXk3vwjCiY3cI4orGc6WjETGahzzzVCKzUtFUMK+rkXrgIKAIHN0dyr\ntw9d+mDSYFsrCK1D72s2IewRwlBBEdB0iB5IDyi+7sAkGWbQZa+VTeZ29Pa7xx7q\nTB0cjsrH9HR134QIOYCbSyctDsWL90xDzg8yFDkB3usPGGvdSiC5BwjU+HHcwSxh\nEKTNgKpXO6hsuMq2Rqh5at5yTVclnj69Tv40qsrYAIucjti83hNbJiCCGCSEtWgk\nx2Xwmkiol/t+dY0MKj2JaaY8bWoVahQybmH4Rb2zr663pTYOybdpQOoGuKUYBb3Z\n9T/toxOgoyu+k6I0qmbFCzryY/pcGTqRZp01US5hEAGKqt9RQ3U=\n=VBps\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-18T12:30:00Z"