observability).\n- infra, ci, tools — paths transversais.\n- docs, adr — documentação.\n- lgpd, security, a11y — cross-cutting concerns que mapeiam para\n  múltiplos paths e disparam revisão dedicada via CODEOWNERS.\n- tooling, dependencies, changeset — manutenção.\n\nSintaxe v5: `any-glob-to-any-file` casa contra paths do PR.\nsync-labels: true remove labels obsoletas quando paths mudam.\n\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"290a676236526da8461ecdaae5a6bdda92491b43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/trees/290a676236526da8461ecdaae5a6bdda92491b43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/commits/639564bee4c9c27d8f56e16b44a8cde84f14943e","verification":{"payload":"tree 290a676236526da8461ecdaae5a6bdda92491b43\nparent b891302a55c0a719aad0b80cb1b7e7522588fc8c\nauthor Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com> 1779026262 -0300\ncommitter Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com> 1779026262 -0300\n\nchore(github): adicionar .github/labeler.yml\n\nConfiguração do actions/labeler v5. Mapeia 25+ labels a paths do\nmonorepo, agrupados em categorias:\n\n- area:* — por app/package (auth, programs, citizens, applications,\n  bff-gestor, bff-cidadao, shell, gestor-mf, cidadao-mf, ui,\n  contracts, persistence, messaging, audit, observability).\n- infra, ci, tools — paths transversais.\n- docs, adr — documentação.\n- lgpd, security, a11y — cross-cutting concerns que mapeiam para\n  múltiplos paths e disparam revisão dedicada via CODEOWNERS.\n- tooling, dependencies, changeset — manutenção.\n\nSintaxe v5: `any-glob-to-any-file` casa contra paths do PR.\nsync-labels: true remove labels obsoletas quando paths mudam.\n\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEE+n17n1yRgmWK7N5YJH5udzcvV18FAmoJyVYACgkQJH5udzcv\nV1+6hxAAzcKAaTH8