/olucianochagas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/commits/06200ca4253f6c6b9b8e7fdf781921924eaadc9a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:55:53Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:55:53Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas"},"message":"chore(github): configurar Dependabot com agrupamento de minor/patch\n\nDois ecossistemas + agrupamento inteligente:\n\n1. npm (suporta pnpm desde 2024) — weekly, segunda 07:00 BRT:\n   - Agrupa production-dependencies (minor+patch)\n   - Agrupa development-dependencies (minor+patch)\n   - Agrupa security-patches separadamente (PRs prioritários)\n   - Ignora major bumps automáticos (exigem revisão humana)\n   - Limite 10 PRs abertos\n\n2. github-actions — weekly:\n   - Agrupa todas em 1 PR\n   - Limite 5 PRs\n\nDocker (Onda 2 quando Dockerfiles existirem) deixado comentado\ncomo referência.\n\nReviewers e assignees apontam para @olucianochagas; labels\n\"dependencies\", \"ci\", \"security\" (conforme aplicável).\n\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b88bce36350b1f9cdc694efe0587c2f44306fe9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/trees/3b88bce36350b1f9cdc694efe0587c2f44306fe9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/commits/06200ca4253f6c6b9b8e7fdf781921924eaadc9a","verification":{"payload":"tree 3b88bce36350b1f9cdc694efe0587c2f44306fe9\nparent a849aece8675d092a30894246f4d5880b9786f3c\nauthor Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com> 1779026153 -0300\ncommitter Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com> 1779026153 -0300\n\nchore(github): configurar Dependabot com agrupamento de minor/patch\n\nDois ecossistemas + agrupamento inteligente:\n\n1. npm (suporta pnpm desde 2024) — weekly, segunda 07:00 BRT:\n   - Agrupa production-dependencies (minor+patch)\n   - Agrupa development-dependencies (minor+patch)\n   - Agrupa security-patches separadamente (PRs prioritários)\n   - Ignora major bumps automáticos (exigem revisão humana)\n   - Limite 10 PRs abertos\n\n2. github-actions — weekly:\n   - Agrupa todas em 1 PR\n   - Limite 5 PRs\n\nDocker (Onda 2 quando Dockerfiles existirem) deixado comentado\ncomo referência.\n\nReviewers e assignees apontam para @olucianochagas; labels\n\"dependencies\", \"ci\", \"security\" (conforme aplicável).\n\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEE+n17n1yRgmWK7N5YJH5udzcvV18FAmoJyOkACgkQJH5udzcv\nV1/DJw/5AX06BNMdHDZWREsxA9BaB6stzT39us5Hm//RoO1tfgT14u0zpDLVB0XW\n8GdBUE1/RLpbY7FqKuKmrja3QhrHMfdYq14VBBxgkXAQyjDXxx7D2iYJRWWUzWEP\nbc66q0yLXlLVU1npLz67mGBe/Bvi47vNMuV25eYKyrxp7CyIyVSyJ5alKSWVwAGA\nEmO4tndlAngigXMe8bVBqff3K+E7KNu3syupSBOFRwHe3owl0xXITAg008xsfFSn\n766OIoa/a3Ir+ztZbjNpNWW2y6VO02a6ut+90fG5PO0KrLiep8+3Ev2zZVdo0u9O\ngsW+i292kMWYEypgYmrf7FZcg22IGujKkfbnJysTiBjvhOnTptcHzPC1M0E1z/93\n4sDfiWJMjd4NzWMo+fESroGvaSEtI3JUS6xT1PMfAgZjmGKp1l9s3waIIhWjpilm\ngF40E4wS6JJDFv9XUuV4lGdCrAU9TxQE0IYiW6glbDVWwtOlp6h/k6izM87QsVBd\nqsLp07nqOYG9b6KTDD9Dk5LVM8YVTjCWfZIeoX2i1BEk05nVnqwHS8ojTKYDxpPJ\nByu9nFVhmBzjT6Z/f7fyuoDSlzUL9krCUp6We3YLGeUJv8/zxOzHSP6QTPYZFT7k\nkXs72vBH/IIvSOjcAaHb7YFL+jkZcXk5lwN2D8Hmwxu/+2VgCRA=\n=S3Sx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-18T12:30:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217548091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.co