lizável.\n- 0001 — microsserviços evolutivos por bounded context.\n- 0002 — Module Federation 2.0 + Rspack para frontends.\n- 0003 — monorepo Turborepo + pnpm 11.1.2.\n- 0004 — mensageria NATS JetStream + Outbox Pattern.\n- 0005 — multi-tenancy com 6 camadas de defesa em profundidade.\n- 0006 — criptografia de PII em coluna com KEK por tenant.\n- 0007 — WCAG 2.2 AA como Definition of Done.\n- 0008 — Conventional Commits + DCO + Changesets.\n- 0009 — BDFL transitório como modelo de governança inicial.\n- 0010 — ambiente de desenvolvimento containerizado integralmente.\n\nCada ADR é imutável após aceite. Status muda apenas para\n''deprecated'' ou ''superseded by ADR-MMMM'' — preservando histórico.\ndocs/adr/README.md tem índice e processo de proposição.\n\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"007997ace41e6c687713f7938c177765c8252d30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/trees/007997ace41e6c687713f7938c177765c8252d30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/commits/f8730a5a7298cfbf9fa0fcd5af899b591720374f","verification":{"payload":"tree 007997ace41e6c687713f7938c177765c8252d30\nparent 98b601fa13ab781bb07160af0b8ae850d3d108b6\nauthor Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com> 1779026062 -0300\ncommitter Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com> 1779026062 -0300\n\ndocs(adr): registrar 10 ADRs iniciais + template MADR\n\nArchitecture Decision Records formato MADR (Markdown ADRs):\n- 0000-template — esqueleto reutilizável.\n- 0001 — microsserviços evolutivos por bounded context.\n- 0002 — Module Federation 2.0 + Rspack para frontends.\n- 0003 — monorepo Turborepo + pnpm 11.1.2.\n- 0004 — mensageria NATS JetStream + Outbox Pattern.\n- 0005 — multi-tenancy com 6 camadas de defesa em profundidade.\n- 0006 — criptografia de PII em coluna com KEK por tenant.\n- 0007 — WCAG 2.2 AA como Definition of Done.\n- 0008 — Conventional Commits + DCO + Changesets.\n- 0009 — BDFL transitório como modelo de governança inicial.\n- 0010 — ambiente de desenvolvimento containerizado integralmente.\n\nCada ADR é imutável após aceite. Status muda apenas para\n''deprecated'' ou ''superseded by ADR-MMMM'' — preservando histórico.\ndocs/adr/README.md tem índice e processo de proposição.\n\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEE+n17n1yRgmWK7N5YJH5udzcvV18FAmoJyI4ACgkQJH5udzcv\nV19CMRAAzF/gjglPL1gg+mWTUIVXzFJrI7rQ5XG7N+CQTiFFSVo/Ob/j6iGo+Wnn\nOkaJLS+d8/Q1/meRn/Xj8Q3mgkVWcL3ueHD0qkRXQovF+hXx4Ir6m55mqlphM9p2\nl+4O+FHcVzkg4/RKi0OitiJL9OCepVW+vJh8l37Ja9QX7hbskhwgn73HJGYFmUTR\nHRLTYS3su/9RlyV3X2JoCa9DFs2HvfPNShuuWwYz15rpPMui2sKdJkgwEgjBnrG0\n4NyxPzOa2iKOqLOUaFMMNrPBKyKss0KFgukFTcdOV1kH0C3COPy9z96rhE80M9qC\nVj5JyTK5Jz2V9aCkvoCrGhATAuc1GK7kW0+zwwW83MbJiZy45M7zS00t5OtDtQkC\nziGscC6sDkXIlZL9z4HZFpbITutqEvfa9WLEV8F2NXBBvq0Xq1Jo1g8XgKyyVD5D\nuofRLXXA9Yt8YY3pAuWFDcxhGEUUWv60AcaqwLXVdHN0NOO36/PCoun6IvqNWosr\n7E2N3GHFst/z0xHD3ZNEUj9IWGXm3hJaUVXqY0uNd4ju9B4RGhg3g7GbNYIfgdWH\n2uflgjYWKAkRKMp1kgBmx3sRSPvzUw9GuGHqWgea1zDd9kFO/AtzwJcnHtlDfxYc\ntbmgeiEFSphWj1EYMVeSwUnVHDwYjKpm4OMprpVOtxBoy9RsxJE=\n=k6In\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-18T12:30:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217548091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olucianochagas","id":217548091,"login":"olucianochagas","node_id":"U_kgDODPeFOw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucia