s/olucianochagas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/commits/387f84553e5acf4ff77eb00b01d23dc8f016e0a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:54:02Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:54:02Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas"},"message":"build: adicionar tsconfig.base.json strict\n\nConfig base estendida por todos os workspaces. Habilita:\n- Strict + extras: noUncheckedIndexedAccess, noImplicitOverride,\n  noImplicitReturns, noFallthroughCasesInSwitch, useUnknownInCatchVariables.\n- Higiene: noUnusedLocals, noUnusedParameters, allowUnreachableCode false.\n- ESM: module ESNext, moduleResolution Bundler, verbatimModuleSyntax,\n  isolatedModules (exigência do swc/esbuild que Vitest e Rspack usam).\n- Decorators: experimentalDecorators + emitDecoratorMetadata (NestJS).\n- Performance: incremental, skipLibCheck, skipDefaultLibCheck.\n\nAplica strict noUncheckedIndexedAccess que é particularmente valioso\nem código LGPD: força tratar array[index] como T | undefined.\n\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"466d123fb2c0bfefb34a83364f72d59169528c7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/trees/466d123fb2c0bfefb34a83364f72d59169528c7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/commits/387f84553e5acf4ff77eb00b01d23dc8f016e0a2","verification":{"payload":"tree 466d123fb2c0bfefb34a83364f72d59169528c7e\nparent 6d4158eba797e6fa435cbe77731b66f7a81c6156\nauthor Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com> 1779026042 -0300\ncommitter Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com> 1779026042 -0300\n\nbuild: adicionar tsconfig.base.json strict\n\nConfig base estendida por todos os workspaces. Habilita:\n- Strict + extras: noUncheckedIndexedAccess, noImplicitOverride,\n  noImplicitReturns, noFallthroughCasesInSwitch, useUnknownInCatchVariables.\n- Higiene: noUnusedLocals, noUnusedParameters, allowUnreachableCode false.\n- ESM: module ESNext, moduleResolution Bundler, verbatimModuleSyntax,\n  isolatedModules (exigência do swc/esbuild que Vitest e Rspack usam).\n- Decorators: experimentalDecorators + emitDecoratorMetadata (NestJS).\n- Performance: incremental, skipLibCheck, skipDefaultLibCheck.\n\nAplica strict noUncheckedIndexedAccess que é particularmente valioso\nem código LGPD: força tratar array[index] como T | undefined.\n\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEE+n17n1yRgmWK7N5YJH5udzcvV18FAmoJyHoACgkQJH5udzcv\nV19fnw/+KaVuU1pzB1yaVyAd0JB/zmwc9A4H2mt3HL7xcWxZ8w8UBARbEQdi7VuO\nz3inJKc3kkfLvh7x/zxQ1eMi8P/nnoooWUmUvtCgw6J7Z6l8Ppjtx4Yvrm5PFR7g\nRWq12etj/Kd2KdIV9hjhsljDOOzkjKMWN7FaL+kQ563QNapIz///JLvevle5iF5d\n2nk1JRy4JKuuijEP4XQWsoUfxNuWIarVQN0GA5dt5Px9kjc8Xc5i/vkVVnWnOReA\nKiF+lx0sEYR2N30ky3tiC6kNEuYfQrCeTXow1ehaO7WKWMHycojsp37F7+0wjfOV\niGHQT41leT70ywRZ/sJpR/gOb77MrgJHG9LuBPm+Qa4NAdVAEvCSH9rhHUFyAEE/\nhZNOogIUeaMh7Qbbyh8yRD4COXVBPLZFw8hc8nrzsD8hskpCthSpsj+he29SOvsS\nj7cwgqSaYFR+pMmQVivcbXuC6iDBRkK80iErOzpL4yzPXUOCL1Il16oyu4oWwBI/\nRj6tR/m8P+b0mH7Dewk3jmVIEU/oRzdQSyUokBuqSTcAIn5liObdlqb82sfhWDMn\nAGM9Z9SAlMb1sADUoCEI8wA1wucKYjEg7xnawaBBG5uxTDzF4l++ifM9AqzsltbJ\nImNx86OOCkyk2gR6niVrQXHGRAwxyBUetLqfsT/Z0lfTEcxZqbE=\n=PKR1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-18T12:30:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217548091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/follower