nochagas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olucianochagas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/commits/6d4158eba797e6fa435cbe77731b66f7a81c6156/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:54:02Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:54:02Z","email":"olucianochagas@gmail.com","name":"Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas"},"message":"build: migrar de npm para pnpm 11.1.2 via corepack\n\nMotivações concretas analisadas no brainstorming:\n- Elimina phantom dependencies (crítico em packages/contracts com\n  singletons Module Federation).\n- ~3x mais rápido em CI; 50% menos uso de disco via content-addressable\n  store; hoisting previsível com peer deps.\n- pnpm 11 Catalogs centralizam versões compartilhadas (React 19, NestJS\n  11, Prisma 6, Vitest, Playwright, etc.) — elimina drift entre\n  workspaces.\n- onlyBuiltDependencies (allow-list) restringe scripts postinstall —\n  defesa contra supply chain attack.\n\nMudanças:\n- package.json: packageManager pnpm@11.1.2; removido campo \"workspaces\"\n  (pnpm lê de pnpm-workspace.yaml). Adicionados 20+ scripts e\n  devDependencies base (Changesets, Husky, lint-staged, commitlint,\n  Prettier, syncpack, rimraf, TypeScript, Turborepo).\n- pnpm-workspace.yaml: declara apps/*, packages/*, tools/*; catalog\n  com 50+ deps versionadas; onlyBuiltDependencies para prisma, argon2,\n  Rspack bindings, Playwright browsers, Husky.\n- pnpm-lock.yaml gerado pelo `pnpm install`.\n\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"4011bf3361ac162435b3ef16da3df9409e4c0e3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/trees/4011bf3361ac162435b3ef16da3df9409e4c0e3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olucianochagas/mais-inclusao/git/commits/6d4158eba797e6fa435cbe77731b66f7a81c6156","verification":{"payload":"tree 4011bf3361ac162435b3ef16da3df9409e4c0e3f\nparent 57dec25f39d5184ead867951eb1bf124b35b373e\nauthor Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com> 1779026042 -0300\ncommitter Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com> 1779026042 -0300\n\nbuild: migrar de npm para pnpm 11.1.2 via corepack\n\nMotivações concretas analisadas no brainstorming:\n- Elimina phantom dependencies (crítico em packages/contracts com\n  singletons Module Federation).\n- ~3x mais rápido em CI; 50% menos uso de disco via content-addressable\n  store; hoisting previsível com peer deps.\n- pnpm 11 Catalogs centralizam versões compartilhadas (React 19, NestJS\n  11, Prisma 6, Vitest, Playwright, etc.) — elimina drift entre\n  workspaces.\n- onlyBuiltDependencies (allow-list) restringe scripts postinstall —\n  defesa contra supply chain attack.\n\nMudanças:\n- package.json: packageManager pnpm@11.1.2; removido campo \"workspaces\"\n  (pnpm lê de pnpm-workspace.yaml). Adicionados 20+ scripts e\n  devDependencies base (Changesets, Husky, lint-staged, commitlint,\n  Prettier, syncpack, rimraf, TypeScript, Turborepo).\n- pnpm-workspace.yaml: declara apps/*, packages/*, tools/*; catalog\n  com 50+ deps versionadas; onlyBuiltDependencies para prisma, argon2,\n  Rspack bindings, Playwright browsers, Husky.\n- pnpm-lock.yaml gerado pelo `pnpm install`.\n\nSigned-off-by: Luciano Douglas Machado Chagas <olucianochagas@gmail.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEE+n17n1yRgmWK7N5YJH5udzcvV18FAmoJyHoACgkQJH5udzcv\nV19JNxAAhpuJZF3/i2zRz/3G1btXIbM7+PwWl33gx+KbY8hEOGKvYaqTbp9h+9eL\nuz/UEXCiEx+nmkNspXoOINTMontJ