pos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/netstacks/netstacks-crawler/commit/99ea560af3728ccafc09dfdda3340de709dee98c","node_id":"C_kwDOSgA8jNoAKDk5ZWE1NjBhZjM3MjhjY2FmYzA5ZGZkZGEzMzQwZGU3MDlkZWU5OGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/netstacks/netstacks-crawler/commit/41599dd7d4b827357852adeb0d9a9349188ad1d7","sha":"41599dd7d4b827357852adeb0d9a9349188ad1d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netstacks/netstacks-crawler/commits/41599dd7d4b827357852adeb0d9a9349188ad1d7"}],"sha":"99ea560af3728ccafc09dfdda3340de709dee98c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netstacks/netstacks-crawler/commits/99ea560af3728ccafc09dfdda3340de709dee98c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144375116?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/casey-davis","id":144375116,"login":"casey-davis","node_id":"U_kgDOCJr9TA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netstacks/netstacks-crawler/commits/41599dd7d4b827357852adeb0d9a9349188ad1d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T22:31:02Z","email":"casey-davis@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Casey Davis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T22:34:59Z","email":"casey-davis@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Casey Davis"},"message":"Add public API docs surface and make /api always credential-gated\n\nSplit the Swagger surface into a curated public spec and the full internal\none, and harden API auth so the public API is controlled solely by API keys.\n\n- Public spec GET /api/openapi.json + browsable UI GET /api/docs, served\n  under /api/ (reachable without SSO). Built by Web/API/PublicDocs.pm: clones\n  the live Swagger doc, filters to the %PUBLIC_PATHS read-only allow-list,\n  drops the internal X-REMOTE_USER param, forces API-key-only security, and\n  prunes empty tag sections. Full internal /swagger.json + /swagger-ui\n  unchanged.\n- /api/* is always credential-gated (API key, or verified SSO for the SPA).\n  The no_auth \"open mode\" toggle no longer grants API access, and a key only\n  gets its owner''s roles even when auth is off (AuthN.pm no_guest gate + DBIC\n  get_user_roles in_storage check).\n- SPA: \"API docs\" link + version in the statusbar.\n- docs/public-api.md: public API guide + ALB OIDC perimeter runbook.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"54733a0e4be555667a5df5634e6bdcf35b1961ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netstacks/netstacks-crawler/git/trees/54733a0e4be555667a5df5634e6bdcf35b1961ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netstacks/netstacks-crawler/git/commits/41599dd7d4b827357852adeb0d9a9349188ad1d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144375116?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/casey-davis","id":144375116,"login":"casey-davis","node_id":"U_kgDOCJr9TA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/netstacks/netstacks-crawler/commit/41599dd7d4b827357852adeb0d9a9349188ad1d7","node_id":"C_kwDOSgA8jNoAKDQxNTk5ZGQ3ZDRiODI3MzU3ODUyYWRlYjBkOWE5MzQ5MTg4YWQxZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/netstacks/netstacks-crawler/commit/88975193517ae46e876415f15a4acf935bc81c93","sha":"88975193517ae46e876415f15a4acf935bc81c93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netstacks/netstacks-crawler/commits/88975193517ae46e876415f15a4acf935bc81c93"}],"sha":"41599dd7d4b827357852adeb0d9a9349188ad1d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netstacks/netstacks-crawler/commits/41599dd7d4b827357852adeb0d9a9349188ad1d7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144375116?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/casey-davis","id":144375116,"login":"casey-davis","node_id":"U_kgDOCJr9TA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netstacks/netstacks-crawler/commits/88975193517ae46e876415f15a4acf935bc81c93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T18:20:19Z","email":"casey-davis@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Casey Davis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T18:20:19Z","email":"casey-davis@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Casey Davis"},"message":"Device Addresses tab: show interface IP, drop repeated device IP, add count\n\nEvery device_ip row''s ''ip'' is the device''s own management IP (identical on\nevery row) while ''alias'' is the address configured on the interface. The\nAddresses tab was showing ''ip'' as the Address (so it repeated the device IP)\nand mislabelled ''alias'' as ''Description''. Now Address shows ''alias'', the\nredundant device-IP column is removed, and the device details endpoint reports\nan ''addresses'' count so the tab shows a badge like the others.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aff49ff5bce9f3347a45d56ba3721146b4cad77b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netstacks/netstacks-crawler/git/trees/aff49ff5bce9f3347a45d56ba3721146b4cad77b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netstacks/netstacks-crawler/git/commits/88975193517ae46e876415f15a4acf935bc81c93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144375116?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casey-davis/followers","following_url":"https: