ula; «مبررات التسويات» only when written.\n- Location details and the subject asset swap places (06/07); hidden optional pairs no longer leave\n  gaps (pairs reflow); «وصف العيوب الإنشائية» is not printed; sections renumber without gaps.\n- Attachments and surroundings: empty «أخرى» is dropped and «يوجد» prints as ✓; approaches row and\n  facade column are centred; the comparables price-per-metre note and the grey captions under maps\n  and property photos are removed.\n- Boundaries are listed north, east, south, west everywhere (report, approved copy, settings,\n  intake/property edit, inspector, engineering office).","tree":{"sha":"727cbddd64013fa21aae136428e23f97208754c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuadDigital/case_study/git/trees/727cbddd64013fa21aae136428e23f97208754c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuadDigital/case_study/git/commits/aab528bd41b5817af8287b9702eafa227eb521fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121067316?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omr-ql","id":121067316,"login":"omr-ql","node_id":"U_kgDOBzdXNA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BuadDigital/case_study/commit/aab528bd