i-kit: apply all 9 implementable sections of\n  docs/ejadah-ui-kit-decisions-2026-09-17/DECISIONS.md — token values,\n  buttons, tables, ListPager, dialogs/tabs, forms, toolbar +\n  FilterChips/BulkActionBar (new), SideSheet (new),\n  TransactionRow/ResponsiveList (new). Section 10 stays out of scope,\n  reserved for Suliman''s decision.\n- Wire the 47-type property-usage catalog into the استخدام العقار field\n  inspector feature and the bourse form''s النوع / الاستخدام dropdown.\n- Hide اسم المالك entirely (not just disable it) for clients whose\n  ClientFieldPolicy.requiresOwnerName is false (currently Nabr).\n- Remove the orphaned old design-sync export (project b7318506) and the\n  unused Tajawal font copies under apps/shell/public/ejadah.\n- Update the finance-billing and specialist-intake-to-distribution e2e\n  journeys for ListPager''s new range-label/jump-field markup.","tree":{"sha":"243ffcd6fb59441ac3d1dfb098c2337dbb4455d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuadDigital/case_study/git/trees/243ffcd6fb59441ac3d1dfb098c2337dbb4455d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuadDigital/case_study/git/commits/aa07495d4de043b43b4e4df0d6e9c2fc7ada2da1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121067316?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omr-ql","id":121067316,"login":"omr-ql","node_id":"U_kgDOBzdXNA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com