T11:51:34Z","email":"omar.bamusa.888@gmail.com","name":"OMR"},"message":"Lock the specialist''s property review once مدخلات المعاين is confirmed\n\nThe form previously stayed editable forever after «تأكيد مدخلات\nالمعاين» — the button just relabeled to «حفظ تعديلات المعاينة» and kept\naccepting saves with no lock. Now acceptance locks the review (reopening\nvia «إعادة للتصحيح» still unlocks it), and مطابقة الصك على الطبيعة locks\ntogether with it since both are decided by the same specialist review.","tree":{"sha":"fdba0a7c5c5ee03593c899d0a794b8fc26c017aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuadDigital/case_study/git/trees/fdba0a7c5c5ee03593c899d0a794b8fc26c017aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BuadDigital/case_study/git/commits/c0ddf7ccabedd24ac9bf3efe6da445022857bab1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121067316?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omr-ql","id":121067316,"login":"omr-ql","node_id":"U_kgDOBzdXNA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omr-ql","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BuadDigital/case_study/commit/c0ddf7ccabedd24ac9bf3efe6da445022857bab1","node_id":"C_kwDOSgA_EtoAKGMwZGRmN2NjYWJlZGQyNGFjOWJmM2VmZTZkYTQ0NTAyMjg1N2JhYjE","pare