o a category page listed every size as\nits own card. Category pages now skip products that hang below another one in\na variant tree (`hasVariantParent`).\n\nThe filter runs after paging, so a page can hold fewer cards; \"Load more\"\nstays available when a whole page was variants.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"120800e105f43bb874f2ddfe22c1e229e8a0e3f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/git/trees/120800e105f43bb874f2ddfe22c1e229e8a0e3f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/git/commits/242579289ae4c7437a48a138d252643b467d7387","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/242579289ae4c7437a48a138d252643b467d7387","node_id":"C_kwDOSgK4RtoAKDI0MjU3OTI4OWFlNGM3NDM3YTQ4YTEzOGQyNTI2NDNiNDY3ZDczODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/3522cd2496239a5a2caf7449645f930b00d8b675","sha":"3522cd2496239a5a2caf7449645f930b00d8b675","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/3522cd2496239a5a2caf7449645f930b00d8b675"}],"sha":"242579289ae4c7437a48a138d252643b467d7387","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/242579289ae4c7437a48a138d252643b467d7387"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40278766?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amnael1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amnael1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amnael1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amnael1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amnael1","id":40278766,"login":"amnael1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMjc4NzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amnael1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amnael1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.gith