:"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/90edfeab9dceb6ad0282ed11bb8dee2ddf9874b9","node_id":"C_kwDOSgK4RtoAKDkwZWRmZWFiOWRjZWI2YWQwMjgyZWQxMWJiOGRlZTJkZGY5ODc0Yjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/3522cd2496239a5a2caf7449645f930b00d8b675","sha":"3522cd2496239a5a2caf7449645f930b00d8b675","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/3522cd2496239a5a2caf7449645f930b00d8b675"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/a4c0a0d6dee65897fbf6f3ac22d1f7ef8e374f78","sha":"a4c0a0d6dee65897fbf6f3ac22d1f7ef8e374f78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/a4c0a0d6dee65897fbf6f3ac22d1f7ef8e374f78"}],"sha":"90edfeab9dceb6ad0282ed11bb8dee2ddf9874b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/90edfeab9dceb6ad0282ed11bb8dee2ddf9874b9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/3522cd2496239a5a2caf7449645f930b00d8b675/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T05:53:59Z","email":"dominic.fritschi@viu.ch","name":"Dominic Fritschi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T05:53:59Z","email":"dominic.fritschi@viu.ch","name":"Dominic Fritschi"},"message":"feat(examples): colour and size selectors for dynamic variants in storefront-demo\n\nA DYNAMIC_VARIANT product (root → colour → size) now gets one radio group per\nattribute instead of no picker at all. The selectors show on the root and on\nevery variant page, with the current variant''s values selected; a complete\nselection navigates to that variant''s own URL, a partial one waits for the\nmissing axis. Values carry Emporix''s localized names and sizes sort XXS…4XL.\n\nThe root''s `variants` map is documented to hold the accumulated attributes,\nbut Emporix leaves `variantAttributes` out of it for storefront (anonymous)\ntokens, measured on the viu tenant. The picker therefore takes the sellable\ncodes from the map and reads those variants with one `searchByCodes`; each\ncarries its inherited and own attributes.\n\nOn the root and on intermediate nodes \"Add to cart\" is disabled with a hint,\nsince only sellable leaves can go into the cart. Template variants keep the\nexisting link list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"472caa2fee539ab4f2f16d875291e2af55330aa6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/git/trees/472caa2fee539ab4f2f16d875291e2af55330aa6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/git/commits/3522cd2496239a5a2caf7449645f930b00d8b675","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/3522cd2496239a5a2caf7449645f930b00d8b675","node_id":"C_kwDOSgK4RtoAKDM1MjJjZDI0OTYyMzlhNWEyY2FmNzQ0OTY0NWY5MzBiMDBkOGI2NzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/c2050634fc95299add6753a2773fad65aff2b16e","sha":"c2050634fc95299add6753a2773fad65aff2b16e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/c2050634fc95299add6753a2773fad65aff2b16e"}],"sha":"3522cd2496239a5a2caf7449645f930b00d8b675","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/3522cd2496239a5a2caf7449645f930b00d8b675"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40278766?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amnael1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amnael1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amnael1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amnael1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amnael1","id":40278766,"login":"amnael1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMjc4NzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amnael1/