"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/d6b37382700578a86cb8802ee30c1ebb6f3d950d","node_id":"C_kwDOSgK4RtoAKGQ2YjM3MzgyNzAwNTc4YTg2Y2I4ODAyZWUzMGMxZWJiNmYzZDk1MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/1e22b5503c3afe62f323324fa63edb9445137e11","sha":"1e22b5503c3afe62f323324fa63edb9445137e11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/1e22b5503c3afe62f323324fa63edb9445137e11"}],"sha":"d6b37382700578a86cb8802ee30c1ebb6f3d950d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/d6b37382700578a86cb8802ee30c1ebb6f3d950d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/1e22b5503c3afe62f323324fa63edb9445137e11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T08:06:46Z","email":"dominic.fritschi@viu.ch","name":"Dominic Fritschi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T08:06:46Z","email":"dominic.fritschi@viu.ch","name":"Dominic Fritschi"},"message":"fix(angular): key the company-dependent reads on the active company\n\nA switch between two companies drops the cart id, which put injectActiveCart\nback on its «no cart yet» entry: still fresh, not invalidated, and holding the\nprevious company''s cart. From no company the switch''s invalidation happened to\ncatch it, since it matches key elements equal to the old id (null). The cart,\nthe bootstrap, payment modes and customer addresses now key on the active\ncompany, the four reads React keys on it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"833c619440b55cd9c1bb0b2bc1f4e33da5009e53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/git/trees/833c619440b55cd9c1bb0b2bc1f4e33da5009e53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/git/commits/1e22b5503c3afe62f323324fa63edb9445137e11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/empor