ARIANT parentVariantId:<id>, and a VARIANT only ever belongs\nto a PARENT_VARIANT, so for any other type it can only answer [] — on the viu\ntenant, where every product is BASIC, that was one wasted request per product\npage. isVariantParent in examples/shared reads the type of the product the\npage already has; storefront-demo renders the picker and next-server-first\nmakes the call only for a parent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a1a251d791764a7d952a5eff6b178463c455b25b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/git/trees/a1a251d791764a7d952a5eff6b178463c455b25b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/git/commits/1b20b07fefb9911812c54c8bbbd7284b5061b523","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/1b20b07fefb9911812c54c8bbbd7284b5061b523","node_id":"C_kwDOSgK4RtoAKDFiMjBiMDdmZWZiOTkxMTgxMmM1NGM4YmJiZDcyODRiNTA2MWI1MjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/88a0b1ccd72b5756332e31b91262fb1788a5480d","sha":"88a0b1ccd72b5756332e31b91262fb1788a5480d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/88a0b1ccd72b5756332e31b91262fb1788a5480d"}],"sha":"1b20b07fefb9911812c54c8bbbd7284b5061b523","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/1b20b07fefb9911812c54c8bbbd7284b5061b523"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40278766?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amnael1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amnael1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amnael1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amnael1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amnael1","id":40278766,"login":"amnael1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMjc4NzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user