mmitter":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:47:41Z","email":"dominic.fritschi@viu.ch","name":"Dominic Fritschi"},"message":"fix(react): export useOrderTransitions from the package root\n\nThe root lists its hooks by hand and missed useOrderTransitions (and its\noptions type) when 4.1.0 added it to ./hooks. A test now fails whenever a\nhook in ./hooks is missing from the root. The JSDoc examples of\nuseEmporixQuery and useEmporixInfinite called brands.list, which does not\nexist; they use brands.listBrands and fees.list now.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1818a40dbb5d4986f4b664f2c8106bc215cbf56f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/git/trees/1818a40dbb5d4986f4b664f2c8106bc215cbf56f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/git/commits/f729058b01a95f931bf0bcd7781c45b273ef8027","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/f729058b01a95f931bf0bcd7781c45b273ef8027","node_id":"C_kwDOSgK4RtoAKGY3MjkwNThiMDFhOTVmOTMxYmYwYmNkNzc4MWM0NWIyNzNlZjgwMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/f151f7ca11c32d1aa68355a5efbf36286e7b78ac","sha":"f151f7ca11c32d1aa68355a5efbf36286e7b78ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/f151f7ca11c32d1aa68355a5efbf36286e7b78ac"}],"sha":"f729058b01a95f931bf0bcd7781c45b273ef8027","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/f729058b01a95f931bf0bcd7781c45b273ef8027"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/f151f7ca11c32d1aa68355a5efbf36286e7b78ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:47:28Z","email":"dominic.fritschi@viu.ch","name":"Dominic Fritschi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:47:28Z","email":"dominic.fritschi@viu.ch","name":"Dominic Fritschi"},"message":"fix(sdk): export the types public methods use from the package root\n\nTwenty types that public methods take or return were reachable only through\na subpath or not at all, against the README''s promise that the root\nre-exports everything: imports.getLicense() returned an ImportLicense\nnobody could name. A typecheck test now imports each one from the root.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"49e9374b7507d80549041c7ecda05c5be84f5f38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/git/trees/49e9374b7507d80549041c7ecda05c5be84f5f38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/git/commits/f151f7ca11c32d1aa68355a5efbf36286e7b78ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/f151f7ca11c32d1aa68355a5efbf36286e7b78ac","node_id":"C_kwDOSgK4RtoAKGYxNTFmN2NhMTFjMzJkMWFhNjgzNTVhNWVmYmYzNjI4NmU3Yjc4YWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/a3089c1fd12f73ae8b6ab9e0a48bb785fcd553c0","sha":"a3089c1fd12f73ae8b6ab9e0a48bb785fcd553c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/a3089c1fd12f73ae8b6ab9e0a48bb785fcd553c0"}],"sha":"f151f7ca11c32d1aa68355a5efbf36286e7b78ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/f151f7ca11c32d1aa68355a5efbf36286e7b78ac"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/3a6ec9594c6023bea2c26e5dd766d22fee2c27de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:40:25Z","email":"dominic.fritschi@viu.ch","name":"Dominic Fritschi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:40:25Z","email":"dominic.fritschi@viu.ch","name":"Dominic Fritschi"},"message":"fix(examples): redeploy the storefront demo when examples/shared changes\n\nThe demo imports its response adapters from examples/shared, which the\nPages workflow''s path filter left out, so a change there shipped nothing.\