he viu tenant hit exactly that\non 2026-10-05. Both examples now send the selected mode''s code (e.g. `invoice`)\nas method next to customAttributes.modeId. The custom fallback is unchanged.\n\nnext-server-first: the form posts only the mode id, so the Server Action reads\nthe mode list itself, in the same Promise.all as the cart and the zones.\n\nangular-storefront-demo: buildInput takes the mode from paymentModes(), so the\npayload preview shows the method before the order is placed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38b67f953cc5e0255fe5e41fd1dcf48b6e415a2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/git/trees/38b67f953cc5e0255fe5e41fd1dcf48b6e415a2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/git/commits/f59287287de299ee06bf1342f129a031a562a30f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/f59287287de299ee06bf1342f129a031a562a30f","node_id":"C_kwDOSgK4RtoAKGY1OTI4NzI4N2RlMjk5ZWUwNmJmMTM0MmYxMjlhMDMxYTU2MmEzMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/da1bfc91fd8ff1a06e087d45d49ab167575afe86","sha":"da1bfc91fd8ff1a06e087d45d49ab167575afe86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/da1bfc91fd8ff1a06e087d45d49ab167575afe86"}],"sha":"f59287287de299ee06bf1342f129a031a562a30f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/f59287287de299ee06bf1342f129a031a562a30f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/e09995cadfcc2139c02705770aac5ef2f2326ed5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:08:08Z","email":"dominic.fritschi@viu.ch","name":"Dominic Fritschi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:08:08Z","email":"dominic.fritschi@viu.ch","name":"Dominic Fritschi"},"message":"docs(examples): describe the redesigned storefront demo\n\nC