sdk/commits/8291b2245452029cc2ee23ab936af25ced5be91d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/b89a81a9eed1cdbf781757d5e5f09820f6cb04af","sha":"b89a81a9eed1cdbf781757d5e5f09820f6cb04af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/b89a81a9eed1cdbf781757d5e5f09820f6cb04af"}],"sha":"f3e7ad5eeffd593d91f1c8f23d345359a43e0c1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/f3e7ad5eeffd593d91f1c8f23d345359a43e0c1e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/b89a81a9eed1cdbf781757d5e5f09820f6cb04af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:51:59Z","email":"dominic.fritschi@viu.ch","name":"Dominic Fritschi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:51:59Z","email":"dominic.fritschi@viu.ch","name":"Dominic Fritschi"},"message":"docs(sdk): document published mappings and aborted import runs\n\nThe Import Service change of 2026-09-28 (published mappings for import\nruns) arrived through the bot''s sync in #345 as types only. The facade\ntypes alias the generated ones, so `mappings`, `mappingVersions`,\n`dryRunPublished` and the `ABORTED` status were already usable, but\nnothing described them, nor the trap that came with them: a run refused\nfor never-published mappings still answers 200 and only then finishes\nABORTED.\n\n- JSDoc on ImportRun, ImportRunStream, ImportRunInput, ImportRunStatus,\n  triggerRun and retryRun.\n- docs/import.md: a section on published and draft mappings, the Import\n  Tool as the place where mappings are published, the preview count\n  corrected from 15 to 24 operations.\n- docs/emporix-upstream-changelog.md: the 2026-09-28 entry, and a\n  2026-10-02 entry recording that the Import Tool and cloud function\n  hosting releases changed no API.\n- docs/cloud-functions.md: the hosting guide link moved to its\n  user-guides URL (the old one answers 307).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"72eeafa662e39f642d9ba155a216ff265d7c2190","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/git/trees/72eeafa662e39f642d9ba155a216ff265d7c2190"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/git/commits/b89a81a9eed1cdbf781757d5e5f09820f6cb04af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/b89a81a9eed1cdbf781757d5e5f09820f6cb04af","node_id":"C_kwDOSgK4RtoAKGI4OWE4MWE5ZWVkMWNkYmY3ODE3NTdkNWU1ZjA5ODIwZjZjYjA0YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commit/8291b2245452029cc2ee23ab936af25ced5be91d","sha":"8291b2245452029cc2ee23ab936af25ced5be91d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/8291b2245452029cc2ee23ab936af25ced5be91d"}],"sha":"b89a81a9eed1cdbf781757d5e5f09820f6cb04af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits/b89a81a9eed1cdbf781757d5e5f09820f6cb04af"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/viuteam/emporix-sdk/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=1707a7ce08fbe39b407404d6d26a4d11112fee2a&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A49%3A20.448Z"}');
