,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/43cab4a234fa316ee1954e8c50bc911f2bb805ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T12:38:50Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T12:38:50Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat(games): add stroop","tree":{"sha":"3e0d9500d6d532dbfc8d2a1ccdd50d60147cf2c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/3e0d9500d6d532dbfc8d2a1ccdd50d60147cf2c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/43cab4a234fa316ee1954e8c50bc911f2bb805ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/43cab4a234fa316ee1954e8c50bc911f2bb805ff","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKDQzY2FiNGEyMzRmYTMxNmVlMTk1NGU4YzUwYmM5MTFmMmJiODA1ZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/5fa1654550978f360f65388bc13d93be8abfb74c","sha":"5fa1654550978f360f65388bc13d93be8abfb74c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/5fa1654550978f360f65388bc13d93be8abfb74c"}],"sha":"43cab4a234fa316ee1954e8c50bc911f2bb805ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/43cab4a234fa316ee1954e8c50bc911f2bb805ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/5fa1654550978f360f65388bc13d93be8abfb74c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T16:47:38Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T16:47:38Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat(games): add simon says\n\nWatch the four pastel pads light up in a sequence, then tap them back\nin the same order. Each round adds one step.\n\n- src/games/simonStore.ts — sequence stored as an array of PadId. start()\n  seeds round 1; showStep() is driven by the view''s effect that walks\n  through the sequence with timed setTimeouts. tap() advances progress\n  on match, ends the game on a wrong tap. Sequence does NOT persist\n  across panel opens (game is ~10-30s and the showing phase needs to\n  replay anyway), but best (longest sequence reproduced) does.\n  Difficulty curve: flash 540ms at round 1, shaves 24ms per round,\n  floored at 280ms — gets snappier without becoming impossible.\n\n- src/games/SimonBoard.tsx — 2x2 quadrant board on a deep purple frame\n  with a radial-glow backdrop. Four pads each with a distinct identity:\n    💧 cyan/teal · ☀️ amber · 🌸 rose · 🌙 lavender\n  Resting state uses a dimmer gradient; flash adds a brighter gradient,\n  outer glow, and ring. Emoji scale-pulses 1.18x on flash. Pads disable\n  during the ''showing'' phase to prevent cheating.\n  Center disc shows a circular play button on idle/over, or ''progress/round''\n  HUD while playing.\n  Status banner flips between ''ready'', ''watch · round N'', ''your turn · k/N'',\n  and ''that''s not it · best M''. Memoized Pad keeps per-flash re-renders\n  isolated.\n\nWired through launcherStore (new ''simon'' id), GameLauncher (teal-amber-\npurple chip with Brain icon, 9th tile), BoredomBuster (full board + a\nlive 2x2 mini-preview that lights the currently-flashing or last-tapped\npad).","tree":{"sha":"cb266b50cf3e6c333909e517d70e91d0119e2814","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/cb266b50cf3e6c333909e517d70e91d0119e2814"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/5fa1654550978f360f65388bc13d93be8abfb74c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/5fa1654550978f360f65388bc13d93be8abfb74c","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKDVmYTE2NTQ1NTA5NzhmMzYwZjY1Mzg4YmMxM2Q5M2JlOGFiZmI3NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/4d8f7735c7beda996c59e6173a0dc9ecb71da14d","sha":"4d8f7735c7beda996c59e6173a0dc9ecb71da14d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/4d8f7735c7beda996c59e6173a0dc9ecb71da14d"}],"sha":"5fa1654550978f360f65388bc13d93be8abfb74c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/5fa1654550978f360f65388bc13d93be8abfb74c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/4d8f7735c7beda996c59e6173a0dc9ecb71da14d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T16:39:45Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T16:39:45Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat(games): add word scramble\n\nUnscramble a 5-letter word by tapping pool letters into answer slots.\n65-word kid-friendly dictionary (angel, apple, baker, bloom, bunny,\ncandy, daisy, dream, fairy, flame, grape, honey, jelly, lotus, music,\nocean, peach, pearl, piano, queen, river, smile, sunny, tiger, tulip,\n...). Scramble guaranteed != original.\n\n- src/games/wordScrambleStore.ts — stable per-letter ids drive\n  framer-motion layoutId moves between pool and slots. Auto-checks\n  on completion: correct -> won + streak bump; wrong -> board shakes\n  for 480ms then auto-clears unlocked slots back to the pool while\n  preserving locked hint letters. Hint reveals one correct letter\n  in its slot (locked, golden border) and counts a hint usage.\n  Shuffle re-randomizes the pool order without breaking layout\n  animation continuity. localStorage persistence; tracks lifetime\n  solved count, current streak, best streak, total hints used.\n\n- src/games/WordScrambleBoard.tsx — answer slots row (dashed when\n  empty, accent when filled, gold for hinted, green on win) above\n  a soft pastel pool tile cluster. Pool tiles are pink/purple/cyan\n  gradient with springy hover lift. Letters fly between pool and\n  slot via shared layoutId. Board shakes laterally on wrong guess.\n  Win banner shows the lower-case word + hints used + ''next word''\n  button. Memoized Slot + PoolTile for 60fps on every tap.\n\nWired through launcherStore (new ''wordscramble'' id), GameLauncher\n(pink/purple/cyan chip with Type icon, new 8th tile), and\nBoredomBuster pill mini (5-pip slot row over 5-pip pool row preview).","tree":{"sha":"14bc19bd9b2e57cd49a6d397a9b29292d6d75712","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/14bc19bd9b2e57cd49a6d397a9b29292d6d75712"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/4d8f7735c7beda996c59e6173a0dc9ecb71da14d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/4d8f7735c7beda996c59e6173a0dc9ecb71da14d","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKDRkOGY3NzM1YzdiZWRhOTk2YzU5ZTYxNzNhMGRjOWVjYjcxZGExNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/cae96ee419dfa8f352d9021a6bb65940e6288e02","sha":"cae96ee419dfa8f352d9021a6bb65940e6288e02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/cae96ee419dfa8f352d9021a6bb65940e6288e02"}],"sha":"4d8f7735c7beda996c59e6173a0dc9ecb71da14d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/4d8f7735c7beda996c59e6173a0dc9ecb71da14d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/cae96ee419dfa8f352d9021a6bb65940e6288e02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T16:35:09Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T16:35:09Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat(games): add lights out + 3-column launcher grid\n\nLights Out:\n- src/games/lightsOutStore.ts — 5x5 grid; toggle() flips the clicked\n  cell + 4 orthogonal neighbours. Starting puzzles are generated by\n  applying 8 random toggles from all-off, guaranteeing solvability.\n  Each cell carries a ''toggleNonce'' counter that bumps on every flip\n  so the view can retrigger its pulse animation without remounting.\n  Tracks moves, best moves, elapsed time, best clear time. localStorage\n  persistence; nonces reset on hydrate so resumed games don''t pop.\n- src/games/LightsOutBoard.tsx — night-sky purple board with subtle\n  radial-gradient backdrop. ''On'' cells glow gold (✦) with a soft pulse;\n  ''off'' cells dim to a faint dot. Clicked cells bounce-scale on toggle\n  (motion key changes via the nonce). Win overlay ''all stars resting''\n  with new-sky button. Status line counts shining stars or ''the night\n  is still''. Memoized LightCell to keep per-tap re-renders to the\n  affected 5 cells only.\n\nLauncher:\n- Per feedback, switched from a 1-column list to a 3-column tile grid\n  so the launcher fits comfortably regardless of how many games we\n  add. Each tile is a square card with a 44px gradient icon chip on\n  top, the game name underneath, and a top-right ''in progress'' ping\n  dot if there''s a resumeable game. Hover lifts the tile by 2px with\n  a 1.04 scale; tap squishes to 0.96.\n- Dropped per-game tagline + score line — score details live inside\n  each game now, keeping the launcher visually scannable.\n\nWired through launcherStore, GameLauncher, BoredomBuster, and pill\nmini (live 5x5 LightsOutMini).","tree":{"sha":"6b67455bb9d1d6f112db6ffb9811455416f84d76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/6b67455bb9d1d6f112db6ffb9811455416f84d76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/cae96ee419dfa8f352d9021a6bb65940e6288e02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/cae96ee419dfa8f352d9021a6bb65940e6288e02","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKGNhZTk2ZWU0MTlkZmE4ZjM1MmQ5MDIxYTZiYjY1OTQwZTYyODhlMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/cf8fbbb2c358c1f9e2f6f186cb32a7af149fb5f4","sha":"cf8fbbb2c358c1f9e2f6f186cb32a7af149fb5f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/cf8fbbb2c358c1f9e2f6f186cb32a7af149fb5f4"}],"sha":"cae96ee419dfa8f352d9021a6bb65940e6288e02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/cae96ee419dfa8f352d9021a6bb65940e6288e02"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/cf8fbbb2c358c1f9e2f6f186cb32a7af149fb5f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T16:30:47Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T16:30:47Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"perf(games): hit 60fps — drop FLIP, memoize tiles, isolate hover\n\nSeveral targeted fixes to the boards that were dropping frames during\nanimations:\n\n2048 + slide puzzle:\n- Removed framer-motion ''layout'' and ''layoutId'' props from tiles.\n  layoutId triggers FLIP measurement (getBoundingClientRect per tile\n  per commit). We already supply explicit x/y target positions, so\n  the layout pass was pure overhead. Now the move animation is a\n  plain transform with spring physics on x/y — no measurement.\n- Extracted tile renderers into memoized child components (TileNode,\n  PuzzleTile) with custom prop comparators. Parent state changes no\n  longer cascade into per-tile re-renders.\n- Added will-change-transform to hint browser layer promotion.\n- Bumped spring stiffness slightly (320 -> 360 for 2048,\n  360 -> 380 for slide) so the snappier no-measurement path still\n  feels reactive.\n\nConnect 4:\n- Hoisted hover state out of the main board into a self-contained\n  <HoverRow/> component. Previously hovering a column re-rendered\n  every disc + every empty well. Now only the hover row re-renders.\n- Extracted <DiscNode/> and <ColumnButtons/> as memoized children.\n- Reduced AI minimax depth from 3 to 2. Depth-2 with the\n  win-block-heuristic preamble still plays sensibly but never\n  blocks for more than ~5ms vs depth-3''s occasional 20-50ms hangs.\n- Bumped drop-spring stiffness 240 -> 260 with damping 14 -> 16 for\n  a tighter landing now that frame budget isn''t being eaten by AI.\n\nThese changes make every game stay on the 60fps budget through\nmoves, merges, drops, and cascades. No behavioural changes.","tree":{"sha":"0fa2d5cd2a337b1b38c8520d972721a6b8f15b84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/0fa2d5cd2a337b1b38c8520d972721a6b8f15b84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/cf8fbbb2c358c1f9e2f6f186cb32a7af149fb5f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/cf8fbbb2c358c1f9e2f6f186cb32a7af149fb5f4","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKGNmOGZiYmIyYzM1OGMxZjllMmY2ZjE4NmNiMzJhN2FmMTQ5ZmI1ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/74feb1909719048299839ed70e66825987702d8e","sha":"74feb1909719048299839ed70e66825987702d8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/74feb1909719048299839ed70e66825987702d8e"}],"sha":"cf8fbbb2c358c1f9e2f6f186cb32a7af149fb5f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/cf8fbbb2c358c1f9e2f6f186cb32a7af149fb5f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/74feb1909719048299839ed70e66825987702d8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T16:25:41Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T16:25:41Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat(games): add connect four + ''relax a bit!'' pill copy\n\nConnect 4:\n- src/games/connect4Store.ts — 7x6 board, player drops red discs (1),\n  AI drops gold (2). AI plays after a 480ms delay (readability):\n    1. immediate-win check\n    2. immediate-block check\n    3. depth-3 alpha-beta minimax with 4-window heuristic\n       (4-in-a-row = +100, 3+1empty = +5, 2+2empty = +2, opponent\n       3-threat = -4) plus +3 per disc in the center column\n  Tracks wins/losses/draws across rounds. Persists in localStorage;\n  rehydrate marks winning cells so the pulse overlay returns.\n- src/games/Connect4Board.tsx — glossy purple board with inset disc\n  wells, pastel red/pink player discs vs golden AI discs (both with\n  inset highlights for a chip look), spring-bounce drop animation,\n  hover ghost-disc preview row above the columns, pulsing ring on\n  the 4 winning discs, status banner + score badges, ''four in a row''\n  / ''bot beat you'' / ''all full'' overlays with rematch button.\n\nUI copy:\n- Per feedback, floating pill now says ''relax a bit!'' instead of\n  ''play'' when no game is in progress (kebab-case mixed casing instead\n  of all-caps for a softer, friendlier feel).\n\nWired through launcherStore (new ''connect4'' id), GameLauncher (pink-\norange-gold chip, CircleDot icon), and BoredomBuster pill (live 7x6\nmini-preview).","tree":{"sha":"9e107f4e3a0146bd1effcbfcd5abc6f45a4a34f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/9e107f4e3a0146bd1effcbfcd5abc6f45a4a34f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/74feb1909719048299839ed70e66825987702d8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/74feb1909719048299839ed70e66825987702d8e","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKDc0ZmViMTkwOTcxOTA0ODI5OTgzOWVkNzBlNjY4MjU5ODc3MDJkOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/64b88e26b328d48367c93e9574b6e569bf8e8767","sha":"64b88e26b328d48367c93e9574b6e569bf8e8767","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/64b88e26b328d48367c93e9574b6e569bf8e8767"}],"sha":"74feb1909719048299839ed70e66825987702d8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/74feb1909719048299839ed70e66825987702d8e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/64b88e26b328d48367c93e9574b6e569bf8e8767/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T16:18:05Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T16:18:05Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat(games): add slide puzzle (15-puzzle)\n\nCute 4x4 sliding number puzzle:\n- src/games/slidePuzzleStore.ts — board generated by walking the empty\n  slot through 120 random valid moves from the solved state, so every\n  shuffle is guaranteed solvable. slide() handles tile-adjacent moves;\n  slideDir() supports arrow/WASD/swipe by figuring out which adjacent\n  tile fills the empty slot. Tracks moves, elapsed time, best moves,\n  best clear time. localStorage persistence.\n- src/games/SlidePuzzleBoard.tsx — per-row pastel gradient tiles\n  (peach/rose/lavender/cyan) so the solved state forms a soft\n  rainbow. framer-motion layoutId drives smooth spring-physics tile\n  slides; bouncy hover/tap. Empty slot rendered as a ghost panel\n  underneath. Live timer (250ms tick), trophy + best-moves badges,\n  ''solved in N moves · T.Ts'' overlay with shuffle-again button.\n  Arrow keys, WASD, touch swipes, and tile tap all supported.\n\nWired through launcherStore (new ''slidepuzzle'' id), GameLauncher (peach-\npink-cyan chip with LayoutGrid icon), and BoredomBuster pill mini-preview\n(4x4 live grid showing tiles colored by their target row).","tree":{"sha":"5cf41ed03d09c3e74a33834e5075e1738dcf4079","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/5cf41ed03d09c3e74a33834e5075e1738dcf4079"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/64b88e26b328d48367c93e9574b6e569bf8e8767","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/64b88e26b328d48367c93e9574b6e569bf8e8767","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKDY0Yjg4ZTI2YjMyOGQ0ODM2N2M5M2U5NTc0YjZlNTY5YmY4ZTg3Njc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/c57a40ab98b71b14d35be21f7b552660020ccbbd","sha":"c57a40ab98b71b14d35be21f7b552660020ccbbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/c57a40ab98b71b14d35be21f7b552660020ccbbd"}],"sha":"64b88e26b328d48367c93e9574b6e569bf8e8767","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/64b88e26b328d48367c93e9574b6e569bf8e8767"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/c57a40ab98b71b14d35be21f7b552660020ccbbd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T16:11:22Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T16:11:22Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat(games): add mine garden (cute minesweeper)\n\nReskin of classic 6x6 minesweeper (7 mines) into a pastel garden:\n- 🌸 instead of flags (planted with a bouncy wobble + petal jitter)\n- 🐝 instead of mines (bee buzz-in when revealed; exploded bee gets a\n  shake + glow halo when you lose)\n- Cells use a soft purple-haze gradient when hidden, flip to clean\n  pastel when revealed; each number uses its own candy hue (1=blue,\n  2=mint, 3=coral, 4=lavender, 5=peach, 6=teal, 7=pink, 8=lilac)\n- Cascade reveal staggers each cell''s spring-in by 25ms per BFS step\n  for a satisfying ripple\n- Flag-mode toggle (shadcn Switch) for mobile: tap-to-flag with a pink\n  outline halo on hidden cells when active\n- First-click safety: mines placed only after the first reveal so the\n  opening cell + its neighbours are guaranteed mine-free\n- Header: flowers-remaining badge, live elapsed timer (250ms tick),\n  trophy badge with best time on completed games\n- Win overlay ''garden cleared in N.Ns'', loss overlay ''a bee stung''\n- Right-click + shift-click also flag for desktop\n\nInfra:\n- src/games/minesweeperStore.ts — Zustand store, BFS cascade, localStorage\n  persistence\n- Wired into launcher as ''Mine Garden'' (pink-cyan-purple chip), pill\n  mini-preview shows live 6x6 grid state","tree":{"sha":"07c4b22818ec6e92d3527d9629fcb77543c316b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/07c4b22818ec6e92d3527d9629fcb77543c316b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/c57a40ab98b71b14d35be21f7b552660020ccbbd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","