:42Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat(games): add memory match + remove inline loading game\n\nMemory Match (concentration):\n- src/games/memoryStore.ts — 16 cards, 8 emoji pairs, shuffled deck.\n  Tracks moves, matches, current streak, best streak, and best (lowest)\n  moves for a completed game. Locks board ~720ms while showing a\n  mismatch before auto-flipping back. Persists in localStorage; a\n  partially-revealed mid-flip resets to hidden on rehydrate so resumed\n  games are in a clean state.\n- src/games/MemoryBoard.tsx — gradient backs (purple/cyan/pink), 3D\n  rotateY flip with spring physics, scale-pulse on match, trophy +\n  sparkles badges for streak / best, ''cleared in N moves'' overlay.\n- Wired into launcher (Heart icon, pink-purple-cyan gradient chip) and\n  BoredomBuster pill mini-preview (4x4 grid showing matched/flipped/\n  hidden states live).\n\nCleanup per feedback:\n- Removed <LoadingGame/> from all loading.tsx files (lab, [module],\n  journey, interview). The pill + auto-popup-on-slow-nav already cover\n  the boredom-buster UX; the inline loading version was visually\n  cluttered above the skeleton.\n- Deleted src/games/LoadingGame.tsx.","tree":{"sha":"a85d51c940306f501296068bc0778df3de548328","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/a85d51c940306f501296068bc0778df3de548328"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/26ee4a19b6ec58e1c143bb8040e6fe66d219f8b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","grava