.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/a62ee887c7a2b84fe9959b9fd784dcc8c0fb9c1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T15:54:46Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T15:54:46Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat(games): add 2048 + game launcher\n\nThe boredom buster is now a launcher hub instead of a single-game\nshortcut. Click the pill to open a card listing all available games,\neach with a live status pill (''in progress'' / score line). Click a\ngame to expand its full panel. Inside any game, ''<-'' goes back to the\nlauncher, the existing minimize tucks back to the pill, both LoadingGame\nand BoredomBuster route through the same launcher.\n\nNew: 2048\n- src/games/g2048Store.ts — Zustand store with stable tile ids, classic\n  slide+merge logic with single-merge-per-turn, score + best, won/over\n  detection, localStorage persistence\n- src/games/G2048Board.tsx — gradient candy palette per power of 2\n  (pearl 2 -> gold 2048 -> rainbow beyond), framer-motion layoutId\n  drives smooth slide animations, merge pulse, spawn spring-in,\n  win/game-over overlays with ''keep going'' option, arrow keys + WASD\n  + touch swipes, restart button\n\nInfra:\n- src/games/launcherStore.ts — ui state (hidden/launcher/game/pill) and\n  active game id, persisted\n- src/games/GameLauncher.tsx — card list with hover lift, live status\n  per game via a useStatus hook, animated ''in progress'' ping\n- BoredomBuster.tsx — single Panel component renders either the\n  launcher or the active game with the same shared layoutId for the\n  pill <-> panel transition\n- LoadingGame.tsx — shows launcher when no active game, otherwise the\n  active game; a ''switch'' button opens the launcher","tree":{"sha":"c2b39b7125ab163948d2f8b954a7f9d87305f144","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/c2b39b7125ab163948d2f8b954a7f9d87305f144"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/a62ee887c7a2b84fe9959b9fd784dcc8c0fb9c1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/a62ee887c7a2b84fe9959b9fd784dcc8c0fb9c1e","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKGE2MmVlODg3YzdhMmI4NGZlOTk1OWI5ZmQ3ODRkY2M4YzBmYjljMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/c9ceb4e695b621604cd50fee10d3df303ec75f01","sha":"c9ceb4e695b621604cd50fee10d3df303ec75f01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/c9ceb4e695b621604cd50fee10d3df303ec75f01"}],"sha":"a62ee887c7a2b84fe9959b9fd784dcc8c0fb9c1e","url":"https://api.github.com/re