mit consolidates their output.\nFoundation pushed previously (shadcn deps + tokens + ui primitives).\nBuild clean, all routes 200.\n\nVisual direction (research-derived): brutalist-tech base + shadcn/new-york\nchrome. 5-colour discipline preserved (bg #0a0a0b / card #15151a / border\n#26262e / primary #7c5cff). No new tints introduced. rounded-md / rounded-lg\nonly (no rounded-3xl). tabular-nums on every numeric display. Motion budget\n180ms max.\n\nPer-file:\n\n- app/page.tsx — Landing now uses shadcn Button (link variant for nav,\n  default for CTA), Badge for the version pill, Card for stats / module\n  list / learning paths / ''how it works'' beats, Accordion for FAQ. Bento\n  grid stats tiles. Daily-challenge CTA wrapped in Card with left-accent\n  border. PendingLink preserved for transition awareness.\n\n- app/lab/page.tsx — Bento bucket grid: Foundations + Performance lg:col-3,\n  Journey + Interview lg:col-2, Incident lg:col-6 full-width. Stats row\n  becomes a single Card with shadcn Progress for XP bar. Daily-challenge\n  CTA is now a Card with Button.\n\n- app/pricing/page.tsx — Three tier Cards (Free / Lifetime / Monthly).\n  Highlighted tier gets accent border + ''Most popular'' Badge. Feature\n  lists use lucide Check. FAQ uses Accordion. Env-gated checkout URL\n  logic preserved.\n\n- src/engine/{Step,TryIt,BeforeAfter,Callout,MetricsPanel}.tsx — Engine\n  primitives rebuilt on shadcn. Step kind pills become Badge via cva map.\n  TryIt knobs use shadcn Switch. BeforeAfter toggle uses Tabs (animation\n  driven off mode state, not TabsContent, to keep AnimatePresence fade).\n  Callout becomes Card with left-accent rail + tone-mapped Badge title.\n  MetricsPanel tiles are small Cards with lucide Circle dots.\n\n- src/legal/CookieConsent.tsx — Banner becomes Card (header/content/\n  footer); checkboxes swap for shadcn Switch. Buttons use ghost/outline/\n  default variants. Consent-mode store interactions preserved verbatim.\n\n- src/profiler/ProfilerDock.tsx — REC/Pause/Reset become Button ghost-sm\n  with Tooltip wrappers. Lucide icons (Activity / Layers / Cpu /\n  MemoryStick) next to stats. Top offenders use Badge secondary. Mobile\n  drawer swaps motion height-tween for Sheet side=''bottom''. AdSlot +\n  ArchitectModeToggle + TraceTools + CommitTimeline untouched.\n\n- src/shell/LabSidebarNav.tsx — Top buckets use Button outline (default\n  when active) with lucide icons (LayoutDashboard / Compass / Brain /\n  CalendarDays). Section headers use Badge for count. Active-state\n  aria-current preserved; inactive rows get a faint ChevronRight.\n\n- src/shell/MobileNav.tsx — Drawer replaced with Sheet side=''left''\n  (built-in scroll-lock + Esc). Hamburger is Button ghost-icon. Current\n  module pill uses Badge.\n\nWhat''s left for the next pass (rate-limited or not yet launched):\n- AchievementToast → Sonner refactor\n- /lab/interview, /lab/daily, /lab/journey\n- ContinueReadingBanner, ShareCard, AchievementsGallery","tree":{"sha":"691d9388364e80f376bf84ce28291343a47c62c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/691d9388364e80f376bf84ce28291343a47c62c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/eac76e46dfa00d05ec8e4fa9ef8262090342fe56","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/eac76e46dfa00d05ec8e4fa9ef8262090342fe56","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKGVhYzc2ZTQ2ZGZhMDBkMDVlYzhlNGZhOWVmODI2MjA5MDM0MmZlNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/9366394a31318571eb223552467a50e2a7b1d341","sha":"9366394a31318571eb223552467a50e2a7b1d341","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/9366394a31318571eb223552467a50e2a7b1d341"}],"sha":"eac76e46dfa00d05ec8e4fa9ef8262090342fe56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/eac76e46dfa00d05ec8e4fa9ef8262090342fe56"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/9366394a31318571eb223552467a50e2a7b1d341/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T16:17:38Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T16:17:38Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"chore(shadcn): install foundation — deps, tokens, ui primitives\n\nLays the groundwork for the visual revamp. Nothing visible yet — adds:\n\n- components.json — shadcn config (new-york style, neutral base, CSS variables).\n- src/lib/utils.ts — cn() helper (clsx + tailwind-merge).\n- src/components/ui/ — 11 primitives manually dropped in:\n    button, card, badge, separator, dialog, sheet,\n    tabs, tooltip, accordion, progress, switch, input, sonner.\n- tailwind.config.ts — added shadcn HSL CSS-variable color tokens alongside\n  the existing lab palette (bg.*, ink.*, accent.*). Both work together.\n- app/globals.css — :root tokens for shadcn (background, primary, border,\n  ring, etc.) chosen to land EXACTLY on the existing palette: #0a0a0b\n  background, #7c5cff primary, #26262e border. No visual regression.\n- deps: class-variance-authority, tailwind-merge, lucide-react@0.460.0,\n  tailwindcss-animate, plus the Radix peer deps (dialog, tabs, tooltip,\n  accordion, switch, progress, slot, separator, toast, dropdown-menu)\n  and sonner for toasts.\n\nNext: parallel refactor agents replace bespoke styling with shadcn\nprimitives across landing, lab hub, lessons, profiler, etc.","tree":{"sha":"58ebb1d96eae8d808b2821de5c11f9a8cd945b49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/58ebb1d96eae8d808b2821de5c11f9a8cd945b49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/9366394a31318571eb223552467a50e2a7b1d341","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/9366394a31318571eb223552467a50e2a7b1d341","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKDkzNjYzOTRhMzEzMTg1NzFlYjIyMzU1MjQ2N2E1MGUyYTdiMWQzNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/9ef9ab10751924ff39de984bac8d07401a53bfba","sha":"9ef9ab10751924ff39de984bac8d07401a53bfba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/9ef9ab10751924ff39de984bac8d07401a53bfba"}],"sha":"9366394a31318571eb223552467a50e2a7b1d341","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/9366394a31318571eb223552467a50e2a7b1d341"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/9ef9ab10751924ff39de984bac8d07401a53bfba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T07:07:42Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T07:07:42Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat(resume): save reading position, restore on return, continue-reading banner\n\nThe progress store gained three localStorage-backed fields:\n- resumeAt:           per-lesson scrollPct (0..1)\n- lastReading:        most recent in-progress lesson + ts + scrollPct\n- continueDismissed:  flag so the banner stops after explicit dismiss\n\nTracking (src/progress/useReadingTracker.ts):\n- Mounted by Lesson via useReadingTracker(slug).\n- Saves scroll position as a FRACTION of scrollHeight, throttled to once\n  every 1.2 seconds. Fraction (not absolute pixels) is robust against the\n  page growing/shrinking between visits.\n- Saves once on mount too, so opening a lesson and walking away still\n  produces a lastReading record.\n- Auto-cancels when the lesson is already complete (no point tracking\n  resume on a finished lesson).\n- Skip out-of-band values (<5% or >92%) — too close to top/bottom to\n  bother resuming to.\n\nRestore:\n- On mount, after store hydration, reads resumeAt[slug] and scrolls there\n  with one rAF + 50ms delay so lazy-loaded content can settle. Lands\n  80px ABOVE the saved fraction so the user sees a bit of context.\n- Suppressed if returning within 60s (same-session bounce — don''t jolt).\n\nBanner (src/progress/ContinueReadingBanner.tsx):\n- Two variants: ''sticky'' (top of landing, dismissable) and ''inline''\n  (lab hub, dismissable).\n- Shows only after hydration, only if a non-complete lesson has progress\n  between 5% and 92%, and only if the user hasn''t dismissed.\n- ESC key dismisses the sticky variant. Progress bar visual + ''Resume →''\n  link.\n- Hides immediately for the rest of the session after dismiss but\n  re-surfaces when the user picks up a different lesson.\n\nCompletion clears the resume position + lastReading slug for that lesson —\nso the banner doesn''t dangle after the user actually finishes something.\n\nBuild clean. All routes 200.","tree":{"sha":"893798d7f15cbcc6d1c348072ff389599934ea4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/893798d7f15cbcc6d1c348072ff389599934ea4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/9ef9ab10751924ff39de984bac8d07401a53bfba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/9ef9ab10751924ff39de984bac8d07401a53bfba","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKDllZjlhYjEwNzUxOTI0ZmYzOWRlOTg0YmFjOGQwNzQwMWE1M2JmYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/1e786118c2d146d7fc4a15ab84dbae408aef94ae","sha":"1e786118c2d146d7fc4a15ab84dbae408aef94ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/1e786118c2d146d7fc4a15ab84dbae408aef94ae"}],"sha":"9ef9ab10751924ff39de984bac8d07401a53bfba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/9ef9ab10751924ff39de984bac8d07401a53bfba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/1e786118c2d146d7fc4a15ab84dbae408aef94ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T14:24:16Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T14:24:16Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"fix(nav): highlight active module in desktop sidebar + tighten mobile drawer matching\n\nThe desktop sidebar listed modules but never showed which one you were\ncurrently reading. Mobile drawer had highlighting but used a loose\n.includes() matcher that could false-positive in edge cases.\n\nBoth fixed:\n\nsrc/shell/LabSidebarNav.tsx — new client component for the active-aware\nnav list. usePathname() drives state; exact-match for top-level buckets\n(Hub / Journey / Interview / Daily), exact path match for module slugs.\nActive link gets bg-accent/15 + text-accent + a small right-side dot to\nflag ''you are here.'' Top-bucket buttons get a filled circle (●) when\nactive. aria-current=''page'' set for screen readers.\n\napp/lab/layout.tsx now uses <LabSidebarNav/> instead of inline maps.\nServer component status preserved on the outer layout.\n\nMobile drawer (src/shell/MobileNav.tsx) — tightened all three matchers\nfrom pathname.includes(slug) to pathname === ''/lab/'' + slug, including\nthe current-module detection in MobileTopBar (now checks both\nFOUNDATIONS and MODULES). Added matching right-side dot indicator and\naria-current to mobile drawer rows too.\n\nBuild clean.","tree":{"sha":"49f1c55f2708593805ee276e95fba32434a82cd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/49f1c55f2708593805ee276e95fba32434a82cd6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/1e786118c2d146d7fc4a15ab84dbae408aef94ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/1e786118c2d146d7fc4a15ab84dbae408aef94ae","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKDFlNzg2MTE4YzJkMTQ2ZDdmYzRhMTVhYjg0ZGJhZTQwOGFlZjk0YWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/03f832f7cc24c7f542214b2056d95d07b1e815a9","sha":"03f832f7cc24c7f542214b2056d95d07b1e815a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/03f832f7cc24c7f542214b2056d95d07b1e815a9"}],"sha":"1e786118c2d146d7fc4a15ab84dbae408aef94ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/1e786118c2d146d7fc4a15ab84dbae408aef94ae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/03f832f7cc24c7f542214b2056d95d07b1e815a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T14:20:01Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T14:20:01Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"fix(share-card): use relative URL for image preview + onError fallback\n\nThe previous version built the img src as an absolute URL using\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL. On local dev and preview deploys, that env var\npoints at the prod Vercel URL — which may be a stale deploy without the\n/api/og/card route, causing the preview to break with a broken image.\n\nFix:\n- src/progress/ShareCard.tsx splits the URL into two forms:\n  - cardPath  — relative ''/api/og/card?...'' for the inline <img> preview.\n                Always resolves against the current origin (works locally,\n                in preview deploys, and in production identically).\n  - cardAbs   — absolute URL using window.location.origin for the download\n                href + the share-intent URLs.\n\n- Added onError handler to <img> — if the preview ever fails to load,\n  the broken-image is replaced with a ''preview unavailable'' message that\n  reassures the user the share + download actions still work (the OG\n  endpoint is server-side rendered when X/LinkedIn fetches it).\n\n- Reserved aspect ratio via style on the container instead of the img,\n  so the fallback message renders in the right-shaped box too.\n\nEndpoint itself was already returning a valid 1200x630 PNG; the issue\nwas purely client-side URL resolution.","tree":{"sha":"48e389d75da60f395f24cc3779be5b16e88c9848","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/48e389d75da60f395f24cc3779be5b16e88c9848"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/03f832f7cc24c7f542214b2056d95d07b1e815a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/03f832f7cc24c7f542214b2056d95d07b1e815a9","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKDAzZjgzMmY3Y2MyNGM3ZjU0MjIxNGIyMDU2ZDk1ZDA3YjFlODE1YTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/3a659d2e9e8bbcb44cf5bf0c751d02ba40936e2e","sha":"3a659d2e9e8bbcb44cf5bf0c751d02ba40936e2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/3a659d2e9e8bbcb44cf5bf0c751d02ba40936e2e"}],"sha":"03f832f7cc24c7f542214b2056d95d07b1e815a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/03f832f7cc24c7f542214b2056d95d07b1e815a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/3a659d2e9e8bbcb44cf5bf0c751d02ba40936e2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T14:02:32Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T14:02:32Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat: daily challenge on landing + shareable OG progress card\n\nLanding page now surfaces the daily challenge prominently above the FAQ —\nwarn-tone CTA card with ''take today''s →'' button. The research called daily\nchallenges the strongest non-SRS retention mechanic; surfacing on landing\nturns a single-page visitor into a returning user.\n\nShareable progress card:\n- app/api/og/card/route.tsx — Edge runtime route using next/og to generate\n  1200×630 PNG cards. Takes level/xp/streak/lessons/track via query params.\n  Stateless + cacheable per URL — no auth, no DB.\n- src/progress/ShareCard.tsx — preview + Twitter/LinkedIn/copy/download\n  actions. Reads from progress store; only renders once the user has ≥1\n  completed lesson (no premature pitch).\n- Integrated into /lab hub above the AchievementsGallery.\n\nUpdated landing stats from old (25 modules / 9 viz) to current (36 lessons\n/ 47 interview Qs). Version pill bumped to v0.9.\n\nBuild clean. OG endpoint returns 111KB PNG. All routes 200.","tree":{"sha":"856f5316fc16aea8f2810a9d1174de5693e8c9e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/856f5316fc16aea8f2810a9d1174de5693e8c9e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/3a659d2e9e8bbcb44cf5bf0c751d02ba40936e2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/3a659d2e9e8bbcb44cf5bf0c751d02ba40936e2e","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKDNhNjU5ZDJlOWU4YmJjYjQ0Y2Y1YmYwYzc1MWQwMmJhNDA5MzZlMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/32c77c7497cceb89a28cb56d26063c961ce92446","sha":"32c77c7497cceb89a28cb56d26063c961ce92446","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/32c77c7497cceb89a28cb56d26063c961ce92446"}],"sha":"3a659d2e9e8bbcb44cf5bf0c751d02ba40936e2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/3a659d2e9e8bbcb44cf5bf0c751d02ba40936e2e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/32c77c7497cceb89a28cb56d26063c961ce92446/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T13:57:39Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T13:57:39Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat: daily challenge + monetisation infrastructure (Pro tier scaffolding)\n\nDaily challenge (/lab/daily):\n- One question per day, deterministic by date (same for everyone).\n- Counts toward streak + ''Interview-ready'' achievement.\n- Visible on /lab hub with a warn-tone CTA card.\n\nMonetisation infrastructure (env-gated; nothing live until Polar wired):\n- src/entitlement/store.ts — Zustand store for tier (free | pro | team),\n  hydrated from localStorage (dev override via ''rrl:ent'' = ''pro'').\n- src/entitlement/Premium.tsx — <Premium fallback={...}>content</Premium>\n  wrapper. Soft paywall: shows pitch + ''See Pro pricing →'' CTA, never\n  blocks SEO indexing.\n- src/entitlement/EntitlementBoot.tsx — mounted in root layout.\n- src/ads/AdSlot.tsx — Pro users never see ads. Reads from entitlement\n  store; defaults to ad-rendering before hydration (conservative).\n- /pricing page — three tiers (Free, Pro Lifetime , Pro Monthly ).\n  Checkout URLs read from NEXT_PUBLIC_POLAR_CHECKOUT_* env vars; without\n  them, CTAs read ''Coming soon — early-access list.''\n- .env.example — Polar, Clerk, Supabase, JWT secret entries documented.\n- Pricing link in landing nav + footer; sitemap includes new routes.\n\nThe Pro tier is code-ready; flipping it on is one env var. See\nMONETISATION.md for the Phase 2 wiring plan.\n\nBuild clean. All routes 200.","tree":{"sha":"76d8d97ea64056fa9e293a806651a24b6f2c143a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/76d8d97ea64056fa9e293a806651a24b6f2c143a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/32c77c7497cceb89a28cb56d26063c961ce92446","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/32c77c7497cceb89a28cb56d26063c961ce92446","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKDMyYzc3Yzc0OTdjY2ViODlhMjhjYjU2ZDI2MDYzYzk2MWNlOTI0NDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/7a7089ede8550dbf1a2ec0f2e60378f5fde77f66","sha":"7a7089ede8550dbf1a2ec0f2e60378f5fde77f66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/7a7089ede8550dbf1a2ec0f2e60378f5fde77f66"}],"sha":"32c77c7497cceb89a28cb56d26063c961ce92446","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/32c77c7497cceb89a28cb56d26063c961ce92446"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/7a7089ede8550dbf1a2ec0f2e60378f5fde77f66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T13:51:05Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T13:51:05Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat: monetisation strategy + competence-based achievements\n\nMONETISATION.md — full strategy doc synthesised from three parallel research\nagents (payment platforms, gamification patterns, premium-tier architecture).\n\nHighlights:\n- Hero tier: Polar.sh + Clerk + Supabase. Polar''s Merchant-of-Record status\n  saves VAT/tax compliance work for a solo dev; fee math beats Stripe+Tax.\n- Pricing:  lifetime + /mo. Skip  — research consistently flags it\n  as under-valuing dev tools.\n- Content split: Foundations + M01-08 + Journey free; M09-25 + full interview\n  bank + incident scenarios Pro. Keeps free tier indexable and word-of-mouth.\n- Gamification: ship 5 evidence-backed mechanics. DROP cosmetic ''first login''\n  badges (cringe to senior devs per multiple studies); KEEP competence-tied\n  achievements + streak preservation + LinkedIn-shareable certificates.\n\nShipped this commit:\n- src/progress/achievements.ts — 14 achievements, all tied to real behaviour\n  (track completion, streak length, quiz mastery). No participation badges.\n- src/progress/store.ts — evaluator integrated into every mutator; XP bonus\n  awarded on unlock; pendingToasts queue drains via popToast().\n- src/progress/AchievementToast.tsx — Duolingo-style unlock toast, mounted\n  in root layout.\n- src/progress/AchievementsGallery.tsx — grid of all achievements with\n  all/unlocked/locked filter; integrated into /lab hub.\n\nBuild clean. All routes 200.","tree":{"sha":"178be2115d89d039d3d3573d33aa0924d293c9cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/178be2115d89d039d3d3573d33aa0924d293c9cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/7a7089ede8550dbf1a2ec0f2e60378f5fde77f66","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/7a7089ede8550dbf1a2ec0f2e60378f5fde77f66","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKDdhNzA4OWVkZTg1NTBkYmYxYTJlYzBmMmU2MDM3OGY1ZmRlNzdmNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/f7a56e18223cbf83010e02e1d1cd1938933935ee","sha":"f7a56e18223cbf83010e02e1d1cd1938933935ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/f7a56e18223cbf83010e02e1d1cd1938933935ee"}],"sha":"7a7089ede8550dbf1a2ec0f2e60378f5fde77f66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/7a7089ede8550dbf1a2ec0f2e60378f5fde77f66"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/f7a56e18223cbf83010e02e1d1cd1938933935ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T04:36:30Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T04:36:30Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat: foundations F08-F11 complete — refs, context, custom hooks, rules\n\nThe Foundations track is now end-to-end. All 11 lessons shipped with\ndeep architect notes; the foundations chain from JSX through Rules of\nReact feeds directly into Module 1 (Reconciliation).\n\n- F08 Refs: useRef as ''mutable box that doesn''t trigger renders'', state\n            vs ref decision tree, render-purity rule for refs, live focus\n            demo. Architect: what a ref IS, when reading during render\n            breaks purity, useImperativeHandle, concurrent React gotchas.\n- F09 Context: createContext/Provider/useContext, fan-out trap, why memo\n            doesn''t help with context renders, live theme demo through\n            three child levels. Architect: why no selectors, decision tree\n            (prop/context/store), concurrent rendering interaction.\n- F10 Custom hooks: ''just a function with hooks'', composition, naming +\n            return shape conventions, when NOT to extract, live useWindowWidth\n            demo. Architect: zero runtime difference vs regular function,\n            how hook order works, generic typed signatures, when hooks\n            replace context.\n- F11 Rules of React: purity, immutability, hook order — each rule with\n            ''why'' tied to Compiler/concurrent/StrictMode dependencies.\n            Architect: why purity is foundational, immutability via\n            Object.is, the linter as enforcer.\n\nAll 11 foundations + all 25 core modules now have ArchitectNotes blocks.\nBottleneck chain is complete F01 → F11 → M01 → M25.\n\nBuild clean. All foundations 200.","tree":{"sha":"2f47156c998f9e5e64736b72363a5ce8d2d6cf26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/2f47156c998f9e5e64736b72363a5ce8d2d6cf26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/f7a56e18223cbf83010e02e1d1cd1938933935ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/f7a56e18223cbf83010e02e1d1cd1938933935ee","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKGY3YTU2ZTE4MjIzY2JmODMwMTBlMDJlMWQxY2QxOTM4OTMzOTM1ZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/5323c9e568666b3a53aae921368466b8d4332913","sha":"5323c9e568666b3a53aae921368466b8d4332913","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/5323c9e568666b3a53aae921368466b8d4332913"}],"sha":"f7a56e18223cbf83010e02e1d1cd1938933935ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/f7a56e18223cbf83010e02e1d1cd1938933935ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/5323c9e568666b3a53aae921368466b8d4332913/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T04:30:17Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T04:30:17Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat: foundations F04-F07 — effects, events, rendering, forms\n\nFour new foundation lessons, each with deep architect notes:\n\n- F04 Effects: sync mechanism, deps array semantics, cleanup contract,\n              when NOT to reach for an effect, useEffect vs useLayoutEffect.\n              Architect: StrictMode role, exhaustive-deps rule, race conditions.\n- F05 Events: SyntheticEvent + delegation model, arg-binding patterns,\n              preventDefault/stopPropagation, when to bypass React''s system.\n              Includes live event-inspector demo.\n- F06 Rendering: conditional patterns + && trap, lists + keys,\n              Fragment in lists, anti-patterns. Architect: why React picked\n              key+position over LCS, memo × key interaction.\n- F07 Forms: controlled vs uncontrolled live comparison, when each wins,\n              React 19 form actions preview, file input security. Architect:\n              react-hook-form internals, client+server validation layers.\n\nEach lesson has an embedded Quiz + ArchitectNotes block.\n\nBuild clean.","tree":{"sha":"5564c017f6de3354b4aa0765b8a77a1f13c6aab0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/5564c017f6de3354b4aa0765b8a77a1f13c6aab0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/5323c9e568666b3a53aae921368466b8d4332913","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mi