2,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/5886368e958afe67cc520f3fd1f32187b9c76481/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T03:58:21Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T03:58:21Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat: ArchitectNotes batch 3 — M17-M21\n\nBrowser pipeline, network, microfrontends, build, accessibility.\n\n- M17: pipeline phases walk-through, layout thrashing, composite layer\n       trade-offs, transform vs top/left, DevTools workflow\n- M18: waterfall vs parallel, dedup mechanics, retry policy components\n       (backoff + jitter + cap + circuit breaker), SWR when wrong\n- M19: case for/against MFE, singleton:true mechanics, breaking-change\n       migration policy, contract testing\n- M20: ESM vs CJS tree-shaking, split decision tree, code split vs lazy\n       load, 2026 bundler decision tree, prod measurement\n- M21: DOM vs AOM, modal focus contract (with inert), live regions,\n       virtualised list a11y, keyboard testing workflow\n\nBuild clean.","tree":{"sha":"69bbbafb7c65c754b36d4f6955079e9fcdb2f8c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/69bbbafb7c65c754b36d4f6955079e9fcdb2f8c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/5886368e958afe67cc520f3fd1f32187b9c76481","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"u