tps://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/02be58fb9b390e19345bd9240aaff8ebc9f2c0a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T03:53:39Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T03:53:39Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat: ArchitectNotes batch 2 — M09, M10, M13, M14, M15\n\nIslands, virtualization, server actions, use() hook, partial prerendering.\n\n- M09: Islands vs RSC, cross-island state problem, bundle math, page\n       transitions trade-offs\n- M10: prefix-sum offsets for dynamic heights, a11y story (rowindex),\n       break-even point, Cmd+F implication, ResizeObserver\n- M13: progressive enhancement path (no JS), useActionState/useOptimistic/\n       useFormStatus depth, CSRF protection\n- M14: why use() breaks rules-of-hooks, use(promise) vs await, cache()\n       pairing, conditional use(context)\n- M15: edge→origin request walk, what makes a boundary dynamic, when PPR\n       is wrong, revalidation, PPR vs Edge SSR\n\nBuild clean.","tree":{"sha":"2988a175a3508986fb2ec3e31cabe653aab6352c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/2988a175a3508986fb2ec3e31cabe653aab6352c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab