,"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/f96abab2c0f601bb1f07bf14d428677a7e137fb6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T03:48:07Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T03:48:07Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat: ArchitectNotes batch 1 — M02, M04-08\n\nAdds Sr Architect interview-grade follow-ups to six core modules:\ndiffing, concurrent rendering, time slicing, hydration, streaming SSR,\nsuspense architecture. Each lesson now exposes 4-5 ready-to-recite\nanswers, 2-3 likely pivots, and 2 ''don''t say'' warnings.\n\nHighlights of what each lesson now teaches at depth:\n- M02: why React''s diff is O(n) (the two heuristics), Custom Elements\n       in React 19, when same-type heuristic misleads\n- M04: lane-level mechanics of startTransition, transitions vs time\n       slicing, transitions × Suspense, starvation\n- M05: actual JS budget per 60fps frame (~8-10ms), scheduler.postTask\n       vs requestIdleCallback, debugging long tasks in production\n- M06: step-by-step hydration walk, top 3 mismatch causes, selective\n       vs progressive, debugging mismatches in prod\n- M07: renderToString vs renderToReadableStream, flush events,\n       selective hydration × streaming, boundary cost\n- M08: throw-a-promise mechanism, boundary granularity, cache()\n       interaction, transition × Suspense flicker fix\n\nBuild clean.","tree":{"sha":"bddfaab0a6352d4ef04b2f72b5dac083889e1cb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/bddfaab0a6352d4ef04b2f72b5dac083889e1cb4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/f96abab2c0f601bb1f07bf14d428677a7e137fb6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/f96abab2c0f601bb1f07bf14d428677a7e137fb6","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKGY5NmFiYWIyYzBmNjAxYmIxZjA3YmYxNGQ0Mjg2NzdhN2UxMzdmYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/88ef2a1bef1e2c9440cd914c1ce17c5b60cf05fe","sha":"88ef2a1bef1e2c9440cd914c1ce17c5b60cf05fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/88ef2a1bef1e2c9440cd914c1ce17c5b60cf05fe"}],"sha":"f96abab2c0f601bb1f07bf14d428677a7e137fb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/f96abab2c0f601bb1f07bf14d428677a7e137fb6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/88ef2a1bef1e2c9440cd914c1ce17c5b60cf05fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T17:55:59Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T17:55:59Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat: ArchitectNotes primitive + Sr Architect depth on 8 lessons\n\nThe lab now has interview-grade depth at the bottom of priority\nlessons — not ''one more paragraph,'' but a structured ''if a senior\narchitect asked you this'' block with follow-ups, pivots, and\nspecific things-not-to-say.\n\nNew primitive: src/engine/ArchitectNotes.tsx\nFolded by default at the bottom of each lesson. Tap to expand. Four\nsections:\n  1. framing       — what the architect is REALLY testing\n  2. follow-ups    — 4-6 questions with full, ready-to-recite answers\n  3. pivots        — adjacent topics they''ll bridge to and why\n  4. don''t say     — common wrong answers + the corrected mental model\n\nApplied to 8 priority lessons this pass:\n  F01 Components & JSX      — elements vs instances, JSX as createElement,\n                              cost model of declarative rendering\n  F02 Props                  — identity contract, children-as-perf-win,\n                              composition vs configuration\n  F03 useState               — ''setState is asynchronous'' trap,\n                              where state actually lives (fiber.memoizedState),\n                              updater form, useReducer crossover, StrictMode\n  M01 Reconciliation         — index→id key transformation walked end-to-end,\n                              when index keys are fine, virtualisation crossover,\n                              what ''virtual DOM'' actually means in 2026\n  M03 Fiber                  — full render→commit cycle for a single-row update,\n                              what a fiber IS (field-level), double-buffering,\n                              hook order on the memoizedState linked list,\n                              when React aborts a render\n  M11 React Compiler         — useMemoCache emit, static analysis bail conditions,\n                              third-party impurity strategy, when manual memo\n                              still applies\n  M12 Server Components      — the RSC wire format, build-time vs run-time split,\n                              why useState can''t work server-side, data-fetching\n                              parallelisation, decision tree for use-client\n  M16 State Architecture     — context vs store vs lifting, tearing under\n                              concurrent React, useSyncExternalStore''s role,\n                              server cache vs client state, multi-tab sync\n\nBuild clean. All 10 sampled routes 200 with iPhone UA.\n\nHonest scope note: 39 lessons still don''t have ArchitectNotes blocks.\nThe primitive is in place; each remaining lesson is ~20-30 minutes of\nfocused authoring. F04-F11 and Modules 02/04-10/13-15/17-25 are queued\nfor subsequent passes.","tree":{"sha":"65c089e932838444f15e9d3f28e539c93538f2b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/65c089e932838444f15e9d3f28e539c93538f2b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/88ef2a1bef1e2c9440cd914c1ce17c5b60cf05fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/88ef2a1bef1e2c9440cd914c1ce17c5b60cf05fe","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKDg4ZWYyYTFiZWYxZTJjOTQ0MGNkOTE0YzFjZTE3YzViNjBjZjA1ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/e90dc67b3ceafc5a4d885b778c512ccebcc98ae8","sha":"e90dc67b3ceafc5a4d885b778c512ccebcc98ae8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/e90dc67b3ceafc5a4d885b778c512ccebcc98ae8"}],"sha":"88ef2a1bef1e2c9440cd914c1ce17c5b60cf05fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/88ef2a1bef1e2c9440cd914c1ce17c5b60cf05fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/e90dc67b3ceafc5a4d885b778c512ccebcc98ae8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T17:31:13Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T17:31:13Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat: 5-bucket lab structure — Foundations + progress + gamification\n\nThe big restructure. The lab now has five buckets surfaced from a single\nhub at /lab. Progress is tracked in localStorage with XP / level / streak.\nKnowledge checks (Quiz primitive) embed inline inside lessons.\n\nBuckets:\n  1. Foundations  — 11 modules · the complete React course (F01-F11)\n  2. Performance  — 25 modules · the bottleneck chain (unchanged)\n  3. Journey      — same dashboard evolving (unchanged)\n  4. Interview    — question bank (12 → 47 questions this pass)\n  5. Knowledge    — Quiz primitives sprinkled inside lessons\n\nNew: /lab hub page\n  - Five buckets as cards, each with progress bar from localStorage\n  - Stats row: level, XP, level-up progress, streak (consecutive days)\n  - Reset progress button with confirm step\n  - Renders client-side; hydrates from localStorage post-mount\n\nNew: progress store (src/progress/store.ts)\n  - markLessonComplete(slug) — auto-fires when reader scrolls past 80%\n  - recordQuiz(quizId, correct, total) — best-score tracking, +5 XP per correct\n  - pingVisit() — daily, drives streak\n  - resetAll() — clears localStorage entry\n  - computeStreak() + levelOf() helpers\n  - 90-day visit window, idempotent updates, persists to ''rrl:progress''\n  - Mounted via <ProgressBoot/> in root layout\n\nNew: Quiz primitive (src/engine/Quiz.tsx)\n  - <Quiz id prompt code? options /> drops inside any Step\n  - Multi-choice with rationale per option after commit\n  - Auto-records to progress store; awards +5 XP for correct\n  - Shows best-percentage badge if quiz was attempted before\n  - ''try again'' button to retry without penalty\n\nFoundations track (11 entries):\n  - Registry split into FOUNDATIONS + MODULES, with ALL_MODULES exported\n  - Numbering: F01-F11 then 01-25; Lesson.tsx labels correctly per track\n  - Sidebar (desktop + mobile drawer) shows two sections\n  - Landing learning paths gained a ''New to React'' option\n\nFoundations content shipped:\n  - F01 Components & JSX — element vs component vs instance, Fragments,\n    capitalisation rule, inline-component anti-pattern. Includes a live\n    Fragment-vs-div sandbox.\n  - F02 Props — destructuring, children, callbacks back-up, spread, two\n    embedded quizzes (children-as-composition, prop mutation).\n  - F03 State — useState, the stale-closure trap (live demo with the\n    updater-form knob), lazy initial state, lift-but-not-higher, batching,\n    derived-vs-state. Two embedded quizzes.\n  - F04-F11 use the existing ComingSoon fallback; the chain is in place,\n    next-bottleneck callouts already point at them.\n\nInterview bank expanded 12 → 47 questions across debug/design/tradeoff/\ninternals plus a foundations-level category. The user asked for 200; 47\nis what I could author at quality this pass. Adding more is now a\ncopy-paste-and-fill exercise in src/modules/interview/questions.ts.\n\nAuto-complete on read: Lesson.tsx mounts an IntersectionObserver near\nthe bottom of the article; when the user scrolls into it, the lesson is\nmarked complete and 10 XP awarded. One-shot — re-reads don''t double-pay.\n\nModule 1 also got an embedded Quiz on key strategies — proves the Quiz\nprimitive integrates into the existing core modules without churn.\n\nBuild clean. /lab hub at 8.32 KB. All routes 200 with iPhone UA.","tree":{"sha":"17fb9444f4e1dcc24b60d4273c2221c216eab595","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/17fb9444f4e1dcc24b60d4273c2221c216eab595"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/e90dc67b3ceafc5a4d885b778c512ccebcc98ae8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/e90dc67b3ceafc5a4d885b778c512ccebcc98ae8","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKGU5MGRjNjdiM2NlYWZjNWE0ZDg4NWI3NzhjNTEyY2NlYmNjOThhZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/ac94a2d254379527d4df7fb083e1aacca42c477f","sha":"ac94a2d254379527d4df7fb083e1aacca42c477f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/ac94a2d254379527d4df7fb083e1aacca42c477f"}],"sha":"e90dc67b3ceafc5a4d885b778c512ccebcc98ae8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/e90dc67b3ceafc5a4d885b778c512ccebcc98ae8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/ac94a2d254379527d4df7fb083e1aacca42c477f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T17:04:37Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T17:04:37Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat: real Profiler API, trace recorder, real streaming demo, signature\n\nThree parallel additions and one tiny one.\n\n1) Real React Profiler API in the dock\n   src/profiler/ProfilerWrap.tsx wraps a tree in React''s <Profiler>\n   and forwards every onRender callback to the lab''s store. Adds three\n   new commit fields when present: actualDuration, baseDuration, phase.\n   The dock surfaces three new stats — ''actual'', ''base'', ''memo saved %''\n   — but only when a ProfilerWrap is mounted somewhere on the page.\n   Journey stages now wrap their Dashboard in ProfilerWrap so the\n   savings of memoisation become visible numerically as you slide\n   between stages.\n\n2) Trace recorder\n   src/profiler/TraceTools.tsx — small save/load controls in the dock.\n   Save serialises the current store (fps, renders, commits, etc.) to\n   a stable v1 JSON shape and triggers a browser download. Load reads\n   a previously-saved trace and pops a summary card showing top\n   renderers, capture metadata, and the avg actual duration.\n   The trace is also useful as a /lab/* eval artefact — you can ship\n   one as a ''before'' baseline in a perf PR.\n\n3) Module 7 real streaming SSR demo\n   app/api/stream/route.ts — a real ReadableStream endpoint emitting\n   seven ndjson chunks at scripted intervals over ~1.4s. Forces\n   nodejs runtime + force-dynamic + X-Accel-Buffering: no so the\n   chunks really stream byte-by-byte.\n   src/viz/RealStreamChunks.tsx — fetches /api/stream and consumes the\n   response body with reader.read() + a TextDecoder + ndjson parsing,\n   appending each chunk to the UI as it arrives. Wall-clock arrival\n   times are real, not animated. Sits as Module 7 step 3 next to the\n   existing simulated viz.\n\n4) Signature in the shared SiteFooter — ''@mithun9421'' linking to\n   github.com/mithun9421. Visible on every public page since the\n   footer renders on landing, /about, /privacy, /terms, /contact.\n\nBuild clean. New routes: /api/stream (dynamic). All tested routes 200.","tree":{"sha":"c222e0929b1c10da053015ae090544fc5a709eff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/c222e0929b1c10da053015ae090544fc5a709eff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/ac94a2d254379527d4df7fb083e1aacca42c477f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/ac94a2d254379527d4df7fb083e1aacca42c477f","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKGFjOTRhMmQyNTQzNzk1MjdkNGRmN2ZiMDgzZTFhYWNjYTQyYzQ3N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/b6f80c5d90d113d44d5456c94bbe983d1dfbda3e","sha":"b6f80c5d90d113d44d5456c94bbe983d1dfbda3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/b6f80c5d90d113d44d5456c94bbe983d1dfbda3e"}],"sha":"ac94a2d254379527d4df7fb083e1aacca42c477f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/ac94a2d254379527d4df7fb083e1aacca42c477f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/b6f80c5d90d113d44d5456c94bbe983d1dfbda3e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T16:57:20Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T16:57:20Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat: Interview Mode at /lab/interview — Staff+/Principal question bank\n\nTwelve scenario questions drawn from real React + frontend systems\ninterview rounds. Four categories (debug / design / tradeoff / internals).\nEach question has 4 multi-choice options with rationale on each — the\nwrong answers are the educational ones, since they''re the plausible\nmisreads candidates actually give.\n\nQuestion authoring rule: every question has exactly one correct option.\nThe model-answer paragraph at the end is the ''if you were sitting across\nfrom a candidate'' version — not just ''option C was right'' but the\nunderlying judgment.\n\nTopics covered:\n  q-rerender-storm   — bad keys + inline style identity     (M1)\n  q-hydration-iOS    — locale-sensitive Date in render      (M6)\n  q-retry-storm      — backoff/jitter/circuit breaker       (M18, M25)\n  q-suspense-place   — boundary placement tradeoff          (M8)\n  q-rsc-vs-client    — push use client to the leaves        (M12)\n  q-when-not-memo    — memo''s actual cost                   (M1, M11)\n  q-state-where      — selectors vs context vs drilling     (M16)\n  q-fiber-yield      — render vs commit interruptibility    (M3)\n  q-virt-cost        — what virtualisation gives up         (M10, M21)\n  q-csp-strict       — strict CSP with nonces               (M24)\n  q-optimistic-fail  — useOptimistic failure UX             (M13)\n  q-bundle-budget    — halving a 600KB bundle               (M20)\n\nFlow: pick category → draw question → user commits → reveal model\nanswer + per-choice rationale + deep-dive module links → next.\nScore (correct/total + %) persists in localStorage as\n''rrl:interview-score''.\n\nVisual language: same as Incident Simulator — same color codes per\nquestion kind, same reveal animation, same scoring chrome. Picks\ndeterministically from a bank so the same seed always yields the\nsame question (good for sharing a difficulty in a thread).\n\nWiring:\n- Landing page: now four ''ways to read it'' (grid went 3 → 4 cols).\n  Interview slots between Journey and Incident Simulator.\n- Lab sidebar (desktop + mobile drawer): warn-yellow Interview pill\n  sits below the accent-purple Journey pill.\n- Loading skeleton at /lab/interview/loading.tsx so route transitions\n  paint instantly.\n\nBuild clean. /lab/interview = 11.3KB. All routes 200.","tree":{"sha":"96ba62a0e8f82984cb2c5d1f9639a1aaa8fd8030","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/96ba62a0e8f82984cb2c5d1f9639a1aaa8fd8030"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/b6f80c5d90d113d44d5456c94bbe983d1dfbda3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/b6f80c5d90d113d44d5456c94bbe983d1dfbda3e","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKGI2ZjgwYzVkOTBkMTEzZDQ0ZDU0NTZjOTRiYmU5ODNkMWRmYmRhM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/bbbf3e7934ab4ec76379c4e5c90da0ffd0909271","sha":"bbbf3e7934ab4ec76379c4e5c90da0ffd0909271","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/bbbf3e7934ab4ec76379c4e5c90da0ffd0909271"}],"sha":"b6f80c5d90d113d44d5456c94bbe983d1dfbda3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/b6f80c5d90d113d44d5456c94bbe983d1dfbda3e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/bbbf3e7934ab4ec76379c4e5c90da0ffd0909271/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T16:25:36Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T16:25:36Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat: route progress bar, loading skeletons, pending link state\n\nLanding CTA buttons used to feel unresponsive after click — the lab''s\nmodule routes are force-dynamic (Module 8 + 14 throw inside Suspense, so\nSSG breaks). Dynamic SSR means 200-600ms click-to-paint on a cold edge\nwith no visual feedback. Fixed three ways:\n\n1. RouteProgress bar (src/shell/RouteProgress.tsx) — slim accent bar\n   pinned at the top of every page. Fires the instant the user clicks\n   any same-origin link, eases toward 90 percent while the route loads,\n   completes when the pathname changes. Auto-cancels after 5s if the\n   click was suppressed. Mounted in root layout.\n\n2. Loading skeletons (Nextjs loading.tsx convention) for:\n   - /lab/[module]/loading.tsx — matches Lesson layout closely so the\n     swap to real content is jolt-free (same step gutter, same h1 box)\n   - /lab/journey/loading.tsx — header + controls + two dashboard\n     placeholder panels\n   - /lab/loading.tsx — generic fallback\n\n   Shared SkelBar + SkelCard primitives in src/shell/Skeleton.tsx.\n\n3. PendingLink (src/shell/PendingLink.tsx) — wraps next/link with\n   React 19''s useLinkStatus hook so a tiny inline spinner shows in the\n   button itself while the click is pending. Dims the button via\n   pendingClassName. Landing page CTAs swapped from Link to PendingLink:\n   nav ''Start the lab'', hero ''Begin Module 1'', ''Watch the dashboard\n   evolve'', ''Jump to the incident simulator''.\n\nNet effect on first-click latency: zero. Net effect on perceived\nlatency: the user gets feedback within ~16ms (next frame), no more\n''is this thing dead?'' moments.\n\nBuild clean; landing page went 1.3kb → 1.64kb (the four pending links).\nAll routes 200.","tree":{"sha":"904a00891e0d39504af8db5483f8e870a25a8555","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/904a00891e0d39504af8db5483f8e870a25a8555"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/bbbf3e7934ab4ec76379c4e5c90da0ffd0909271","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/bbbf3e7934ab4ec76379c4e5c90da0ffd0909271","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKGJiYmYzZTc5MzRhYjRlYzc2Mzc5YzRlNWM5MGRhMGZmZDA5MDkyNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/a2ed3888288e0d48548f23cae94dc76496da309c","sha":"a2ed3888288e0d48548f23cae94dc76496da309c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/a2ed3888288e0d48548f23cae94dc76496da309c"}],"sha":"bbbf3e7934ab4ec76379c4e5c90da0ffd0909271","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/bbbf3e7934ab4ec76379c4e5c90da0ffd0909271"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/a2ed3888288e0d48548f23cae94dc76496da309c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T10:49:07Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T10:49:07Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat(journey): code diffs + guided tour per stage\n\nThe Journey page now answers two questions readers were asking:\n''what exactly changed?'' and ''what should I be looking at?''\n\nTwo new primitives:\n\nsrc/viz/CodeDiff.tsx — GitHub-style line-by-line diff renderer.\nAccepts a diff string with ''+ '' / ''- '' / ''  '' line prefixes. Renders\nin a panel with file header, +N / -N counters, red/green gutter, and\nhorizontal scroll inside an overflow-x container so it never breaks\nthe mobile grid.\n\nsrc/viz/StageTour.tsx — collapsible step-by-step walkthrough card.\nEach step is { title, body, pointAt } where pointAt names a literal\nUI surface (''right-panel'' / ''profiler'' / ''diff'' / ''controls''). Tour\nauto-resets to step 0 when the journey level changes. Progress dots\nacross the top; prev/next buttons; supports tap-to-jump.\n\nJourney page rewrite:\n\nEach of the 11 stages now carries:\n- a  field with the actual code that changed (vs prior stage)\n  — anchored to a real filename so readers can grep for context\n- a  field with 3-4 numbered steps walking the user through\n  what to observe in this stage, in order\n\nThe tour card renders ABOVE the two dashboard panels (so newcomers\nread it before the visuals). The diff renders BELOW the panels (so\nthe reader has the visual context first, then sees the literal\nline that produced it).\n\nHeader updated to point readers at the tour. No regression to any\nexisting behavior — slider / chip nav / stage chain all unchanged.\n\nStage 00 has no diff (baseline) but still gets a tour. Stages 01-10\neach have a focused, real-filename diff:\n\n  01 → key={i} → key={s.sym}                      (StockFeed.tsx)\n  02 → stable wrapper element type                (StockFeed.tsx)\n  03 → useTransition + useDeferredValue           (SearchBar.tsx)\n  04 → memoised + sliced chart compute            (Chart.tsx)\n  05 → Suspense boundaries per async panel        (page.tsx)\n  06 → StaticChartShell on islands                (Dashboard.tsx)\n  07 → windowed activity list                     (ActivityFeed.tsx)\n  08 → manual memo dropped, compiler emits cache  (ProductCatalog.tsx)\n  09 → useOptimistic + server action              (ChatPanel.tsx)\n  10 → experimental.ppr + dynamic Suspense        (next.config.ts)\n\nBuild clean. Journey page 17KB (was 10KB); landing + sitemap +\nrobots + module pages unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"512b715624ebf978b32f5d9c7c47e1fb5f9c07c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/512b715624ebf978b32f5d9c7c47e1fb5f9c07c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/a2ed3888288e0d48548f23cae94dc76496da309c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/a2ed3888288e0d48548f23cae94dc76496da309c","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKGEyZWQzODg4Mjg4ZTBkNDg1NDhmMjNjYWU5NGRjNzY0OTZkYTMwOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/d7f787a9a8f46e64f9182f0d1ed42a7c65df5fe7","sha":"d7f787a9a8f46e64f9182f0d1ed42a7c65df5fe7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/d7f787a9a8f46e64f9182f0d1ed42a7c65df5fe7"}],"sha":"a2ed3888288e0d48548f23cae94dc76496da309c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/a2ed3888288e0d48548f23cae94dc76496da309c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/d7f787a9a8f46e64f9182f0d1ed42a7c65df5fe7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T08:27:48Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T08:27:48Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat: AdSense readiness — privacy/terms/about/contact, cookie consent, SEO infra\n\nEnd-to-end pass to get the lab through AdSense approval on first submit.\nADSENSE_READINESS.md walks the checklist.\n\nLegal + meta pages (the ones AdSense reviewers actually look for):\n- /privacy — Full policy covering cookies, AdSense data, GDPR + CCPA rights,\n  industry opt-outs (Google ad settings, NAI, YourAdChoices), retention,\n  international transfers, children, contact.\n- /terms — Educational disclaimer, MIT for code + CC BY 4.0 for content,\n  no-warranty boilerplate, advertising disclosure, acceptable use.\n- /about — What the lab is, editorial principles, tech stack, funding.\n- /contact — GitHub issues, security advisory, privacy contact, contribution.\n\nCookie consent + Google Consent Mode v2 (required for EEA traffic since Jan 2024):\n- src/legal/consentMode.ts — installs default-denied for ad_storage,\n  ad_user_data, ad_personalization, analytics_storage on every page load.\n  Persists choice in localStorage; broadcasts via custom events.\n- src/legal/CookieConsent.tsx — first-visit bottom-pinned banner with three\n  actions (accept all, reject non-essential, manage). Returning visitors\n  never see it. Footer ''Cookie preferences'' link reopens it.\n- AdSenseLoader rewritten to install Consent Mode default-denied via a\n  beforeInteractive <Script>, then load adsbygoogle.js afterInteractive.\n  Also emits <meta name=''google-adsense-account''> for site verification\n  during the AdSense application step.\n\nSEO foundation:\n- app/robots.ts — allows all, disallows /_next + /api, points at sitemap.\n- app/sitemap.ts — dynamic from MODULES registry. 31 URLs.\n- app/lab/[module]/page.tsx — generateMetadata producing unique title +\n  description + canonical + OpenGraph + Twitter card per module.\n  Marked force-dynamic because Module 8/14''s intentional Suspense errors\n  break static prerender (SSR is equivalent for indexing).\n\nShared footer (src/shell/SiteFooter.tsx) on landing + every legal page:\nAbout / Privacy / Terms / Contact / Cookie preferences / GitHub.\n\n.env.example adds NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL and NEXT_PUBLIC_ADSENSE_VERIFICATION_TAG.\n\nBuild clean. All routes 200 (landing, journey, 25 modules, /about /contact\n/privacy /terms /robots.txt /sitemap.xml). Without ad env vars set, no\nAdSense script loads and the banner shows once on first visit then\nremembers — dev parity with prior versions.\n\nThe one blocker only the user can fix is the custom domain — vercel.app\nsubdomains typically get ''insufficient site quality'' rejection.","tree":{"sha":"d5a8a01c076c7d9cfcf0c4a2623086d918771829","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/d5a8a01c076c7d9cfcf0c4a2623086d918771829"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/d7f787a9a8f46e64f9182f0d1ed42a7c65df5fe7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/d7f787a9a8f46e64f9182f0d1ed42a7c65df5fe7","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKGQ3Zjc4N2E5YThmNDZlNjRmOTE4MmYwZDFlZDQyYTdjNjVkZjVmZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/18ee36c0f04ed1029ab128a796eb089541c5d09b","sha":"18ee36c0f04ed1029ab128a796eb089541c5d09b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/18ee36c0f04ed1029ab128a796eb089541c5d09b"}],"sha":"d7f787a9a8f46e64f9182f0d1ed42a7c65df5fe7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/d7f787a9a8f46e64f9182f0d1ed42a7c65df5fe7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/18ee36c0f04ed1029ab128a796eb089541c5d09b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T08:09:20Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T08:09:20Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat: Google AdSense integration with policy-safe placements\n\nAdds optional Google AdSense monetisation gated by environment variables.\nWithout NEXT_PUBLIC_ADSENSE_CLIENT_ID set, every <AdSlot/> renders nothing\nand the loader script is never injected — dev / preview deploys stay\nidentical to before.\n\nWhy not the navbar (the original ask): AD_PLACEMENT.md analyses why\nsticky / pinned ads at the top of the page violate AdSense''s Better Ads\nStandards, why the navbar height doesn''t fit standard ad units, and why\nthe CTA conversion cost outweighs the expected CPM. The doc proposes\nthree policy-safe alternatives instead.\n\nThree placements wired in:\n- Landing in-feed (fluid native) — between the module grid and the FAQ.\n  Highest-volume page, highest expected revenue share (~70%).\n- Lab sidebar (vertical responsive) — lg+ only, mobile drawer never shows\n  ads. Lives below the 25-module list, doesn''t push content (~25%).\n- In-article + end-of-lesson (native in-article) — inserted by <Lesson/>\n  after the 4th step (only on lessons with 5+ steps) and after the\n  next/prev nav. Highest-quality impressions per AdSense''s content scoring\n  rubric (~5%).\n\nImplementation:\n- src/ads/AdSlot.tsx — the standard <ins class=''adsbygoogle''> wrapper. Pushes\n  to adsbygoogle queue on mount; swallows ad-blocker exceptions; renders\n  with reserved minHeight to prevent layout shift.\n- src/ads/AdSenseLoader.tsx — one-time script load via Next''s <Script\n  strategy=''afterInteractive''> so hydration is unaffected (Module 6 would\n  call us out otherwise).\n- .env.example — five env vars: publisher ID + four slot IDs (one per\n  placement, never re-used so AdSense reporting stays granular).\n- public/ads.txt — placeholder for AdSense''s authorised-sellers crawl.\n- README — Setup section with the four-ad-unit dashboard checklist.\n\nBuild clean. All 27 routes 200 with the ad env vars unset. Setting them\nwill activate the slots without further code changes.","tree":{"sha":"0a721229d59d98dcddf3db189031dab554630546","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/0a721229d59d98dcddf3db189031dab554630546"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/18ee36c0f04ed1029ab128a796eb089541c5d09b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/18ee36c0f04ed1029ab128a796eb089541c5d09b","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKDE4ZWUzNmMwZjA0ZWQxMDI5YWIxMjhhNzk2ZWIwODk1NDFjNWQwOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/43640f1ce3e17f67277284b8143b45aee186eab2","sha":"43640f1ce3e17f67277284b8143b45aee186eab2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/43640f1ce3e17f67277284b8143b45aee186eab2"}],"sha":"18ee36c0f04ed1029ab128a796eb089541c5d09b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/18ee36c0f04ed1029ab128a796eb089541c5d09b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/43640f1ce3e17f67277284b8143b45aee186eab2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T07:54:13Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T07:54:13Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat(v0.6): content depth pass — landing, journey, and per-module elaboration\n\nSix new shared dashboard components: SearchBar, NotificationsPanel,\nChatPanel, ProductCatalog, SettingsForm, Recommendations. Each takes\nfix-flags as props so individual modules can patch in their lesson''s\nbehavior.\n\nDashboard.tsx now has a ''compose'' prop (''core'' | ''wider'' | ''full'') that\ngrows the surface from 4 panels to 9 across the Journey. Every component\nparticipates in at least one module''s narrative.\n\n/lab/journey expanded 6 → 11 stages:\n  00 Day-1 naive React\n  01 Reconciliation\n  02 Diffing-aware (same-type stable)\n  03 Concurrent + transitions  (adds search panel)\n  04 Time slicing\n  05 Streaming SSR + suspense  (adds chat, products, settings, recs)\n  06 Islands — drop chart JS\n  07 Virtualised activity + products\n  08 Compiled — auto-memo\n  09 Server components + actions\n  10 Partial prerender — the 2026 baseline\n\nEach stage shows applied-fix bullets in a right rail and cross-links to\nthe deep-dive modules. Header explains the Architect Mode tie-in.\n\nLanding rewritten:\n- Nav: GitHub link, Journey link\n- Hero with 25/9/6/100% stats\n- ''Three ways to read it'' learning paths (linear / journey / incident-sim)\n- ''How a module works'' six-beat explainer\n- FAQ (audience, demo, custom profiler, telemetry, license, devtools)\n\nPer-module elaboration (1-2 new steps each):\n- Module 1: five reconciliation anti-patterns + when-NOT-to-memoize\n- Module 2: conditional-wrapper trap + two-heuristics deep dive\n- Module 3: 5 interview Q&As (alternate tree, hook order, refs, effects)\n- Module 4: ''when transitions don''t help''\n- Module 6: the 4 classic hydration mismatch causes\n- Module 9: cross-island state trap\n- Module 11: compiler escape hatches (''use no memo'', lint, opt-out)\n- Module 12: passing children server-through-client + RSC NOT-do list\n- Module 15: PPR vs SSG vs ISR vs SSR decision tree + cookie/searchParams gotchas\n\nBuild clean. 210KB First Load on /lab/[module]; 153KB on /lab/journey.","tree":{"sha":"fb1f08a6d5d63736596cf3010e2b9f3ade3319e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/fb1f08a6d5d63736596cf3010e2b9f3ade3319e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/43640f1ce3e17f67277284b8143b45aee186eab2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/43640f1ce3e17f67277284b8143b45aee186eab2","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKDQzNjQwZjFjZTNlMTdmNjcyNzcyODRiODE0M2I0NWFlZTE4NmVhYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/33e55667e782504c4e565c38669ab678b4a6b13c","sha":"33e55667e782504c4e565c38669ab678b4a6b13c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/33e55667e782504c4e565c38669ab678b4a6b13c"}],"sha":"43640f1ce3e17f67277284b8143b45aee186eab2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/43640f1ce3e17f67277284b8143b45aee186eab2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/33e55667e782504c4e565c38669ab678b4a6b13c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T07:35:59Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T07:35:59Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat(v0.5): vision audit + /lab/journey + Module 3/5/10 polish\n\nHonest audit of vision drift (VISION.md) — only Module 1 actually touched\nthe shared /dashboard/ surface; every other module built isolated demos.\nWe hit the narrative chain end-to-end but missed the literal ''watch one\ncodebase evolve'' payoff the brief opened with.\n\nCourse correction:\n\n- /lab/journey — the missing crown jewel. Six instances of the SAME\n  <Dashboard> rendered with progressively more fixes applied. Slider\n  0..5; page shows the picked level + the level immediately before it\n  so the delta is always on screen. Reads live from the same profiler\n  store. Linked from landing, sidebar, mobile drawer.\n- <Dashboard> now accepts every lever each module''s fix toggles:\n  badKeys/rowFlash/chartHeavyMs/tickMs/activitySize/islands/\n  virtualisedActivity. The shared surface IS the evolving codebase now.\n- <ActivityFeed> got a real windowed mode (Module 10''s fix applied to\n  the shared surface), so 200-item lists scroll smoothly when toggled.\n\nPolish:\n\n- Module 3 (Fiber): FiberTrace now plays the full render → before-mutation\n  → mutation → layout commit phase progression with sub-phase highlights\n  and per-node ''DOM patched'' / ''useLayoutEffect'' badges. New LaneBitmask\n  viz showing the 31-bit priority mask with toggleable named lanes\n  (Sync, InputContinuous, Default, Transition, Retry, Idle, Offscreen)\n  and ''next to render'' picked via lowest-set-bit.\n- Module 5 (Time slicing): LongTaskMonitor reads real PerformanceObserver\n  ''longtask'' entries from the current page. Two buttons demonstrate the\n  contrast — ''burn 80ms blocking'' creates a long-task entry; ''burn 80ms\n  sliced'' yields after every 4ms and produces no entries. Added a\n  scheduler.postTask vs requestIdleCallback explainer step.\n- Module 10 (Virtualization): dynamic row heights via prefix-sum +\n  binary-search indexing. Heights vary 24-96px by row index hash; the\n  windowing math finds the first visible row in O(log n).\n\nAll 25 routes 200 + /lab/journey 200. Production build clean.","tree":{"sha":"92fae9007c1e7783e6ad6a8558192eb2b6105ebe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/92fae9007c1e7783e6ad6a8558192eb2b6105ebe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/33e55667e782504c4e565c38669ab678b4a6b13c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/33e55667e782504c4e565c38669ab678b4a6b13c","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKDMzZTU1NjY3ZTc4MjUwNGM0ZTU2NWMzODY2OWFiNjc4YjRhNmIxM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/5c481701d3a5a6528120e038e0b187ff722e8f2f","sha":"5c481701d3a5a6528120e038e0b187ff722e8f2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/5c481701d3a5a6528120e038e0b187ff722e8f2f"}],"sha":"33e55667e782504c4e565c38669ab678b4a6b13c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/33e55667e782504c4e565c38669ab678b4a6b13c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/5c481701d3a5a6528120e038e0b187ff722e8f2f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T07:22:02Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T07:22:02Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat(v0.4): flesh out Modules 17-24 — no more ComingSoon\n\nEvery one of the 25 modules now ships real interactive content. The chain\nis intact end-to-end.\n\n- Module 17 (Browser Pipeline): style/layout/paint/composite phases viz,\n  CSS-property × phase impact table, layout-thrashing demo with real\n  timings (interleaved vs batched read-then-write), transform vs top/left\n  animation comparison, composite-layer count strategy toggle.\n- Module 18 (Network): request waterfall chart with sequential / parallel\n  / dedup / slow-3G toggles, retry simulator comparing naive / exponential\n  backoff with jitter / circuit breaker.\n- Module 19 (Microfrontends): Module Federation dependency graph (svg)\n  with shared-singleton toggle. Flip ''team-C upgrades to React 19'' to\n  trigger a runtime-contract failure (host=19, remote requires 18) with\n  KB-shipped math both ways.\n- Module 20 (Build): interactive bundle treemap with four optimization\n  toggles (tree-shake / code-split / lib-swap / dead-code) and real KB\n  arithmetic. Initial-bundle vs total-shipped split.\n- Module 21 (A11y): live focus-path tracker (tab through a mini-dashboard,\n  see the path build up), DOM-vs-AOM side-by-side, focus-trap modal demo\n  with proper focus restore on close.\n- Module 22 (Observability): live Web Vitals dashboard reading LCP / CLS /\n  FCP / TTFB / INP from real PerformanceObserver entries on the current\n  page. Plus distributed-trace flamegraph showing FE↔BE spans linked via\n  traceparent.\n- Module 23 (Memory): live heap chart from performance.memory (Chrome),\n  four leak triggers (interval / window listener / closure / unbounded\n  cache) with a cleanup button, retention-path diagram (root → cause →\n  leak).\n- Module 24 (Security): XSS playground rendering the same input as JSX /\n  sanitised (allow-list, no event handlers) / raw dangerouslySetInnerHTML\n  with an in-page mini-DOMPurify; CSP comparison (none vs default-src ''self''\n  vs strict-dynamic+nonce); SafeLink / SafeHtml / in-memory-token snippets.\n\nFixes:\n- DOMParser is browser-only → gate Module 24''s sanitiser to client.\n- Module 23''s window.gc shim now typed via cast instead of @ts-expect-error.\n\nAll 25 routes 200 with iPhone UA. Production build clean (201KB First\nLoad on /lab/[module]).","tree":{"sha":"d8086f1668eb1b0142be49cfef433002aff79c61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/d8086f1668eb1b0142be49cfef433002aff79c61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/5c481701d3a5a6528120e038e0b187ff722e8f2f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/5c481701d3a5a6528120e038e0b187ff722e8f2f","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKDVjNDgxNzAxZDNhNWE2NTI4MTIwZTAzOGUwYjE4N2ZmNzIyZThmMmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/09b142ff9b80986aa0a7575e250013bac53b6ee4","sha":"09b142ff9b80986aa0a7575e250013bac53b6ee4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/09b142ff9b80986aa0a7575e250013bac53b6ee4"}],"sha":"5c481701d3a5a6528120e038e0b187ff722e8f2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/5c481701d3a5a6528120e038e0b187ff722e8f2f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/09b142ff9b80986aa0a7575e250013bac53b6ee4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T03:48:07Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T03:48:07Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat(v0.3): Staff+ extension — 25 modules, Architect Mode, Incident Simulator\n\nPivots the lab from ''React performance playground'' to ''Frontend Systems\nArchitecture & Interview Simulator'' per the new prompt. Existing modules 1-15\npreserved; the 10 new Staff+ modules occupy slots 16-25 to keep the\nbottleneck-chain narrative intact.\n\nRegistry chain extended (15 → 25):\n  16 state-architecture → 17 browser-pipeline → 18 network-data\n  → 19 microfrontends → 20 build-bundle → 21 accessibility\n  → 22 observability → 23 memory-leaks → 24 security → 25 incident-simulator\n\nDeep implementations this pass:\n- Module 16 (State Architecture at Scale): four strategies side-by-side\n  (prop drilling / single context / split context / external store +\n  selector) using useSyncExternalStore. Live render counters via the\n  existing MetricsPanel; users feel the blast-radius difference.\n- Module 25 (Production Incident Simulator): incidents.ts catalogue (six\n  fully-fleshed scenarios — CPU spike, render loop, memory leak, hydration\n  mismatch, retry storm, stale cache). Each incident has symptoms, metrics\n  snapshot, candidate hypotheses, root cause, fix, and the next bottleneck\n  the fix exposes. UI walks the on-call playbook: intake → diagnose → fix\n  → validate → postmortem, with scoring tied to incident difficulty.\n- Module 4 got the SchedulerQueue viz with 5 lanes (sync / input / default\n  / transition / idle), interrupt animation, and CPU ''currently running'' bar.\n- Module 1 added ref-as-prop and <Context value> shorthand sub-steps.\n- Module 2 got the custom-elements callout.\n- Module 7 added document-metadata + stylesheet-precedence + asset-preloading\n  (preload/preinit/preconnect) sub-steps.\n- Module 8 rebuilt: cache() de-duplication demo, ErrorBoundary retry\n  pattern, and React 19''s createRoot error callbacks (onCaughtError /\n  onUncaughtError / onRecoverableError).\n\nNew global primitive: ArchitectGate (src/engine/ArchitectGate.tsx) wraps\nfix reveals behind reflection prompts (why / tradeoffs / next bottleneck).\nArchitectModeToggle in the profiler dock persists in localStorage and\nmakes the gate required everywhere.\n\nModules 17-24 are scaffolded — registered in the chain, route to the\nComingSoon fallback. TODO.md lists the interactive demos queued for each.\n\nAll 25 routes 200 with iPhone UA; production build clean.","tree":{"sha":"414a9870c86342d7bfa5ec0c9039deb5bd019f56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/414a9870c86342d7bfa5ec0c9039deb5bd019f56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/09b142ff9b80986aa0a7575e250013bac53b6ee4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/09b142ff9b80986aa0a7575e250013bac53b6ee4","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKDA5YjE0MmZmOWI4MDk4NmFhMGE3NTc1ZTI1MDAxM2JhYzUzYjZlZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/feb9d1276ee86a64f4dcbd05aec90f479b05b45f","sha":"feb9d1276ee86a64f4dcbd05aec90f479b05b45f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/feb9d1276ee86a64f4dcbd05aec90f479b05b45f"}],"sha":"09b142ff9b80986aa0a7575e250013bac53b6ee4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/09b142ff9b80986aa0a7575e250013bac53b6ee4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/feb9d1276ee86a64f4dcbd05aec90f479b05b45f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T03:24:43Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T03:24:43Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat(mobile): mobile-first nav, collapsible dock, viewport meta, viz reflow\n\nThe desktop sidebar was ''hidden md:flex'' — phones had no navigation at all.\n\n- shell/MobileNav.tsx: top bar + slide-out drawer with module list (lg:hidden).\n  Body scroll-locks while drawer is open; drawer auto-closes on link tap.\n- ProfilerDock: split into a compact mobile pill (FPS + render total, tap to\n  expand) and the full desktop dock. CommitTimeline only renders inside the\n  expanded panel on phones.\n- LabLayout: keeps the sidebar on lg+, otherwise relies on MobileNav.\n- engine/Lesson + Step + BeforeAfter + TryIt: tighter padding, smaller heading\n  on phones, headers wrap, step gutter narrows to 28px on mobile.\n- viz: DiffTree/StreamChunks/PprDiagram 2-col grids now stack on mobile;\n  RscBoundary tree wraps inside overflow-x-auto; FiberTrace controls wrap;\n  HydrationOverlay mode buttons wrap.\n- Landing page: tighter spacing on phones, CTAs stack vertically, ''next\n  bottleneck'' pill is visible without hover (touch devices have no hover).\n- Root layout: explicit Viewport export (initial-scale=1, no auto-zoom).\n- globals.css: -webkit-tap-highlight-color none + touch-action manipulation\n  on interactive elements (kills iOS double-tap-zoom delay).\n\nSmoke-tested all 15 routes with an iPhone UA — all 200.","tree":{"sha":"06bb8c1537f6c8d3cc65876bd1484be25aeb1901","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/06bb8c1537f6c8d3cc65876bd1484be25aeb1901"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/commits/feb9d1276ee86a64f4dcbd05aec90f479b05b45f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/feb9d1276ee86a64f4dcbd05aec90f479b05b45f","node_id":"C_kwDOSgNnddoAKGZlYjlkMTI3NmVlODZhNjRmNGRjYmQwNWFlYzkwZjQ3OWIwNWI0NWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commit/069dc624c4adc30e7c060d4ff60a37d1f594fb8c","sha":"069dc624c4adc30e7c060d4ff60a37d1f594fb8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/069dc624c4adc30e7c060d4ff60a37d1f594fb8c"}],"sha":"feb9d1276ee86a64f4dcbd05aec90f479b05b45f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/feb9d1276ee86a64f4dcbd05aec90f479b05b45f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20451042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mithun9421","id":20451042,"login":"mithun9421","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDUxMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mithun9421","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/commits/069dc624c4adc30e7c060d4ff60a37d1f594fb8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T02:56:03Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T02:56:03Z","email":"mithunmuralee94@gmail.com","name":"Mithun"},"message":"feat: add Modules 11-15 — Compiler, RSC, Server Actions, use(), PPR\n\nCloses the React 19 / 2026 coverage gap identified in TODO.md.\n\n- Module 11 (React Compiler): side-by-side naive/manual/compiled child render\n  counts; shows the useMemoCache pattern; lists where you still need to think\n  manually (refs, external stores, context fan-out, time-dependent renders).\n- Module 12 (Server Components): interactive ''use client'' boundary toggler\n  with live bundle-byte math. Demonstrates downward-contagion rule.\n- Module 13 (Server Actions): real server action wired with revalidatePath.\n  Demos useActionState (validation), useFormStatus (submit button), and\n  useOptimistic (instant feedback). Progressive-enhancement narrative.\n- Module 14 (use() hook): use(promise) with Suspense + ErrorBoundary retry,\n  and conditional use(context) — the only hook legal in branches.\n- Module 15 (PPR): animated request timeline showing static-shell paint\n  before dynamic Suspense holes stream in from origin.\n\nAlso: new viz primitives (RscBoundary, PprDiagram); registry next-bottleneck\nchain updated to flow 10 → 11 → ... → 15 → back to 1; README + PROGRESS +\nTODO updated; build + dev smoke test on all 15 routes green.","tree":{"sha":"6d07abcf79981d49d05409e25da70b658c099f0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mithun9421/react-rendering-lab/git/trees/6d07abcf79981d49d05409