"type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/metril/unifi-camera-proxy/commits/3164bf6cdb64c1ff9968498f6fc30405ba557700/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T01:25:03Z","email":"metril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jagannath Pranatharthikaran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T01:25:03Z","email":"metril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jagannath Pranatharthikaran"},"message":"Exempt table rows from the markdownlint line-length rule\n\nThe docs rewrite added camera config field tables whose rows exceed the\n100-char MD013 limit. Markdown table rows cannot be wrapped, so set\nMD013 tables: false. Prose is still wrapped at 100.","tree":{"sha":"ad38461361ebb1d461b636ce7bdde2d89c17bad1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/metril/unifi-camera-proxy/git/trees/ad38461361ebb1d461b636ce7bdde2d89c17bad1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/metril/unifi-camera-proxy/git/commits/3164bf6cdb64c1ff9968498f6fc30405ba557700","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517921?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/metril","id":1517921,"login":"metril","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTc5MjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/metril/unifi-camera-proxy/commit/3164bf6cdb64c1ff9968498f6fc30405ba557700","node_id":"C_kwDOSgOI_doAKDMxNjRiZjZjZGI2NGMxZmY5OTY4NDk4ZjZmYzMwNDA1YmE1NTc3MDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/metril/unifi-camera-proxy/commit/b301e809a27ea21dc36f47fe963c2009f1067292","sha":"b301e809a27ea21dc36f47fe963c2009f1067292","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/metril/unifi-camera-proxy/commits/b301e809a27ea21dc36f47fe963c2009f1067292"}],"sha":"3164bf6cdb64c1ff9968498f6fc30405ba557700","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/metril/unifi-camera-proxy/commits/3164bf6cdb64c1ff9968498f6fc30405ba557700"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517921?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/metril","id":1517921,"login":"metril","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTc5MjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/metril/unifi-camera-proxy/commits/b301e809a27ea21dc36f47fe963c2009f1067292/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T01:19:17Z","email":"metril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jagannath Pranatharthikaran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T01:19:17Z","email":"metril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jagannath Pranatharthikaran"},"message":"Rewrite docs as web-container-only\n\nStandalone / Legacy-CLI containers are no longer a supported user-facing\ndeployment; only the web container is supported. Update all documentation\naccordingly:\n\n- intro.md: drop the Legacy CLI Mode section (certificate generation,\n  per-camera Docker, bare-metal install); now a single web-container guide.\n- common.md: deleted. Its shared content moves to web-ui.md as the new\n  Per-Camera Common Fields, Common Camera Fields, and Supported Camera\n  Models sections.\n- web-ui.md: document the missing sync-name endpoint.\n- 8 camera-type pages: convert CLI flag tables to config.yaml field tables\n  and CLI examples to YAML config examples; keep feature checklists and\n  model-specific notes.\n- sidebars.js: drop the removed common page.\n- README.md: remove the Legacy single-camera mode environment variables.\n\nNo code change: the unifi-camera-proxy CLI stays as the web container''s\ninternal subprocess.","tree":{"sha":"17b483c020d72d75878b6fa06f01c4fe25317423","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/metril/unifi-camera-proxy/git/trees/17b483c020d72d75878b6fa06f01c4fe25317423"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/metril/unifi-camera-proxy/git/commits/b301e809a27ea21dc36f47fe963c2009f1067292","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517921?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/metril","id":1517921,"login":"metril","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTc5MjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/received_events","rep