ame":"metril"},"message":"Fix camera name/model: auto-detect on dropdown select, ensure defaults\n\nAuto-trigger Frigate detect when selecting a camera from the dropdown\nso all fields are populated immediately. Ensure --name and --model\nare always passed to the subprocess, defaulting to the Frigate camera\nname and UVC G4 Bullet respectively if not set.\n\nNote: Protect caches name/model from first adoption. To update\nexisting cameras, delete in Protect and restart the proxy.","tree":{"sha":"0c26772672717bd8e5f21de15cc0557be9ae9832","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/metril/unifi-camera-proxy/git/trees/0c26772672717bd8e5f21de15cc0557be9ae9832"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/metril/unifi-camera-proxy/git/commits/aef7c6ea543c9d6a8cbd00509360c99f6b403def","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517921?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/metril","id":1517921,"login":"metril","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTc5MjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/metril","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/metril/unifi-camera-proxy/commit/aef7c6ea543c9d6a8cbd00509360c99f6b403def","node_id":"C_kwDOSgOI_doAKGFlZjdjNmVhNTQzYzlkNmE4Y2JkMDA1MDkzNjBjOTlmNmI0MDNkZWY","parents":[{"