pos/Nishant-Chaudhary5338/MicroFrontend/commits/433772e709ee066ff057168036cf80765b495b3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T21:25:02Z","email":"nishantchaudhary5338@gmail.com","name":"Nishant"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T21:25:02Z","email":"nishantchaudhary5338@gmail.com","name":"Nishant"},"message":"feat: complete TVPlus Plugin MFE POC with DevTools and stable hash comparison\n\n- Micro-frontend shell + 4 remote plugins (SMS, QCA, CMS, MAM) via Module Federation\n- Route-level code splitting: each route is a separate chunk; adding a route adds 1 chunk, existing routes unchanged\n- Plugin isolation: adding/removing a plugin does not affect other plugins'' chunk hashes\n- DevTools (port 5001 API + port 5173 UI): scaffold plugins, add routes, build, compare chunk hashes\n- Content-MD5 comparison with hash-chaining fix: strips 8-char Vite hash suffixes from file content before hashing so import URL rotation doesn''t cause false Modified results\n- Auto-snapshot before build, auto-build after scaffold\n- Registry-driven runtime loading: change a URL → shell picks up new plugin version on next load\n- CLAUDE.md with full project context and Windows setup notes\n- docs/MFE-ARCHITECTURE.md with architecture, code splitting, and comparison deep-dive\n- .gitattributes for consistent LF line endings across Mac/Windows\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a717185677a072e13cbfbd0a35017d3fcf66a568","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nishant-Chaudhary5338/MicroFrontend/git/trees/a717185677a072e13cbfbd0a35017d3fcf66a568"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nishant-Chaudhary5338/MicroFrontend/git/commits/433772e709ee066ff057168036cf80765b495b3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87515250?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nishant-Chaudhary5338/events{/pri