"html_url":"https://github.com/8sami","id":178286727,"login":"8sami","node_id":"U_kgDOCqBwhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commits/ee9d0da511432e40f8444cab14a5ea2be1269593/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T13:38:27Z","email":"samikhan15262822@gmail.com","name":"Sami Khan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T13:38:27Z","email":"samikhan15262822@gmail.com","name":"Sami Khan"},"message":"ci: fail the run when the suite matches no tests\n\nA project that matches nothing exits 0, so the job goes green having run\nnothing at all — the one failure this workflow could not otherwise report.\nRead the counts back out of the json reporter, fail on zero, and write them to\nthe step summary so the run page says how many tests actually passed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EzdEJhY84BgZHC7jXYKgxP","tree":{"sha":"659b2a53ec12541eacc8eec8fa64040e6f5661e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/git/trees/659b2a53ec12541eacc8eec8fa64040e6f5661e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/git/commits/ee9d0da511432e40f8444cab14a5ea2be1269593","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178286727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/8sami","id":178286727,"login":"8sami","node_id":"U_kgDOCqBwhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commit/ee9d0da511432e40f8444cab14a5ea2be1269593","node_id":"C_kwDOSgQRj9oAKGVlOWQwZGE1MTE0MzJlNDBmODQ0NGNhYjE0YTVlYTJiZTEyNjk1OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commit/852425f296ea3bc11bcee50d017804f135e07840","sha":"852425f296ea3bc11bcee50d017804f135e07840","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commits/852425f296ea3bc11bcee50d017804f135e07840"}],"sha":"ee9d0da511432e40f8444cab14a5ea2be1269593","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commits/ee9d0da511432e40f8444cab14a5ea2be1269593"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178286727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/8sami","id":178286727,"login":"8sami","node_id":"U_kgDOCqBwhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commits/852425f296ea3bc11bcee50d017804f135e07840/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T13:25:11Z","email":"samikhan15262822@gmail.com","name":"Sami Khan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T13:25:11Z","email":"samikhan15262822@gmail.com","name":"Sami Khan"},"message":"ci: install care_fe deps outside NODE_ENV=production\n\nThe first run died at the care_fe build with exit 127. `npm ci` under\nNODE_ENV=production skips devDependencies, so cross-env and vite were never\ninstalled and `npm run build` had no binary to call.\n\ncare_fe''s own workflow puts NODE_ENV on the build step alone and leaves the\ninstall bare; collapsing the two into one step lost that. Split back apart.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EzdEJhY84BgZHC7jXYKgxP","tree":{"sha":"4e772f39e286eb17cb9841c873a4d4f96b5c5a31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/git/trees/4e772f39e286eb17cb9841c873a4d4f96b5c5a31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/git/commits/852425f296ea3bc11bcee50d017804f135e07840","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178286727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/8sami","id":178286727,"login":"8sami","node_id":"U_kgDOCqBwhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commit/852425f296ea3bc11bcee50d017804f135e07840","node_id":"C_kwDOSgQRj9oAKDg1MjQyNWYyOTZlYTNiYzExYmNlZTUwZDAxNzgwNGYxMzVlMDc4NDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commit/949fdad8fcb3e2acca5da92de3ff6e52d9b4236e","sha":"949fdad8fcb3e2acca5da92de3ff6e52d9b4236e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commits/949fdad8fcb3e2acca5da92de3ff6e52d9b4236e"}],"sha":"852425f296ea3bc11bcee50d017804f135e07840","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commits/852425f296ea3bc11bcee50d017804f135e07840"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178286727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/8sami","id":178286727,"login":"8sami","node_id":"U_kgDOCqBwhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commits/949fdad8fcb3e2acca5da92de3ff6e52d9b4236e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T13:12:37Z","email":"samikhan15262822@gmail.com","name":"Sami Khan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T13:12:37Z","email":"samikhan15262822@gmail.com","name":"Sami Khan"},"message":"ci: run the Playwright suite on GitHub Actions\n\nPorted from care_fe''s .github/workflows/playwright.yaml, since this suite is a\nport of care_fe''s and drives care_fe itself. It follows the host''s workflow\nwhere the host has an answer: care checked out at develop and started through\n`make ... up load-fixtures`, DISABLE_RATELIMIT and care_fe''s committed JWKS\nwritten into docker/.local.env, the setup project run as its own command before\nthe chromium project -- which is why the config declares no setup dependency\nunder CI -- Node 24, a Playwright browser cache, and the report uploaded as an\nartifact.\n\nThree deliberate differences: one job rather than three shards behind a\npaths-filter (three specs, eight tests), the GHA layer cache rather than image\ntarballs for the care image, and two plugin-specific steps -- the celery worker\nis stopped before anything creates an event, and an always() step clears seeded\nevents so a run that dies before globalTeardown cannot leave recipients for the\nsweep to send.\n\nThe playwright:* scripts docs/how-to/run-the-tests.mdx already documents were\nmissing from package.json; they are care_fe''s, verbatim.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EzdEJhY84BgZHC7jXYKgxP","tree":{"sha":"cede6b2e32170793668d66db0591d31f14a134c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/git/trees/cede6b2e32170793668d66db0591d31f14a134c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/git/commits/949fdad8fcb3e2acca5da92de3ff6e52d9b4236e","verification":{"payl