dc3444acff05e648d7ae7369692d7e"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commit/59aa858e475d97cf31ccd307e4f0215646a29a58","sha":"59aa858e475d97cf31ccd307e4f0215646a29a58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commits/59aa858e475d97cf31ccd307e4f0215646a29a58"}],"sha":"9d104ca3425f5160eb0f3c82e68cb830e2abe3cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commits/9d104ca3425f5160eb0f3c82e68cb830e2abe3cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178286727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/8sami","id":178286727,"login":"8sami","node_id":"U_kgDOCqBwhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commits/59aa858e475d97cf31ccd307e4f0215646a29a58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T00:35:53Z","email":"samikhan15262822@gmail.com","name":"Sami Khan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T00:35:53Z","email":"samikhan15262822@gmail.com","name":"Sami Khan"},"message":"docs: finish the manual-notification removal\n\nLeftovers from the previous commit, found in review:\n\n- reference/api.mdx still listed `POST notification-events/` in the endpoint\n  table, four lines above the new \"there is no POST endpoint\" line, and still\n  named the two core endpoints the deleted recipient pickers called.\n- explanation/notification-model.mdx claimed the facility \"is recomputed on\n  every save\", the opposite of the save() branch the removal deliberately kept.\n- reference/permissions.mdx counted five slugs; there are four.\n- how-to/map-template-variables.mdx still explained manual triggers.\n- the tutorial promised a seeded event reaches \"delivered\", which it cannot when\n  the mapping reaches into a related object it has none of.\n\nAlso drops what the removal orphaned: the \"staff\" string, tests/helper/error.ts,\nand query.debounced with the three picker search settings it read.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QnsAfTeTQLeWy2MK4Rgg65","tree":{"sha":"50fcceb44ff250923e22448f67318ec3b964e45a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/git/trees/50fcceb44ff250923e22448f67318ec3b964e45a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/git/commits/59aa858e475d97cf31ccd307e4f0215646a29a58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178286727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/8sami","id":178286727,"login":"8sami","node_id":"U_kgDOCqBwhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commit/59aa858e475d97cf31ccd307e4f0215646a29a58","node_id":"C_kwDOSgQRj9oAKDU5YWE4NThlNDc1ZDk3Y2YzMWNjZDMwN2U0ZjAyMTU2NDZhMjlhNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commit/59267b7616026828b828922919bd7de25af13b60","sha":"59267b7616026828b828922919bd7de25af13b60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commits/59267b7616026828b828922919bd7de25af13b60"}],"sha":"59aa858e475d97cf31ccd307e4f0215646a29a58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commits/59aa858e475d97cf31ccd307e4f0215646a29a58"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178286727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/8sami","id":178286727,"login":"8sami","node_id":"U_kgDOCqBwhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/commits/59267b7616026828b828922919bd7de25af13b60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T00:10:28Z","email":"samikhan15262822@gmail.com","name":"Sami Khan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T00:10:28Z","email":"samikhan15262822@gmail.com","name":"Sami Khan"},"message":"refact: remove manual notification creation from the UI\n\nThe create screen could never produce a delivered message: no migration seeds a\nmanual-type trigger, so its trigger dropdown was always empty, and the \"New\nnotification\" button was gated only on the permission -- every facility admin\nsaw a button leading to a form that could not be submitted.\n\nRemoves the create page and its route, the recipient picker and the patient/user\nsearch it used, `can_create_notification_event`, the event write type and its\nendpoint, and the strings and UI components left orphaned by all of it.\n\nThe dispatch spec seeded its events through the create API. It now shells into\nthe backend for `seed_notification_test_data --create-event`, the way\nglobalTeardown already shells in to clear them, so dispatch keeps its coverage.\n\nDocs follow: the manual how-to becomes a dispatch how-to, and the tutorial seeds\nan event instead of filling in a form.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QnsAfTeTQLeWy2MK4Rgg65","tree":{"sha":"8b3f3ffa9567b2dd89f01b6fc9762cdf237917a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/git/trees/8b3f3ffa9567b2dd89f01b6fc9762cdf237917a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_im_wrapper_fe/git/commits/59267b7616026828b828922919bd7de25af13b60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178286727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8sami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/8sami","id":178286727,"login":"8sami","node_id":"U_kgDOCqBwhw","organizations_url":