","email":"kauanvieiraxavierdev@gmail.com","name":"Kauan-VX"},"message":"feat(cards): infinite scroll, filters integration and quantity stepper\n\nGrid now reads search and category from the shared filters store, paginates\nvia IntersectionObserver (with a Load More fallback for environments\nwithout IO), and the product card swaps the add button for a stepper\nwhen an item is already in the cart. Bootstrap no longer wraps with a\nredux provider; webpack shares axios alongside zustand.","tree":{"sha":"b65f4abff9a5eb2aa57f766b5bd047c850be4c8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kauan-VX/challenge-vr/git/trees/b65f4abff9a5eb2aa57f766b5bd047c850be4c8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kauan-VX/challenge-vr/git/commits/2ba9f8382343d363855faea35c9b8fa36c7c65cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115324901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kauan-VX/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kauan-VX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kauan-VX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kauan-VX/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kauan-VX","id":115324901,"login":"Kauan-VX","node_id":"U_kgDOBt-35Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kauan-VX/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kauan-VX/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kauan-VX/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kauan-VX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kauan-VX/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kauan-VX","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kauan-VX/challenge-vr/commit/2ba9f8382343d363855faea35c9b8fa36c7c65cb","node_id":"C_kwDOSgWsAdoAKDJiYTlmODM4MjM0M2QzNjM4NTVmYWVhMzVjOWI4ZmEzNmM3YzY1Y2I