trlshiftOFF/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TBekrman/giflabs2/commits/093aefbea0ab5a366e90cd49f1fb85ef1708bf3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-12T22:03:41Z","email":"donteatyourprettypet@gmail.com","name":"OFF"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-12T22:03:41Z","email":"donteatyourprettypet@gmail.com","name":"OFF"},"message":"Remove tag filters and add Strapi proxy\n\nRemove multi-tag filtering and related UI/state: drop tags state and fetch, remove tag query params handling and toggle helpers, remove tag chips from active filters and filter panel, and adjust filters grid. Update tag presentation by removing the leading ''#'' in PostCard and TagList. Refactor fetchStrapi to use a browser proxy (/api/strapi) while using the direct Strapi URL server-side, and only apply next.revalidate on the server. Update Strapi post schema (minified) to make tags not required. Minor import cleanup (removed unused Tag type).","tree":{"sha":"0c846a2359540ba59c806a09a968a50c49a84afa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TBekrman/giflabs2/git/trees/0c846a2359540ba59c806a09a968a50c49a84afa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TBekrman/giflabs2/git/commits/093aefbea0ab5a366e90cd49f1fb85ef1708bf3b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87695763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/following{/other_user}","gist