or the kernel.yml fix: brew install hdf5\n+ symlink gfortran on macOS, libhdf5-dev on Linux.","tree":{"sha":"02b2c3da28b0d9d71f91b1251547f27166ff39cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/git/trees/02b2c3da28b0d9d71f91b1251547f27166ff39cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/git/commits/e86c3657dcfeda6a0b534f88788c1ade3fadc1f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171766563?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197","id":171766563,"login":"hector100197","node_id":"U_kgDOCjzzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197/astro/commit/e86c3657dcfeda6a0b534f88788c1ade3fadc1f2","node_id":"C_kwDOSgdkWdoAKGU4NmMzNjU3ZGNmZWRhNmEwYjUzNGY4ODc4OGMxYWRlM2ZhZGMxZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197/astro/commit/8e391a0a3e6da384623832712e53e14f4a2a5c46","sha":"8e391a0a3e6da384623832712e53e14f4a2a5c46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/8e391a0a3e6da384623832712e53e14f4a2a5c46"}],"sha":"e86c3657dcfeda6a0b534f88788c1ade3fadc1f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/e86c3657dcfeda6a0b534f88788c1ade3fadc1f2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171766563?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197","id":171766563,"login":"hector100197","node_id":"U_kgDOCjzzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/8e391a0a3e6da384623832712e53e14f4a2a5c46/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T06:24:14Z","email":"jrmv100197@gmail.com","name":"Hector Medel Villar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T06:24:14Z","email":"jrmv100197@gmail.com","name":"Hector Medel Villar"},"message":"e2e: shrink heavy specs to 2000 steps + provide python report venv\n\nbatch_validation dt=0.005 (the heaviest spec) still exceeded the\nbudget on the shared CI runner at 5000 steps. Conservation at\ndt=0.005 is excellent regardless of step count, so 2000 steps yields\nthe same NBODY6-grade verdict while fitting the budget; apply the\nsame to report_download. Also create python/.venv and install the\npackage so the service''s report_plots subprocess resolves instead of\nemitting ModuleNotFoundError — figures now embed and the full report\npath is exercised.","tree":{"sha":"a4ebda075c042f541af84786745f14cf01a3a7de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/git/trees/a4ebda075c042f541af84786745f14cf01a3a7de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/git/commits/8e391a0a3e6da384623832712e53e14f4a2a5c46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171766563?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197","id":171766563,"login":"hector100197","node_id":"U_kgDOCjzzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197/astro/commit/8e391a0a3e6da384623832712e53e14f4a2a5c46","node_id":"C_kwDOSgdkWdoAKDhlMzkxYTBhM2U2ZGEzODQ2MjM4MzI3MTJlNTNlMTRmNGEyYTVjNDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197/astro/commit/fa8464691c845d729d506e0fd2cff26851d1927b","sha":"fa8464691c845d729d506e0fd2cff26851d1927b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/fa8464691c845d729d506e0fd2cff26851d1927b"}],"sha":"8e391a0a3e6da384623832712e53e14f4a2a5c46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/8e391a0a3e6da384623832712e53e14f4a2a5c46"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171766563?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197","id":171766563,"login":"hector100197","node_id":"U_kgDOCjzzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/fa8464691c845d729d506e0fd2cff26851d1927b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T05:58:11Z","email":"jrmv100197@gmail.com","name":"Hector Medel Villar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T05:58:11Z","email":"jrmv100197@gmail.com","name":"Hector Medel Villar"},"message":"e2e: raise timeouts for real-job specs (CI runner is slower than a dev box)\n\nWith baseURL on :4201 the smoke specs now pass (UI loads), but\nbatch_validation/report_download submit a real N=3000/5000-step\nPleiades run and wait for the full pipeline. Playwright''s 60s\nper-test/hook budget was below the job duration on a shared CI\nrunner (it completes, just slower), so they hit ''Test timeout\n60000ms'' while the internal poller still had slack. Raise the\nglobal test timeout to 240s and the poll deadlines to 210s.","tree":{"sha":"7c8feb40e70095b1c0f9c3f25c8e8deb6f572e8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/git/trees/7c8feb40e70095b1c0f9c3f25c8e8deb6f572e8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/git/commits/fa8464691c845d729d506e0fd2cff26851d1927b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171766563?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197","id":171766563,"login":"hector100197","node_id":"U_kgDOCjzzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197/astro/commit/fa8464691c845d729d506e0fd2cff26851d1927b","node_id":"C_kwDOSgdkWdoAKGZhODQ2NDY5MWM4NDVkNzI5ZDUwNmUwZmQyY2ZmMjY4NTFkMTkyN2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197/astro/commit/23e2902bd6b8beea66ecbea007b45a59606c7e5d","sha":"23e2902bd6b8beea66ecbea007b45a59606c7e5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/23e2902bd6b8beea66ecbea007b45a59606c7e5d"}],"sha":"fa8464691c845d729d506e0fd2cff26851d1927b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/fa8464691c845d729d506e0fd2cff26851d1927b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171766563?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197","id":171766563,"login":"hector100197","node_id":"U_kgDOCjzzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/23e2902bd6b8beea66ecbea007b45a59606c7e5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T05:46:05Z","email":"jrmv100197@gmail.com","name":"Hector Medel Villar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T05:46:05Z","email":"jrmv100197@gmail.com","name":"Hector Medel Villar"},"message":"Point e2e at simulation-mfe standalone (:4201), not the federated shell\n\nThe shell-app (:4200) loading simulation-mfe as a Native Federation\nremote does not compose under headless CI, so the smoke/batch/report\nspecs (which need the rendered viewer) timed out while only the pure\n:8081 API check passed. simulation-mfe served on its own (:4201)\nrenders the full SimulationComponent — the actual UI validated\nmanually — so the e2e suite keeps its real value (UI + backend +\nkernel + validation badge + report download) without the brittle\nin-CI federation layer. Repoint Playwright baseURL to :4201 and gate\nreadiness on :8081 + :4201.","tree":{"sha":"8e7039586d73dad8cc0b9f954ed058a40a9d4ffe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/git/trees/8e7039586d73dad8cc0b9f954ed058a40a9d4ffe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos