id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197","id":171766563,"login":"hector100197","node_id":"U_kgDOCjzzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/febdc0ff09c76194744a2991c62ded8b07652e33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T05:19:06Z","email":"jrmv100197@gmail.com","name":"Hector Medel Villar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T05:19:06Z","email":"jrmv100197@gmail.com","name":"Hector Medel Villar"},"message":"e2e: drop redundant workflow postgres (port 5433 collided with dev.sh)\n\nThe job declared a ''services: postgres'' on host :5433 while\nscripts/dev.sh also starts its own postgres via docker-compose on the\nsame port, so docker reported ''port is already allocated'', dev.sh\naborted under set -e, no service ever bound :8081, and the readiness\nloop timed out. Remove the workflow-level postgres and let dev.sh own\nthe full stack — this also makes the e2e job exercise the exact\n''make dev'' path documented for users.","tree":{"sha":"71797ee6f3ffe6bfb4ee3be8b453e005a7c236b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/git/trees/71797ee6f3ffe6bfb4ee3be8b453e005a7c236b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/git/commits/febdc0ff09c76194744a2991c62ded8b07652e33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171766563?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197","id":171766563,"login":"hector100197","node_id":"U_kgDOCjzzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197/astro/commit/febdc0ff09c76194744a2991c62ded8b07652e33","node_id":"C_kwDOSgdkWdoAKGZlYmRjMGZmMDljNzYxOTQ3NDRhMjk5MWM2MmRlZDhiMDc2NTJlMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197/astro/commit/0f82ddd63fc499fe53751663151d1c98fa4dcf59","sha":"0f82ddd63fc499fe53751663151d1c98fa4dcf59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/0f82ddd63fc499fe53751663151d1c98fa4dcf59"}],"sha":"febdc0ff09c76194744a2991c62ded8b07652e33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/febdc0ff09c76194744a2991c62ded8b07652e33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171766563?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197","id":171766563,"login":"hector100197","node_id":"U_kgDOCjzzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/0f82ddd63fc499fe53751663151d1c98fa4dcf59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T05:08:30Z","email":"jrmv100197@gmail.com","name":"Hector Medel Villar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T05:08:30Z","email":"jrmv100197@gmail.com","name":"Hector Medel Villar"},"message":"Add shell-app lockfile; make e2e stack-startup robust\n\nfrontends CI failed at setup-node cache because apps/shell-app had no\npackage-lock.json (npm ci + cache need it); generate and commit it.\ne2e failed with ECONNREFUSED :8081 because ''Build services'' used\n''mvn package'' (shared-contracts-SNAPSHOT never reached ~/.m2, so\ndev.sh''s per-module ''spring-boot:run'' could not resolve it) and the\nfixed 30s sleep was far too short for a cold Spring Boot + ng serve\nstart. Switch to ''mvn install'', export ASTRO_KERNEL_LIB for the\nrunning service, and replace the sleep with a health-readiness poll\n(up to 6 min on :8081/actuator/health + :4200).","tree":{"sha":"43888e0aa5cee553debeccac5e55fc7295dc1813","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/git/trees/43888e0aa5cee553debeccac5e55fc7295dc1813"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/git/commits/0f82ddd63fc499fe53751663151d1c98fa4dcf59","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171766563?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197","id":171766563,"login":"hector100197","node_id":"U_kgDOCjzzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197/astro/commit/0f82ddd63fc499fe53751663151d1c98fa4dcf59","node_id":"C_kwDOSgdkWdoAKDBmODJkZGQ2M2ZjNDk5ZmU1Mzc1MTY2MzE1MWQxYzk4ZmE0ZGNmNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197/astro/commit/cb11a14fb0abd026085df24846f118d5eb05f245","sha":"cb11a14fb0abd026085df24846f118d5eb05f245","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/cb11a14fb0abd026085df24846f118d5eb05f245"}],"sha":"0f82ddd63fc499fe53751663151d1c98fa4dcf59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/0f82ddd63fc499fe53751663151d1c98fa4dcf59"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171766563?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197","id":171766563,"login":"hector100197","node_id":"U_kgDOCjzzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/cb11a14fb0abd026085df24846f118d5eb05f245/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T05:01:56Z","email":"jrmv100197@gmail.com","name":"Hector Medel Villar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T05:01:56Z","email":"jrmv100197@gmail.com","name":"Hector Medel Villar"},"message":"Remove incomplete export-mfe stub; consolidate to 2 MFEs\n\nexport-mfe was a non-buildable scaffold (no angular.json/tsconfig/\nmain.ts) that broke the e2e ''Build apps'' step and contradicted the\ndocs'' ''3 MFEs'' claim. Export functionality is fully delivered by the\nsimulation-mfe batch drawer (PDF/HDF5/JSON/LaTeX downloads) plus the\nexport-service backend, so no user-facing capability is lost. Delete\napps/export-mfe, drop its shell route/nav/federation entry, remove it\nfrom the e2e/frontends workflows and dev scripts, and update README,\nREADME.es, DEVELOPMENT, paper.md, CHANGELOG, architecture.md, the\napps READMEs and ADR-0003 to describe the 2-MFE topology accurately.\nexport-service (backend, :8082) is unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"5a28ab3c3741aa8faf048de9f5d671c64721ff1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/git/trees/5a28ab3c3741aa8faf048de9f5d671c64721ff1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/git/commits/cb11a14fb0abd026085df24846f118d5eb05f245","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171766563?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197","id":171766563,"login":"hector100197","node_id":"U_kgDOCjzzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197/astro/commit/cb11a14fb0abd026085df24846f118d5eb05f245","node_id":"C_kwDOSgdkWdoAKGNiMTFhMTRmYjBhYmQwMjYwODVkZjI0ODQ2ZjExOGQ1ZWIwNWYyNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197/astro/commit/311011cc5ea796f63da63a8cb74b435f41e7ef2c","sha":"311011cc5ea796f63da63a8cb74b435f41e7ef2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/311011cc5ea796f63da63a8cb74b435f41e7ef2c"}],"sha":"cb11a14fb0abd026085df24846f118d5eb05f245","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/cb11a14fb0abd026085df24846f118d5eb05f245"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171766563?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hector100197","id":171766563,"login":"hector100197","node_id":"U_kgDOCjzzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hector100197","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/commits/311011cc5ea796f63da63a8cb74b435f41e7ef2c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T04:50:19Z","email":"jrmv100197@gmail.com","name":"Hector Medel Villar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T04:50:19Z","email":"jrmv100197@gmail.com","name":"Hector Medel Villar"},"message":"Fix link order so HDF5 is retained on GNU ld (the real CI root cause)\n\nldd on the Linux CI artifact showed libnbody.so had NO libhdf5\ndependency at all: the Makefile passed -lhdf5_fortran -lhdf5 BEFORE the\nobject files, so GNU ld''s default --as-needed dropped them (no\nundefined refs seen yet at that point). The resulting HDF5-less .so\nfailed to dlopen via the JVM FFM API in PhysicsValidationTest. macOS\nld64 is lenient, masking this locally. Move $(LDFLAGS) after the\nobjects. Verified on macOS: otool -L shows libhdf5 linked and the\nkernel loads + runs correctly. Also drop the temporary services CI\ndiagnostic now that the cause is confirmed.","tree":{"sha":"3d37e6d87e3d22888f34a0ab94cd303234f72f64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/git/trees/3d37e6d87e3d22888f34a0ab94cd303234f72f64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hector100197/astro/git/commits/311011cc5ea796f63da63a8cb74b435f41e7ef2c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171766563?v=4","events_url":"https://a