?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gust2050308","id":168861989,"login":"gust2050308","node_id":"U_kgDOChChJQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/3bf7495145752908566af45d05ed87a842c67aa3","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKDNiZjc0OTUxNDU3NTI5MDg1NjZhZjQ1ZDA1ZWQ4N2E4NDJjNjdhYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/afbb8b69146bfda370952a5091282f747920b0b4","sha":"afbb8b69146bfda370952a5091282f747920b0b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/afbb8b69146bfda370952a5091282f747920b0b4"}],"sha":"3bf7495145752908566af45d05ed87a842c67aa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/3bf7495145752908566af45d05ed87a842c67aa3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168861989?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gust2050308","id":168861989,"login":"gust2050308","node_id":"U_kgDOChChJQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/afbb8b69146bfda370952a5091282f747920b0b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T22:15:34Z","email":"gust20503@gmail.com","name":"gust2050308"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T22:15:34Z","email":"gust20503@gmail.com","name":"gust2050308"},"message":"refactor(ui): extrae el design system a libs/ui y agrega el contrato de anfitrión\n\nLos componentes vivían en apps/frontend/src/components/ui, dentro del shell de\nNext. Un remote federado no puede importarlos de ahí, así que cualquier\nmicrofrontend acababa duplicando el design system y divergiendo — que es\njustamente lo que les pasó a catalog-mf y purchasing-mf.\n\nSe mueven 29 componentes + data-table + illustrations a libs/ui, junto con los\nhelpers de los que dependen (cn, normalizarTexto, layout-metrics, module-search,\nuse-click-outside). Las rutas viejas quedan como reexports: ninguna de las 45\nfeatures cambia un import.\n\nlibs/ui estrena package.json porque ahora tiene dependencias reales (React,\nRadix, cva, tanstack-table). Sin él, TypeScript no resolvía @types/react desde\nlibs/ y los props degradaban a any. No entra ningún paquete nuevo al repo: son\nlas versiones que apps/frontend ya tenía bloqueadas.\n\nNace libs/ui/src/host: el design system necesita saber de la sesión (la tabla\noculta columnas por privilegio) pero no puede importar el store de auth sin\natarse al shell. El anfitrión inyecta `can`; sin proveedor se falla CERRADO,\nporque no poder verificar un permiso no es tenerlo.\n\npermission-codes pasa a libs/contracts para compartirlo con remotes y backend.\n\nTailwind: se agrega libs/ui al glob `content`. Sin esa ruta las clases de los\ncomponentes movidos se purgaban y salían sin estilo — tsc y next build pasan\nigual, el fallo solo se ve en pantalla.\n\nVerificado: tsc --noEmit limpio y next build completo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a15c0c3fb7d447b3a0c76e4b9ecfe22510bda9ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/a15c0c3fb7d447b3a0c76e4b9ecfe22510bda9ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/afbb8b69146bfda370952a5091282f747920b0b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168861989?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gust2050308","id":168861989,"login":"gust2050308","node_id":"U_kgDOChChJQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/afbb8b69146bfda370952a5091282f747920b0b4","node_id":"