tarred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/a513c30689a7c6e45f2c76d4c9ebf23886d94b95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:12:11Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:12:11Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"fix(frontend): refresca el expediente al facturar y al recibir\n\nRegistrar una factura invalidaba solo la consulta de facturas, y la recepción la\nsuya. Pero las dos aparecen ahora en la cadena del expediente, que se quedaba\nmostrando el estado anterior hasta que alguien recargaba la página: el acta se\nguardaba y la pantalla seguía diciendo que no había ninguna.","tree":{"sha":"4ce536e7f7c798ccd1042c6c9df5fd68fa7ab917","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/4ce536e7f7c798ccd1042c6c9df5fd68fa7ab917"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/a513c30689a7c6e45f2c76d4c9ebf23886d94b95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/a513c30689a7c6e45f2c76d4c9ebf23886d94b95","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKGE1MTNjMzA2ODlhN2M2ZTQ1ZjJjNzZkNGM5ZWJmMjM4ODZkOTRiOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/98ed2b590fb143634a6508a3e75ce6c96d232cc0","sha":"98ed2b590fb143634a6508a3e75ce6c96d232cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/98ed2b590fb143634a6508a3e75ce6c96d232cc0"}],"sha":"a513c30689a7c6e45f2c76d4c9ebf23886d94b95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/a513c30689a7c6e45f2c76d4c9ebf23886d94b95"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/98ed2b590fb143634a6508a3e75ce6c96d232cc0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:12:11Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:12:11Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(frontend): expone las filas marcadas de la DataTable\n\nLa selección existía —`enableRowSelection` pinta las casillas— pero se quedaba\ndentro del componente, así que no se podía hacer nada con lo marcado. Marcar sin\npoder actuar es un control que promete algo que no ocurre.\n\nSe avisa con las FILAS y no con los ids: quien actúa sobre lo marcado casi\nsiempre necesita el objeto —una etiqueta que enseñar, un estado que comprobar— y\nvolver a buscarlos en `data` desde fuera sería recorrer la lista dos veces.\n\nEs lo que permite el acta de resguardo en lote del módulo de patrimonio.","tree":{"sha":"d84d67b5f0254c163cf1f5de29280ef74b270cb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/d84d67b5f0254c163cf1f5de29280ef74b270cb4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/98ed2b590fb143634a6508a3e75ce6c96d232cc0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/98ed2b590fb143634a6508a3e75ce6c96d232cc0","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKDk4ZWQyYjU5MGZiMTQzNjM0YTY1MDhhM2U3NWNlNmM5NmQyMzJjYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/a999da94908d54e11b4ee9589621211a70964dc1","sha":"a999da94908d54e11b4ee9589621211a70964dc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/a999da94908d54e11b4ee9589621211a70964dc1"}],"sha":"98ed2b590fb143634a6508a3e75ce6c96d232cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/98ed2b590fb143634a6508a3e75ce6c96d232cc0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/a999da94908d54e11b4ee9589621211a70964dc1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:11:53Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:11:53Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(purchase-orders): abre directamente la orden que trae el enlace\n\nLa ruta `/purchase-orders?orden=<id>` la emiten tres sitios —los avisos del\nbackend, la cadena del expediente y la propia generación de la orden— y la\npantalla no la leía: todos aterrizaban en la lista entera y el usuario tenía que\nbuscar a mano la orden que el sistema acababa de nombrarle.\n\nLa decisión de a cuál abrir vive fuera del componente porque tiene dos reglas que\nse equivocan en silencio y no se ven mirando la pantalla, así que van con su\nprueba: un id que no está en la lista no debe abrir la primera —parecería que el\nenlace funcionó y llevó a otra— y el parámetro se consume una sola vez, o\ncerrarla la volvería a abrir sola.","tree":{"sha":"93563b0f5bf3cf8b6d4b0f1cc11a27c8803583ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/93563b0f5bf3cf8b6d4b0f1cc11a27c8803583ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/a999da94908d54e11b4ee9589621211a70964dc1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/a999da94908d54e11b4ee9589621211a70964dc1","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKGE5OTlkYTk0OTA4ZDU0ZTExYjRlZTk1ODk2MjEyMTFhNzA5NjRkYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/a6e7f75ce3203bc0a65d5772205222f00b014859","sha":"a6e7f75ce3203bc0a65d5772205222f00b014859","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/a6e7f75ce3203bc0a65d5772205222f00b014859"}],"sha":"a999da94908d54e11b4ee9589621211a70964dc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/a999da94908d54e11b4ee9589621211a70964dc1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/a6e7f75ce3203bc0a65d5772205222f00b014859/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:11:42Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:11:42Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(quotations): avisa también cuando el proveedor sostiene su precio\n\nSostener la oferta ante una petición de mejora es una respuesta legítima —si la\núnica salida fuera bajar, esto no sería una negociación sino una presión— pero\nnadie se enteraba de que había ocurrido: la ronda se cerraba en la base y en el\nlado del comprador no cambiaba nada visible, así que la cotización parecía seguir\nesperando respuesta.\n\nCon esto, las dos formas de contestar a una revisión avisan a Compras.\n\nLa cuenta de rondas deja de mezclar los dos casos: sostener NO avanza la ronda\n—no hay precio nuevo— pero sí la cierra, que es lo que la saca de «esperando».","tree":{"sha":"51a476a1b5f49080d1d25985a22d719e83087a0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/51a476a1b5f49080d1d25985a22d719e83087a0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/a6e7f75ce3203bc0a65d5772205222f00b014859","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/a6e7f75ce3203bc0a65d5772205222f00b014859","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKGE2ZTdmNzVjZTMyMDNiYzBhNjVkNTc3MjIwNTIyMmYwMGIwMTQ4NTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/7350e0ea1b77cff600517603d53ff9fd67591e29","sha":"7350e0ea1b77cff600517603d53ff9fd67591e29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/7350e0ea1b77cff600517603d53ff9fd67591e29"}],"sha":"a6e7f75ce3203bc0a65d5772205222f00b014859","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/a6e7f75ce3203bc0a65d5772205222f00b014859"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/7350e0ea1b77cff600517603d53ff9fd67591e29/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:11:32Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:11:32Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"fix(api-gateway): exige privilegio en todas las rutas de cotizaciones\n\nEl módulo entero estaba sin `@RequirePermission` mientras sus vecinos\n—solicitudes, órdenes, abastecimiento— sí lo declaraban. Cualquier usuario\nautenticado del tenant podía adjudicarle una compra a un proveedor por API: con\nun `curl` bastaba.\n\nLo que disimulaba el agujero es que el frontend SÍ escondía los botones con\n`quotation:compare`. La pantalla parecía cerrada y la puerta estaba abierta, que\nes la forma más difícil de detectar este fallo: nadie lo ve usando el sistema.\n\nEl reparto es el MISMO que ya aplicaba la interfaz, para que autorizar no\nsignifique una cosa en la pantalla y otra en el servidor:\n\n  · quotation:request  — pedirle precio a proveedores\n  · quotation:compare  — comparar, negociar y ADJUDICAR, porque elegir ganador\n    es el acto final de comparar y no una operación administrativa aparte\n  · quotation:register — capturar lo recibido, descartarlo y vencerlo\n\nLa prueba que se añade no comprueba comportamiento sino COBERTURA: recorre los\nmétodos del controlador y falla si alguno no declara privilegio. Una prueba por\nruta habría dejado sin cubrir justo la que alguien añada mañana.","tree":{"sha":"e0991e19173d532679d71cb22fc087748d8b2b81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/e0991e19173d532679d71cb22fc087748d8b2b81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/7350e0ea1b77cff600517603d53ff9fd67591e29","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/7350e0ea1b77cff600517603d53ff9fd67591e29","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKDczNTBlMGVhMWI3N2NmZjYwMDUxNzYwM2Q1M2ZmOWZkNjc1OTFlMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/e047b0848177ee3b0f3b9f39b8ddf2f6c5d22668","sha":"e047b0848177ee3b0f3b9f39b8ddf2f6c5d22668","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/e047b0848177ee3b0f3b9f39b8ddf2f6c5d22668"}],"sha":"7350e0ea1b77cff600517603d53ff9fd67591e29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/7350e0ea1b77cff600517603d53ff9fd67591e29"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/e047b0848177ee3b0f3b9f39b8ddf2f6c5d22668/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:10:53Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:10:53Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(requests): reúne la compra entera en el expediente\n\nEl expediente se acababa en la solicitud. Sus cotizaciones, sus órdenes, sus\nactas de recepción y sus pagos existían y estaban encadenados en la base\n—purchase_request_id → purchase_order_id → reception_id → invoice_id— pero nadie\nrecorría esa cadena. Seguir una compra obligaba a abrir cuatro módulos, buscar el\nfolio a mano en cada uno y volver atrás cada vez que se perdía el hilo.\n\n`purchase_requests.dossier` la recorre entera de una vez y la pantalla la pinta\ncomo lo que es: una historia con un orden.\n\nSustituye a «Actividades vinculadas», que leía `request.linked` — un arreglo\ncableado a `[]` en el adaptador desde el primer día. La sección llevaba meses\ndiciendo «aún no hay cotizaciones ni órdenes vinculadas» a expedientes que tenían\nlas dos, y rematando con un «pídelas en el módulo de Cotizaciones»: la propia\npantalla mandaba al usuario a buscar fuera lo que le tocaba enseñar.","tree":{"sha":"ac8703bdad39eb754d93e9bebb293a5ac34d66ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/ac8703bdad39eb754d93e9bebb293a5ac34d66ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/e047b0848177ee3b0f3b9f39b8ddf2f6c5d22668","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/e047b0848177ee3b0f3b9f39b8ddf2f6c5d22668","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKGUwNDdiMDg0ODE3N2VlM2IwZjNiOWYzOWI4ZGRmMmY2YzVkMjI2Njg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/dc36f3742721b00f7e4bb6ef989806f4fa655930","sha":"dc36f3742721b00f7e4bb6ef989806f4fa655930","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/dc36f3742721b00f7e4bb6ef989806f4fa655930"}],"sha":"e047b0848177ee3b0f3b9f39b8ddf2f6c5d22668","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/e047b0848177ee3b0f3b9f39b8ddf2f6c5d22668"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/dc36f3742721b00f7e4bb6ef989806f4fa655930/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:10:41Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:10:41Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(fulfillment): permite cambiar la vía con la que se cubre una línea\n\nEl motor reparte la necesidad agotando primero lo que ya existe dentro —almacén\ncentral, luego áreas con excedente— y comprando solo el resto. La regla es\ncorrecta: comprar teniendo es el gasto que nadie sabe explicar después.\n\nPero se aplicaba como si fuera la única verdad posible. Si el almacén cubría la\nlínea entera, la vía de compra NO NACÍA y no había forma de volver atrás: daba\nigual que el traspaso llevara semanas parado, que el área de origen se negara, o\nque quien pide necesitara material nuevo y no uno de segunda mano. Había que\ncancelar el expediente y volver a empezar.\n\nAhora la decisión se puede revertir en los dos sentidos, y siempre deja rastro\nde quién la cambió: la regla sigue siendo la que propone, pero deja de ser la que\nmanda.","tree":{"sha":"dbe6eb1adf26b862e1df3922ccc18510ed1ed632","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/dbe6eb1adf26b862e1df3922ccc18510ed1ed632"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/dc36f3742721b00f7e4bb6ef989806f4fa655930","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/dc36f3742721b00f7e4bb6ef989806f4fa655930","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKGRjMzZmMzc0MjcyMWIwMGY3ZTRiYjZlZjk4OTgwNmY0ZmE2NTU5MzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/420d38e274b612cc55fbf3d2dbdd727e541972e0","sha":"420d38e274b612cc55fbf3d2dbdd727e541972e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/420d38e274b612cc55fbf3d2dbdd727e541972e0"}],"sha":"dc36f3742721b00f7e4bb6ef989806f4fa655930","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/dc36f3742721b00f7e4bb6ef989806f4fa655930"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/420d38e274b612cc55fbf3d2dbdd727e541972e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:10:28Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:10:28Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(stock): sustituye las cifras de relleno por el pulso real del inventario\n\nEl módulo enseñaba dos números que no cambian lo que nadie va a hacer hoy:\ncuántas transferencias hay registradas en total —que solo crece— y cuántos\nproductos tiene mi área, que dice que hay filas, no si falta algo.\n\n`stock.summary` responde lo que un inventario tiene que responder: qué está por\ndebajo del mínimo, qué se ha movido, y de qué no queda nada. Se calcula en el\nservidor por el mismo motivo que en patrimonio: sobre la página descargada, la\nrespuesta sería siempre incompleta y parecería correcta.\n\nLa nota de patrimonio por área explica en la propia pantalla por qué un producto\nque se cuenta por unidad no aparece en las existencias: no es que falte, es que\nvive en el otro libro.","tree":{"sha":"bcd6cc24bf0abc83940306574b7e31779dc75d37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/bcd6cc24bf0abc83940306574b7e31779dc75d37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/420d38e274b612cc55fbf3d2dbdd727e541972e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/420d38e274b612cc55fbf3d2dbdd727e541972e0","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKDQyMGQzOGUyNzRiNjEyY2M1NWZiZjNkMmRiZGQ3MjdlNTQxOTcyZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/171628fbc011ed1832a72e3878987426a3364247","sha":"171628fbc011ed1832a72e3878987426a3364247","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/171628fbc011ed1832a72e3878987426a3364247"}],"sha":"420d38e274b612cc55fbf3d2dbdd727e541972e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/420d38e274b612cc55fbf3d2dbdd727e541972e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/171628fbc011ed1832a72e3878987426a3364247/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:10:17Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:10:17Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(assets): cuenta el patrimonio por situación y firma el resguardo en lote\n\nLa pantalla enseñaba «Bienes: 128» y «En pantalla: 50». La segunda no es un\ndato: es el tamaño de la página, y con ella no se decide nada. Lo que faltaba\n—y el propio módulo lo pedía en un comentario— era contar por SITUACIÓN, y eso\nno se puede hacer en el navegador: contar sobre la página descargada da siempre\nun número menor que el real sin que nada avise de que está mal.\n\n`assets.summary` lo resuelve en el servidor, junto con la carga por resguardante:\nquién responde por cuántos bienes, que es la pregunta que se hace antes de\nasignar uno más.\n\nSe añade el acta de resguardo sobre VARIOS bienes a la vez. Asignar de uno en uno\nno era solo lento: cada asignación generaba su propio asiento, así que entregar\nquince equipos a una persona dejaba quince actas sueltas en vez de una entrega.","tree":{"sha":"ade4ba294f5d738ffcd0be93f849c903bb7fee30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/ade4ba294f5d738ffcd0be93f849c903bb7fee30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/171628fbc011ed1832a72e3878987426a3364247","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/171628fbc011ed1832a72e3878987426a3364247","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKDE3MTYyOGZiYzAxMWVkMTgzMmE3MmUzODc4OTg3NDI2YTMzNjQyNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/f7e8f07c1d12cd35dc4f86dd268a8e6b1b54b6aa","sha":"f7e8f07c1d12cd35dc4f86dd268a8e6b1b54b6aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/f7e8f07c1d12cd35dc4f86dd268a8e6b1b54b6aa"}],"sha":"171628fbc011ed1832a72e3878987426a3364247","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/171628fbc011ed1832a72e3878987426a3364247"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/f7e8f07c1d12cd35dc4f86dd268a8e6b1b54b6aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:10:05Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:10:05Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(catalog): permite elegir si un producto se cuenta por cantidad o por unidad\n\n`trackingMode` existía en el modelo y en ninguna pantalla, así que todo producto\nnacía como consumible: los únicos bienes patrimoniales del catálogo habían\nentrado por semilla. Quien miraba Inventario y Patrimonio veía cifras que no\ncuadraban y nada explicaba por qué.\n\nEs la decisión que separa un consumible de un bien inventariable y la que decide\nen cuál de los dos libros vivirá el producto para siempre, así que no se pinta\ncomo un desplegable más de la ficha: son dos tarjetas que enseñan las\nconsecuencias —quién responde por él, si lleva etiqueta, si se puede dar de\nbaja— antes de elegir. Un `<select>` con «Cantidad / Unidad» obligaría a saberse\nde memoria lo que implica cada uno.\n\nObligatorio en el formulario aunque el DTO lo admita ausente: dejar que el valor\npor omisión decida en silencio es exactamente lo que llenó el catálogo de\nconsumibles.\n\nEl backend rechaza cambiarlo cuando el producto ya tiene existencias, bienes o\nmovimientos — lo ya contado tendría que migrar de libro, y eso no es editar un\ncampo.","tree":{"sha":"ce9bba4a39ef2f755be2d95dc91902504b5a8814","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/ce9bba4a39ef2f755be2d95dc91902504b5a8814"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/f7e8f07c1d12cd35dc4f86dd268a8e6b1b54b6aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/f7e8f07c1d12cd35dc4f86dd268a8e6b1b54b6aa","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKGY3ZThmMDdjMWQxMmNkMzVkYzRmODZkZDI2OGE4ZTZiMWI1NGI2YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/4ba82ed5766ea037ec5dba297cf6974b6605c31b","sha":"4ba82ed5766ea037ec5dba297cf6974b6605c31b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/4ba82ed5766ea037ec5dba297cf6974b6605c31b"}],"sha":"f7e8f07c1d12cd35dc4f86dd268a8e6b1b54b6aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/f7e8f07c1d12cd35dc4f86dd268a8e6b1b54b6aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/4ba82ed5766ea037ec5dba297cf6974b6605c31b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:09:50Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T21:09:50Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"fix(auth): normaliza el correo para que el login no distinga mayúsculas\n\n`login()` busca al usuario con `findUnique({ where: { email } })`, que compara\nde forma EXACTA. Así, `Admin@sapoc.mx` y `admin@sapoc.mx` eran dos personas\ndistintas para el sistema: la primera no existía y la respuesta era\n«Credenciales inválidas», sin nada que insinuara que el problema era una letra.\n\nNo es un caso rebuscado: el teclado de un móvil pone mayúscula inicial por su\ncuenta y varios gestores de contraseñas guardan el correo tal como se escribió\nla primera vez.\n\nSe normaliza en el DTO —con un decorador propio, reutilizable en registro y\nlogin— y no en el use-case, para que la forma del dato quede garantizada antes de\nllegar a la consulta. El frontend lo hace también al enviar, que es lo que evita\nel viaje de ida y vuelta por un error que se puede corregir escribiendo.","tree":{"sha":"de70861994615d26491de15ffc33a5b5a0c84b53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/de70861994615d26491de15ffc33a5b5a0c84b53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/4ba82ed5766ea037ec5dba297cf6974b6605c31b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"h