7@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"chore(deploy): añade el empaquetado Docker y el pipeline de despliegue\n\nUn Dockerfile multietapa compartido por los servicios NestJS y otro para el\nfrontend. Sin `.dockerignore` el contexto de build son ~2 GB (node_modules de 7\napps + .next + .nx) que se suben al daemon antes de la primera capa.\n\nGitHub Actions y no CodePipeline: el repo ya vive en GitHub, `nx affected`\nnecesita el historial de git —que aquí está sin exportarlo a un artefacto— y el\ncoste es cero. CodePipeline exigiría una fuente CodeStar, un CodeBuild por\nproyecto y ~$1/mes de pipeline para lo mismo con más piezas que operar.\n\nEl rol de AWS se asume por OIDC: no hay AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID en ningún secreto del\nrepositorio, ni credenciales dentro de las imágenes.","tree":{"sha":"5037f362090936ca314a30cc47379b74fe064d48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/5037f362090936ca314a30cc47379b74fe064d48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/20fc8885dd964e74717401c7e4e8bf3d71477283","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/20fc8885dd964e74717401c7e4e8bf3d71477283","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKDIwZmM4ODg1ZGQ5NjRlNzQ3MTc0MDFjN2U0ZThiZjNkNzE0NzcyODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/09481dc21114a42bac0eb717d5dd3d1e438ecdb9","sha":"09481dc21114a42bac0eb717d5dd3d1e438ecdb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/09481dc21114a42bac0eb717d5dd3d1e438ecdb9"}],"sha":"20fc8885dd964e74717401c7e4e8bf3d71477283","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/20fc8885dd964e74717401c7e4e8bf3d71477283"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/09481dc21114a42bac0eb717d5dd3d1e438ecdb9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T03:03:19Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T03:03:19Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(frontend): unifica las burbujas de chat en un componente único\n\nLos dos hilos —expediente y proveedor↔tenant— pintaban su propia burbuja con la\nmisma estructura y detalles distintos: el ajeno era `bg-card` con filete en uno y\n`bg-muted` sin filete en el otro. Ahora la forma vive en `ui/chat-bubble` y cada\nhilo solo pone su contenido (cita, adjuntos, botón de responder). El widget\nflotante lo hereda: ya reusaba MessagesContent.\n\nTres decisiones del diseño nuevo:\n- Nombre y hora comparten renglón encima del globo. Eso libera el pie para el\n  estado de entrega, que antes se colaba delante de la hora (\"Enviado · 12:45\")\n  y se leía como un solo dato partido.\n- Las dos burbujas son del mismo tono. El lado y el avatar ya dicen quién habla;\n  el `bg-primary` propio convertía media conversación en un bloque saturado y\n  arrastraba el texto a `primary-foreground`, con menos contraste que el normal.\n- La cola pasa de la esquina de arriba a la de abajo, apuntando al avatar, y solo\n  en el ÚLTIMO mensaje del turno — antes se cuadraba en el primero. Por eso ambos\n  hilos calculan ahora `lastOfGroup` mirando el mensaje siguiente.\n\nSe suma la ficha de la contraparte (`counterpart-file`), que cruza por `tenantId`\nlas cotizaciones abiertas con la conversación.","tree":{"sha":"3b124578adfa8a3fabf84b42f9a7b48b06f46f08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/3b124578adfa8a3fabf84b42f9a7b48b06f46f08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/09481dc21114a42bac0eb717d5dd3d1e438ecdb9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/09481dc21114a42bac0eb717d5dd3d1e438ecdb9","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKDA5NDgxZGMyMTExNGE0MmJhYzBlYjcxN2Q1ZGQzZDFlNDM4ZWNkYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/a75fbfa9a8450e455f861bfb9b8c7f38b3c89744","sha":"a75fbfa9a8450e455f861bfb9b8c7f38b3c89744","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/a75fbfa9a8450e455f861bfb9b8c7f38b3c89744"}],"sha":"09481dc21114a42bac0eb717d5dd3d1e438ecdb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/09481dc21114a42bac0eb717d5dd3d1e438ecdb9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/a75fbfa9a8450e455f861bfb9b8c7f38b3c89744/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T03:03:03Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T03:03:03Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(core-service): expone el tenantId en la cotización del proveedor\n\nLa proyección solo traía `tenantName`, y quien la consume necesita CRUZARLA con\notra cosa: la ficha de la contraparte en el chat empareja las cotizaciones con la\nconversación abierta. Emparejar por nombre es exacto solo hasta que dos tenants\nse llamen parecido.\n\nEl nombre se queda para leer; el id es para comparar.","tree":{"sha":"6629acf983668e40bbc85cdd92b8b81106cc8882","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/6629acf983668e40bbc85cdd92b8b81106cc8882"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/a75fbfa9a8450e455f861bfb9b8c7f38b3c89744","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/a75fbfa9a8450e455f861bfb9b8c7f38b3c89744","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKGE3NWZiZmE5YTg0NTBlNDU1Zjg2MWJmYjliOGM3ZjM4YjNjODk3NDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/da91f459f5366c2b4951df61806100f5ba208cca","sha":"da91f459f5366c2b4951df61806100f5ba208cca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/da91f459f5366c2b4951df61806100f5ba208cca"}],"sha":"a75fbfa9a8450e455f861bfb9b8c7f38b3c89744","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/a75fbfa9a8450e455f861bfb9b8c7f38b3c89744"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/da91f459f5366c2b4951df61806100f5ba208cca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T03:02:51Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T03:02:51Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"refactor(frontend): adapta los módulos a las franjas de resumen y la tabla nueva\n\nLos 30 módulos pasan de ModuleStat a ModuleSummaryRow con ModuleMetricItem, y\nlas fábricas de columnas se acogen a la vista de tarjetas y los filtros por\nfaceta de la DataTable.\n\nEl cambio de fondo no es cosmético: la franja de resumen deja de ser una tira de\ncifras sueltas y pasa a nombrar el HUECO de cada módulo —lo que está atascado y\npor qué—, así que cada uno tuvo que decidir cuál es su atasco. En proveedores,\npor ejemplo, no es de tiempo sino de ficha incompleta: los tres datos sin los\ncuales no se le puede pedir una cotización ni emitirle una orden.","tree":{"sha":"6a2aef98298152f0e22fabf484a91368b9373fa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/6a2aef98298152f0e22fabf484a91368b9373fa8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/da91f459f5366c2b4951df61806100f5ba208cca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/da91f459f5366c2b4951df61806100f5ba208cca","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKGRhOTFmNDU5ZjUzNjZjMmI0OTUxZGY2MTgwNjEwMGY1YmEyMDhjY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/59bdb978839723671d5080e2333d48e152da4125","sha":"59bdb978839723671d5080e2333d48e152da4125","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/59bdb978839723671d5080e2333d48e152da4125"}],"sha":"da91f459f5366c2b4951df61806100f5ba208cca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/da91f459f5366c2b4951df61806100f5ba208cca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/59bdb978839723671d5080e2333d48e152da4125/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T03:02:07Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T03:02:35Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(frontend): mueve el cromo del shell a una barra superior\n\nEl shell pasa de una sola columna de herramienta a una «L»: la lateral se queda\ncon marca y módulos, y el cromo —buscador, refresco, avisos y cuenta— sube a una\nbarra superior que corona solo la columna de contenido.\n\nEn la lateral, el buscador tenía 224px contados y competía por altura con la\nlista de módulos; arriba puede respirar hasta su tope y cede sitio a los\ncontroles. Los tres planos (tenant, plataforma, proveedor) comparten la misma\nanatomía a través de `topbar-shell`, igual que ya la compartían por\n`sidebar-shell`.\n\n`lib/module-search` extrae el índice de búsqueda de módulos, que antes vivía\ndentro de la lateral y ahora consumen las tres barras.","tree":{"sha":"37a6caaa92312d471f2fbdc9ffb1d69684f762be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/37a6caaa92312d471f2fbdc9ffb1d69684f762be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/59bdb978839723671d5080e2333d48e152da4125","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organization