":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/9a408f7cd9044d30971e8119b59a48afbf3d4569/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T03:01:52Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T03:01:52Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(frontend): añade vista de tarjetas y filtros a la DataTable\n\nLa tabla gana una vista alterna en tarjetas (`data-table-cards`) para los anchos\ndonde una rejilla de columnas ya no cabe sin partir palabras, y la barra de\nherramientas gana filtros por faceta además de la búsqueda. La paginación y el\nesqueleto adoptan la métrica de banda de `lib/layout-metrics`, que es lo que\nhace que su borde caiga sobre el de la tabla de encima.\n\nLa preferencia de vista se persiste junto al resto del estado por `tableId`.","tree":{"sha":"8138e532397e2061edd331f733dc3a838a30dece","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/8138e532397e2061edd331f733dc3a838a30dece"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/9a408f7cd9044d30971e8119b59a48afbf3d4569","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/9a408f7cd9044d30971e8119b59a48afbf3d4569","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKDlhNDA4ZjdjZDkwNDRkMzA5NzFlODExOWI1OWE0OGFmYmYzZDQ1Njk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/c2567999cf805c363405c78d5268d4b4ef376bdd","sha":"c2567999cf805c363405c78d5268d4b4ef376bdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/c2567999cf805c363405c78d5268d4b4ef376bdd"}],"sha":"9a408f7cd9044d30971e8119b59a48afbf3d4569","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/9a408f7cd9044d30971e8119b59a48afbf3d4569"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/c2567999cf805c363405c78d5268d4b4ef376bdd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T03:01:41Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T03:01:41Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"refactor(frontend): rehace las secciones de módulo sobre la métrica única\n\nModuleStat desaparece en favor de ModuleSummaryRow con ModuleMetricItem: la\nfranja de resumen pasa a ser una banda de control más una rejilla de tarjetas,\nsin lámina de fondo propia. Los esqueletos y el envoltorio de página siguen la\nmisma métrica para que el hueco de carga ocupe exactamente lo que ocupará el\ncontenido.\n\nTodos los paddings salen ya de `lib/layout-metrics`; ninguno se escribe a mano.","tree":{"sha":"994d720476c70babe7fd999e094353c5e22365d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/994d720476c70babe7fd999e094353c5e22365d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/c2567999cf805c363405c78d5268d4b4ef376bdd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/c2567999cf805c363405c78d5268d4b4ef376bdd","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKGMyNTY3OTk5Y2Y4MDVjMzYzNDA1Yzc4ZDUyNjhkNGI0ZWYzNzZiZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/e14fc07f945aaae2fe4ffd3a9d54abfc4d8529d2","sha":"e14fc07f945aaae2fe4ffd3a9d54abfc4d8529d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/e14fc07f945aaae2fe4ffd3a9d54abfc4d8529d2"}],"sha":"c2567999cf805c363405c78d5268d4b4ef376bdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/c2567999cf805c363405c78d5268d4b4ef376bdd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/e14fc07f945aaae2fe4ffd3a9d54abfc4d8529d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T03:01:28Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T03:01:28Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(frontend): centraliza la métrica del layout de módulo\n\nConvivían cinco escalas para el mismo trabajo —`p-5` en el cuerpo del deck,\n`px-5 py-4` en la franja de resumen, `px-4 py-2.5` en la cabecera de sección,\n`px-4 py-2` en el contenedor de lista y `px-3 py-1.5` en la paginación—. Nadie\nlas había decidido juntas, así que dos bandas contiguas no alineaban y el borde\nde una tabla no caía sobre el de la tarjeta de encima.\n\nAhora el ritmo vive en un solo sitio y se IMPORTA: PANEL, PANEL_PAD, BAND_PAD,\nBAND_SURFACE y compañía. Va en `lib/` y no en `shell/layout/` a propósito — la\nDataTable de `components/ui/` también las consume, y hacer que un componente de\nUI importe del shell sería invertir las capas.","tree":{"sha":"7eeb09fae93c2df8852fcd1083d3434c703d346a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/7eeb09fae93c2df8852fcd1083d3434c703d346a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/e14fc07f945aaae2fe4ffd3a9d54abfc4d8529d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/e14fc07f945aaae2fe4ffd3a9d54abfc4d8529d2","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKGUxNGZjMDdmOTQ1YWFhZTJmZTRmZmQzYTlkNTRhYmZjNGQ4NTI5ZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/56684d76f277ef176f0bc6bbeb29c521c28f97bc","sha":"56684d76f277ef176f0bc6bbeb29c521c28f97bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/56684d76f277ef176f0bc6bbeb29c521c28f97bc"}],"sha":"e14fc07f945aaae2fe4ffd3a9d54abfc4d8529d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/e14fc07f945aaae2fe4ffd3a9d54abfc4d8529d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/56684d76f277ef176f0bc6bbeb29c521c28f97bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T03:01:15Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T03:01:15Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"style(frontend): quita las versalitas de los mockups de la landing\n\nLos rótulos de los mockups usaban `uppercase tracking-wide`, el mismo lenguaje\nde versalitas que ya se descartó para el resto del sistema. Se quedan como\ntexto normal atenuado: siguen leyéndose como antetítulo por tamaño y color,\nsin el aire de plantilla corporativa.","tree":{"sha":"5928bb3d31919e8ae6fb001ee06e3fb8a8b0576c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/5928bb3d31919e8ae6fb001ee06e3fb8a8b0576c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/56684d76f277ef176f0bc6bbeb29c521c28f97bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/56684d76f277ef176f0bc6bbeb29c521c28f97bc","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKDU2Njg0ZDc2ZjI3N2VmMTc2ZjBiYzZiYmViMjljNTIxYzI4Zjk3YmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/025a033dea4ac9396a538bd1e4e444a77ac731fa","sha":"025a033dea4ac9396a538bd1e4e444a77ac731fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/025a033dea4ac9396a538bd1e4e444a77ac731fa"}],"sha":"56684d76f277ef176f0bc6bbeb29c521c28f97bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/56684d76f277ef176f0bc6bbeb29c521c28f97bc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/025a033dea4ac9396a538bd1e4e444a77ac731fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T03:01:02Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T03:01:02Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"style(frontend): sube un escalón el filete de bordes y campos\n\nA 90% de luminosidad (zinc200) el filete casi se perdía sobre `background`:\ntarjetas, tablas y campos flotaban sin contorno. Sube a 80% —un punto por\ndebajo de zinc300— que delimita sin llegar al gris medio de zinc400, que ya\nse leería como trazo y no como filete. Sigue siendo gris neutro: nada de\nbordes de color.\n\nEl filete del panel oscuro sube el mismo escalón (brand900 → entre brand900 y\nbrand800) para no desaparecer contra brand950.\n\nSe toca en `--border`/`--input` y no en cada componente porque todo el sistema\nusa `border-border`/`border-input`. El token de `libs/ui` acompaña al valor\nvivo para que la lámina de Storybook no mienta.","tree":{"sha":"0b18e1a94d74147d5e5b9deb8c4ecc2ba9e0b068","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/0b18e1a94d74147d5e5b9deb8c4ecc2ba9e0b068"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/025a033dea4ac9396a538bd1e4e444a77ac731fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/025a033dea4ac9396a538bd1e4e444a77ac731fa","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKDAyNWEwMzNkZWE0YWM5Mzk2YTUzOGJkMWU0ZTQ0NGE3N2FjNzMxZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/21c8a4a1d9a7e6182de8ea0f784a4895a849bb9f","sha":"21c8a4a1d9a7e6182de8ea0f784a4895a849bb9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/21c8a4a1d9a7e6182de8ea0f784a4895a849bb9f"}],"sha":"025a033dea4ac9396a538bd1e4e444a77ac731fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/025a033dea4ac9396a538bd1e4e444a77ac731fa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/21c8a4a1d9a7e6182de8ea0f784a4895a849bb9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T06:59:05Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T06:59:05Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(frontend): rehace el panel derecho del login y lo vuelve responsivo\n\nEl panel de la derecha era una maraña de siete PNG posicionados a mano en\nporcentajes sobre un SVG de curvas con cuatro trazos superpuestos y dos\ndegradados. No escalaba —el split 45/55 estaba fijo, así que en una pantalla\nangosta el formulario se quedaba sin ancho— y los degradados iban en contra\ndel lenguaje visual del resto del sistema.\n\nEn su lugar: una sola lámina tematizada sobre retícula plana, y debajo una\ncard que invita a postularse como proveedor, que es la única acción que un\nvisitante sin cuenta puede hacer desde aquí.\n\nEl split ahora arranca en `lg`; por debajo el formulario ocupa la pantalla\ncompleta y el escenario —decorativo— se oculta. El tema oscuro se acota al\npanel del formulario para que la lámina use los tokens `--illus-*` claros.","tree":{"sha":"da904d8c51472f47b793897faae6b615ee788da6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/da904d8c51472f47b793897faae6b615ee788da6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/21c8a4a1d9a7e6182de8ea0f784a4895a849bb9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/21c8a4a1d9a7e6182de8ea0f784a4895a849bb9f","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKDIxYzhhNGExZDlhN2U2MTgyZGU4ZWEwZjc4NGE0ODk1YTg0OWJiOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/eb302d40cbaa104d32582bdbe9f6d60d21a054ff","sha":"eb302d40cbaa104d32582bdbe9f6d60d21a054ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/eb302d40cbaa104d32582bdbe9f6d60d21a054ff"}],"sha":"21c8a4a1d9a7e6182de8ea0f784a4895a849bb9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/21c8a4a1d9a7e6182de8ea0f784a4895a849bb9f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/eb302d40cbaa104d32582bdbe9f6d60d21a054ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T06:58:50Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T06:58:50Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"chore(frontend): amplía el catálogo de láminas tematizadas a tres más\n\nEl generador solo reconocía los hex de las primeras láminas: los que traían\nundraw en otras (el segundo tono de marca, el verde de los checks, dos\nvariantes más de piel, el gris de fondo) quedaban en crudo y se veían igual\nen claro que en oscuro. Se amplía el mapa de color con esos siete y se\nañaden dos tokens nuevos —`--illus-fill-subtle` y `--illus-success`— con su\npar para modo oscuro.\n\nTambién se retira el `<title>` en inglés que algunos SVG de undraw traen\ndentro: el nombre accesible tiene que salir del prop `title`, no del archivo,\no el lector de pantalla anuncia dos cosas distintas.","tree":{"sha":"eabd57f279841cf89b77295b3ffb3ce7f8bf0223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/eabd57f279841cf89b77295b3ffb3ce7f8bf0223"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/eb302d40cbaa104d32582bdbe9f6d60d21a054ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/eb302d40cbaa104d32582bdbe9f6d60d21a054ff","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKGViMzAyZDQwY2JhYTEwNGQzMjU4MmJkYmU5ZjZkNjBkMjFhMDU0ZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/05c9f7301c79b407e2170e9deabc4fc75934a0a2","sha":"05c9f7301c79b407e2170e9deabc4fc75934a0a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/05c9f7301c79b407e2170e9deabc4fc75934a0a2"}],"sha":"eb302d40cbaa104d32582bdbe9f6d60d21a054ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/eb302d40cbaa104d32582bdbe9f6d60d21a054ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/05c9f7301c79b407e2170e9deabc4fc75934a0a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T06:55:30Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T06:55:56Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"merge(develop): integra el flujo de cotizaciones con la jerarquía de áreas\n\nTres conflictos, resueltos combinando en vez de eligiendo:\n\n- `request-visibility`: las dos ramas ampliaban la visibilidad por lados\n  distintos —origin añadía «asignado a mí» y la mesa actual\n  (`currentAreaId`), este lado añadía el subárbol de áreas—. Quedarse con\n  una habría dejado ciega a Compras o al director. Ahora el subárbol vale\n  por los dos lados, origen y mesa actual, en la lista y en el detalle.\n  Las pruebas del organigrama ya no ubican las ramas del OR por índice:\n  el OR creció y posicionarlas a mano se rompía con cada rama nueva.\n\n- `core-service/package.json`: formato y scripts de este lado (el otro lo\n  reindentó a 4 espacios y no traía `seed:proveedores` ni\n  `probar:frontera`), más `pdf-lib`, que sí es dependencia nueva.\n\n- `supplier-topnav`: borrado aquí al unificar la navegación en una barra\n  lateral. Se conserva lo único que origin le añadía —la entrada\n  «Cotizaciones»— portada a `supplier-sidebar` con icono Tabler.","tree":{"sha":"d74605e61b73bdc056c0730847a1d1776a27d60a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/d74605e61b73bdc056c0730847a1d1776a27d60a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/05c9f7301c79b407e2170e9deabc4fc75934a0a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_