hub.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/ae9dabfd03fd778e1ebc25768fb2ba464b09245b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168861989?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gust2050308","id":168861989,"login":"gust2050308","node_id":"U_kgDOChChJQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/ecd1c059c3583ed785d3ce19b77c71cd83238434/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T06:15:38Z","email":"gust20503@gmail.com","name":"gust2050308"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T06:15:38Z","email":"gust20503@gmail.com","name":"gust2050308"},"message":"merge(develop): integra develop y resuelve conflictos de cotizaciones\n\nSeis archivos en conflicto, por tres causas distintas:\n\n- El mismo bug arreglado en paralelo en las dos ramas. En el adaptador de\n  Gmail (587 que se cuelga en el STARTTLS) se conserva el superconjunto:\n  puerto configurable por GMAIL_SMTP_PORT sobre el 465 de develop, más el\n  saneado de espacios de la contraseña de aplicación. En users.service el\n  arreglo de develop es más amplio —mueve la adscripción a la membresía—,\n  así que manda el suyo y solo se conserva la nota del porqué el error no\n  rompía la compilación.\n\n- Campos añadidos por ambos lados a la misma estructura: `trackingMode`\n  (develop) convive con `categoryId`/`specs`/proveedor habitual (esta rama)\n  en TenantProduct, su mapper y el contrato de catálogo. Son complementarios.\n\n- El retoque del tamaño de la ilustración que develop hizo en\n  requests-content.tsx se reaplica en use-request-transitions.tsx, que es\n  adonde el refactor de esta rama movió esa maquinaria: quedarse con \"lo\n  nuestro\" a secas lo habría perdido en silencio.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3ee87c2ee4ae66bbaefe8c7d5b7c478a50d0ad36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/3ee87c2ee4ae66bbaefe8c7d5b7c478a50d0ad36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/ecd1c059c3583ed785d3ce19b77c71cd83238434","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168861989?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gust2050308","id":168861989,"login":"gust2050308","node_id":"U_kgDOChChJQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gust2050308","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/J