026-08-19T02:19:32Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"chore(auth-service): agrega el probador de competencia y escalamiento de áreas\n\n`pnpm --filter @sapoc/auth-service probar:areas` comprueba contra la base real\nlas dos reglas nuevas: que el privilegio sin capacidad del área no autoriza, y\nque el reparto sube por el organigrama hasta la mesa competente más cercana.\nSolo lee, no modifica nada.","tree":{"sha":"6dd37f260ca189eb08ea9d4c0a6aac93fd052e5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/6dd37f260ca189eb08ea9d4c0a6aac93fd052e5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/5bde117c51286aed2db28b08d5a43a26173e8567","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/5bde117c51286aed2db28b08d5a43a26173e8567","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKDViZGUxMTdjNTEyODZhZWQyZGIyOGIwOGQ1YTQzYTI2MTczZTg1Njc","parents":[{"html_url":"h