rred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/06fdf424f2e51347159d0f8a4cb2aa9c3955014d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:13:07Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:13:07Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"Merge branch ''develop'' de origin en develop\n\nIntegra los catálogos unificados y el chat de proveedores (PR #25) con los doce\ncommits locales de adscripción, patrimonio y shell.\n\nTres conflictos, todos en el frontend:\n\n- `tailwind.config.ts`: puramente aditivo — conviven los keyframes del riel del\n  TransitionDialog (`rail-draw`, `rail-travel`) y los de los menús de la barra\n  (`menu-down`, `menu-up`).\n- `app-topnav.tsx`: se conservan los imports nuevos que el cuerpo ya usa\n  (`useHoverMenu`, `GlobalDataRefresh`) y se mantienen fuera `Badge`,\n  `ancestors` y `useAreasStore`, que quedaron muertos al mover la adscripción a\n  la pestaña del ModulePageWrapper.\n- `platform-topnav.tsx`: el botón «Más» toma el API del menú por hover\n  (`alternar`/`abrir`/`cerrar`/`montado`) porque `setOpen` ya no existe tras el\n  merge, conservando el riel (`railCell`) que comparte con las pestañas; el\n  panel adopta el despliegue animado entrante.\n\n`tsc --noEmit` limpio sobre el resultado.","tree":{"sha":"4d5584f23037ac9e92f2f99b371a715bfc84610f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/4d5584f23037ac9e92f2f99b371a715bfc84610f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/06fdf424f2e51347159d0f8a4cb2aa9c3955014d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"v