01db02d1eaf","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKGY1YTIwZTE0MjExZmY0MTgwMmFlNTUyZTBlYjE1MDFkYjAyZDFlYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/83c1db9dab395f7a9af83e31eda60c99e7b4fbe4","sha":"83c1db9dab395f7a9af83e31eda60c99e7b4fbe4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/83c1db9dab395f7a9af83e31eda60c99e7b4fbe4"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/1eaeee1eaea4b87522d9ca337f30de38c662812f","sha":"1eaeee1eaea4b87522d9ca337f30de38c662812f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/1eaeee1eaea4b87522d9ca337f30de38c662812f"}],"sha":"f5a20e14211ff41802ae552e0eb1501db02d1eaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/f5a20e14211ff41802ae552e0eb1501db02d1eaf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/457b306115ea8d9550e2e37b57bc61dcb43bab83/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:04:03Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:04:03Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(frontend): lleva el patrimonio al DataTable estándar y a la anatomía de módulo\n\nEl listado de bienes era una <table> a mano con sus propios <Th> y <Td>: el\núnico del sistema que no se podía ordenar, ni recortar en columnas, ni exportar.\n`AssetsTable` se apoya en el DataTable estándar, que ya trae selección, orden,\ndensidad, visibilidad de columnas, exportación, paginación y acciones por fila.\n\nLa búsqueda y los filtros siguen resolviéndose contra el servidor y llegan como\n`toolbar`, con el filtro global del DataTable apagado — mismo criterio que\nRequestsTable. Con los dos encendidos habría dos cajas buscando cosas distintas:\nuna el patrimonio completo, la otra solo la página descargada.\n\nLa pantalla deja de pintar su propia cabecera y usa las piezas de módulo\n(`ModuleSummaryRow`, `ModuleStat`), ahora que el título sale del shell.\n`useAssets` acepta `enabled`: sin él, un filtro a medio armar se traía el\ninventario entero del tenant para descartarlo acto seguido.","tree":{"sha":"863f1ad96d60d098dbbd1e58b7e78020b1094322","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/863f1ad96d60d098dbbd1e58b7e78020b1094322"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/457b306115ea8d9550e2e37b57bc61dcb43bab83","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/457b306115ea8d9550e2e37b57bc61dcb43bab83","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKDQ1N2IzMDYxMTVlYThkOTU1MGUyZTM3YjU3YmM2MWRjYjQzYmFiODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/95415d9c2ec71fd6a26b0ee816b3e193e68f96eb","sha":"95415d9c2ec71fd6a26b0ee816b3e193e68f96eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/95415d9c2ec71fd6a26b0ee816b3e193e68f96eb"}],"sha":"457b306115ea8d9550e2e37b57bc61dcb43bab83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/457b306115ea8d9550e2e37b57bc61dcb43bab83"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/95415d9c2ec71fd6a26b0ee816b3e193e68f96eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:03:58Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:03:58Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(frontend): pide los patrimoniales por unidad en el alta de transferencia\n\nEran dos mecanismos en paralelo: arriba un desplegable con cantidad y, suelta\nmás abajo, una lista de «Bienes patrimoniales». Como la lista salía después de\nelegir el producto, se leía como sus existencias cuando en realidad era otra\nforma de pedir cosas distintas. Y el desplegable ofrecía también los\npatrimoniales: elegir una laptop consultaba el balance por cantidad —donde un\npatrimonial no vive—, así que la pantalla respondía «ningún área tiene\nexistencias, solicítalo en compras» con cuatro laptops listadas debajo.\n\nAhora hay un solo modelo mental: se elige QUÉ hace falta y la forma de pedirlo\nla decide el tipo de producto — cantidad si se cuenta, unidades concretas si\ncada una es un bien identificable. El orden se conserva porque era el acierto:\nprimero qué necesitas y dónde está, después a quién pedírselo.\n\nLas áreas origen se ordenan y se filtran por `transferable`, no por `available`:\nofrecer existencias por debajo del mínimo es ofrecer lo que la aprobación va a\nrechazar.","tree":{"sha":"ac3e4c65d263a34b9336cee0e0dffc6ed9d65530","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/ac3e4c65d263a34b9336cee0e0dffc6ed9d65530"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/95415d9c2ec71fd6a26b0ee816b3e193e68f96eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/95415d9c2ec71fd6a26b0ee816b3e193e68f96eb","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKDk1NDE1ZDljMmVjNzFmZDZhMjZiMGVlODE2YjNlMTkzZTY4Zjk2ZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/c5f215c2e648819e5d9b0a23e16a04ade4d9991e","sha":"c5f215c2e648819e5d9b0a23e16a04ade4d9991e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/c5f215c2e648819e5d9b0a23e16a04ade4d9991e"}],"sha":"95415d9c2ec71fd6a26b0ee816b3e193e68f96eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/95415d9c2ec71fd6a26b0ee816b3e193e68f96eb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/c5f215c2e648819e5d9b0a23e16a04ade4d9991e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:03:34Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:03:34Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"style(frontend): densifica las primitivas y traza el riel del diálogo de estado\n\nBadge, card, cabecera de columna, barra de herramientas y paginación bajan de\naltura y de peso tipográfico: son cromo que rodea el dato, y competían con él\nen pantallas que se operan ocho horas al día. La tarjeta deja de levantarse al\npasar el ratón —un elemento que flota no informa de nada y desestabiliza la\nlectura— y marca el foco con borde y superficie.\n\nEl riel del TransitionDialog se TRAZA de origen a destino (keyframes `rail-draw`\ny el ícono viajando sobre el trazo) en vez de aparecer entero, para que el salto\nde estado se lea como algo que avanza. Las láminas de los estados crecen a la\naltura que el diálogo ya reserva.","tree":{"sha":"04bc65e9046ba78adf1a0bd7cfdf07c683b14a60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/04bc65e9046ba78adf1a0bd7cfdf07c683b14a60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/c5f215c2e648819e5d9b0a23e16a04ade4d9991e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_ur