tps://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/f327147018b6ffc863ce036e3e97b36aee081e91/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:02:46Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:02:46Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"fix(invitations): envía el correo por SMTPS 465 con timeouts explícitos\n\nMuchas redes —ISPs y redes universitarias— filtran el 587 saliente: el socket\nqueda abierto sin recibir banner hasta morir con ETIMEDOUT. Con SMTPS el envío\nsale por un puerto que esas redes sí dejan pasar. Además, sin timeouts propios\nun bloqueo de red colgaba la petición de invitación unos dos minutos (defaults\nde nodemailer) antes de fallar.","tree":{"sha":"f9fb75f11fbaa2ff592647843e4f497ba0db3d98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/f9fb75f11fbaa2ff592647843e4f497ba0db3d98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/f327147018b6ffc863ce036e3e97b36aee081e91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com