tions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/38f5ca6380a4a8b824b3fd422bd91f91e45e91f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:02:46Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:02:46Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(receptions): sella el valor de adquisición al dar de alta el bien\n\nEl precio viaja en el renglón de la ORDEN y la recepción es el único momento en\nque el bien y su importe están juntos. Si no se sella ahí, después queda a dos\nsaltos (bien → recepción → renglón) y un bien sin importe no puede justificar su\nmonto ante una auditoría, que es justamente para lo que se le guarda la\nrecepción de origen. Cada ficha nace con `acquisitionValue` y la moneda de la\norden.","tree":{"sha":"25d65ffead263cd3619705a163ad64d7abb71145","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/25d65ffead263cd3619705a163ad64d7abb71145"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/38f5ca6380a4a8b824b3fd422bd91f91e45e91f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/38f5ca6380a4a8b824b3fd422bd91f91e45e91f4","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKDM4ZjVjYTYzODBhNGE4YjgyNGIzZmQ0MjJiZDkxZjkxZTQ1ZTkxZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/e76282fce8566d27f66e3ecd347a82878cbb6ca6","sha":"e76282fce8566d27f66e3ecd347a82878cbb6ca6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/e76282fce8566d27f66e3ecd347a82878cbb6ca6"}],"sha":"38f5ca6380a4a8b824b3fd422bd91f91e45e91f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/38f5ca6380a4a8b824b3fd422bd91f91e45e91f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/e76282fce8566d27f66e3ecd347a82878cbb6ca6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:02:45Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:02:45Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(assets): permite filtrar el listado de bienes por producto\n\nEs lo que hace posible preguntar «qué unidades de ESTE producto hay libres\naquí», que es como se pide un bien: por tipo primero y por unidad después,\nigual que un consumible se pide por producto y luego por cantidad. El filtro\nviaja del gateway al caso de uso como un `productId` más.","tree":{"sha":"0f0eb21765390f44029426aa6d46bda8d9083c59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/0f0eb21765390f44029426aa6d46bda8d9083c59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/e76282fce8566d27f66e3ecd347a82878cbb6ca6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/e76282fce8566d27f66e3ecd347a82878cbb6ca6","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKGU3NjI4MmZjZTg1NjZkMjdmNjZlM2VjZDM0N2E4Mjg3OGNiYjZjYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/e5e552d9126b532a9193a8a57fcef63c236b27ab","sha":"e5e552d9126b532a9193a8a57fcef63c236b27ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/e5e552d9126b532a9193a8a57fcef63c236b27ab"}],"sha":"e76282fce8566d27f66e3ecd347a82878cbb6ca6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/e76282fce8566d27f66e3ecd347a82878cbb6ca6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/e5e552d9126b532a9193a8a57fcef63c236b27ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:02:25Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:02:25Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"fix(transfers): calcula el alcance de visibilidad con privilegios del módulo\n\nEl alcance salía de `resolveVisibilityScope`, que solo lee privilegios de\n`purchase_request:*`. Un almacenista tiene `transfer:dispatch` y\n`transfer:receive` —su trabajo ES mover inventario— y ninguno de los que esa\nfunción mira, así que le tocaba `OWN`: solo las transferencias que él mismo\nhubiera redactado. El sistema le notificaba al área «TRF-000001 · confirmar la\nrecepción» y acto seguido le escondía el expediente por haberlo redactado otra\npersona. Avisar de un documento que luego se oculta es peor que no avisar.\n\n`resolveTransferScope` toma como señal las facultades de ACTUAR sobre el\nexpediente. `transfer:request` queda fuera a propósito: es la hoja que tiene\ncualquiera que pueda pedir algo, y tratarla como alcance de área daría a todos\nla vista completa de su área — el mismo error ya corregido en compras.","tree":{"sha":"30217ef9e1b8d7c2366835a2f06cfbcccf13e4bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/30217ef9e1b8d7c2366835a2f06cfbcccf13e4bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/e5e552d9126b532a9193a8a57fcef63c236b27ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/e5e552d9126b532a9193a8a57fcef63c236b27ab","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKGU1ZTU1MmQ5MTI2YjUzMmE5MTkzYThhNTdmY2VmNjNjMjM2YjI3YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/62dd679da8711dca49570fcf7fccfe7a38cdb688","sha":"62dd679da8711dca49570fcf7fccfe7a38cdb688","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/62dd679da8711dca49570fcf7fccfe7a38cdb688"}],"sha":"e5e552d9126b532a9193a8a57fcef63c236b27ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/e5e552d9126b532a9193a8a57fcef63c236b27ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/62dd679da8711dca49570fcf7fccfe7a38cdb688/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:02:25Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:02:25Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(stock): responde la disponibilidad por área también para patrimoniales\n\n`findAreasWithAvailability` solo miraba `area_stock`, donde un bien identificado\nno vive. Preguntar por una laptop devolvía vacío —«ningún área lo tiene»— con\ncuatro laptops en el almacén de al lado, y quien preguntaba acababa comprando lo\nque ya estaba dentro. Que el llamador tenga que saber el tipo de producto para\nelegir a qué tabla preguntar es filtrar la mecánica interna hacia afuera.\n\nAhora la consulta resuelve el modo de conteo y responde igual en ambos casos:\npor saldo en QUANTITY, agrupando fichas libres en INSTANCE.\n\nSe agrega `transferable` = disponible menos el mínimo del área (salvo que su\npolítica permita bajar de él). Es la diferencia entre «hay» y «se puede mover»;\ndevolver solo `available` es cómo se desabastece un área para abastecer a otra.","tree":{"sha":"99e4db2d8116f88271ff9a2ef247b57745887904","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/99e4db2d8116f88271ff9a2ef247b57745887904"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/62dd679da8711dca49570fcf7fccfe7a38cdb688","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/62dd679da8711dca49570fcf7fccfe7a38cdb688","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKDYyZGQ2NzlkYTg3MTFkY2E0OTU3MGZjZjdmY2NmZTdhMzhjZGI2ODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/fa6416d3a18146d4d43ec5e6b1ed89ed47fe48e6","sha":"fa6416d3a18146d4d43ec5e6b1ed89ed47fe48e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/fa6416d3a18146d4d43ec5e6b1ed89ed47fe48e6"}],"sha":"62dd679da8711dca49570fcf7fccfe7a38cdb688","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/62dd679da8711dca49570fcf7fccfe7a38cdb688"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/fa6416d3a18146d4d43ec5e6b1ed89ed47fe48e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:01:58Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:01:58Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(catalog): expone trackingMode del producto hasta el cliente\n\nEl campo vive en la base desde que existe patrimonio, pero no salía del\nagregado: ni la entidad, ni el mapper, ni `TenantProductResponse` lo llevaban.\nQuien lo necesitaba en el frontend acababa leyéndolo con un cast que siempre\ndaba `undefined`, así que la pantalla que solo debía ofrecer patrimoniales no\nofrecía ninguno.\n\nUn campo que decide CÓMO se pide una cosa —cantidad contra `area_stock` o\nunidades identificadas de `assets`— tiene que llegar a quien la pide. De solo\nlectura por ahora: cambiarlo con existencias o fichas ya creadas dejaría saldo\nhuérfano en la otra mitad del modelo y esa guarda todavía no existe.\n\nDe paso, `trackingMode` se quita de `TenantCategory` en el cliente: era del\nproducto, no de la categoría.","tree":{"sha":"ca88c7cc9cc1ffef103fead02b4a0e5c24a5f80d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/ca88c7cc9cc1ffef103fead02b4a0e5c24a5f80d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/fa6416d3a18146d4d43ec5e6b1ed89ed47fe48e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/fa6416d3a18146d4d43ec5e6b1ed89ed47fe48e6","node_id":"C_kwDOSgioUNoAKGZhNjQxNmQzYTE4MTQ2ZDRkNDNlYzVlNmIxZWQ4OWVkNDdmZTQ4ZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commit/9eed2641d51c529ede67efffbc74f918118dde79","sha":"9eed2641d51c529ede67efffbc74f918118dde79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/9eed2641d51c529ede67efffbc74f918118dde79"}],"sha":"fa6416d3a18146d4d43ec5e6b1ed89ed47fe48e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/fa6416d3a18146d4d43ec5e6b1ed89ed47fe48e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132586517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JosleBe","id":132586517,"login":"JosleBe","node_id":"U_kgDOB-ccFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosleBe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/commits/9eed2641d51c529ede67efffbc74f918118dde79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:01:40Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:01:40Z","email":"20223tn067@utez.edu.mx","name":"Jose Leonardo Martinez Gomez"},"message":"feat(auth): mueve la adscripción del usuario a la membresía de tenant\n\n`users.area_id` era una columna global y las áreas pertenecen a un tenant, así\nque el par (tenant, área) era incoherente por construcción: quien tenía\nmembresía en dos organizaciones arrastraba a la segunda el área de la primera.\nAl emitir el token se tapaba a la defensiva —si el área no era del tenant, se\nsellaba null—, lo que evitaba la fuga pero dejaba sin adscripción a usuarios\nque sí la tenían: sin área en la barra, sin área origen en el composer y fuera\nde la bandeja interárea.\n\nLa adscripción pasa a `tenant_users.area_id`, donde área y tenant viven en la\nmisma fila y el par es correcto por estructura, no por comprobación. La misma\npersona puede estar en Compras de una organización y en Almacén de otra.\n\n- Migración con backfill acotado por tenant: la adscripción solo viaja a las\n  membresías cuya organización coincide con la del área; el resto queda en NULL,\n  que es justo lo que el token ya sellaba.\n- `tenant_users.updated_at` para mover la versión del snapshot de permisos; sin\n  esa marca, cambiar de área nunca llegaría a la sesión.\n- `areaId` sale del RegisterDto (auth-service y gateway): el alta ya no puede\n  adscribir sin decir en qué organización.","tree":{"sha":"5ce7df589a9b38d31ea69755d683409c91cc3f1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/trees/5ce7df589a9b38d31ea69755d683409c91cc3f1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JosleBe/Integradora-9no-SAPOC/git/commits/9eed2641d51c529ede67efffbc74f918118dde79","